<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Tagin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUK gv Gamlv milambv</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUK</para>
  <para style="mt2">gv Gamlv Milambv</para>
  <para style="imt">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Luk gv Gamlv milambv</char> milinjinam si Jisunyi baanyi gubv minla hv Israel nyi vdwgv kaayanam milvkunam Ringnv gubv okv nyiamooku soogv nyi mvnwngnga ringlinkunv gubv kaatamdo. Luk Jisunyi Ahtu gv Dow lokv goklinla “heemanv vdwa alvnv yunying gvvjinv gubv,” minla lvkgapla vvpvvdu okv nyi vdwgv dinchinam mvnwng nga so Gamlv soka doolwk dunv vla lvklin jipv . Luk gv lvkpvnam so himpu vla minam gaamv achialvdo, Jisu gv aanama hum pvbwng alvbv mintamdu lvkchonam vdwso, okv Jisu gv nyidomooku bv chaakunam am minya gaam bv mindu. Jisu gv nyidomooku bv chaarobvku Kristan vdwgv kai lvlv namgv higu a okv mvngjwng ngv nyoksit siku nama minpala lvknv akin nyi si <char style="bk">Nyingnam</char> vnam kitap haka lvktoku.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aba baanyi (2) okv baakv (6) (Lvkwng gv arwnglo darlinam vnamlo kaatoka). Kvvbi Gamlv lo kaama gvrila, so doomwngnv, gaam vkv doodu, ho vdwv nyidogindung vdwgv mirimimpak minamgv higu; Svlar kaayanv vdwgv Jisunyi bvngdak lokv kaalwknam, Jisu gv vmi gvrila Pwknvyarnv naam lo doonam, okv alvnv samaria nyi lo minchisinam vla okv ngakyunv kuunyilo vla minam vdwv. Gamlv mvnwng soka minam jvngv kumnam lvga, Darwknv Dow, Jisu gv rikulo anvnyimv vdwgv reming gvtola gwngnamsingnam, okv rimur vdw ham Pwknvyarnv gv anyubv mvngnga jikunam hum dinchi alvbv mindu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arwng lokv darlinnam</para>
  <para style="io1">Mintamchonam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jon Baptist okv Jisunyi dwrwboklin kunam okv ajingbv rinam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jon Baptist gv ridungripa rirap kunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jisu gv baptisma naanam okv ninyia pokayarka kunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jisu gv Galili lo ridungripa rinam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galili lokv Jerusalem lo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ataranya hupta lo okv Jerusalem gv nvchilo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28—23:56</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Turkurkunam, kaatamsikunam, okv Ahtu gv chaakunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Ayanam Tiopilas:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Ngonugv pinko so ogugo ripvkudw hum lvkdubv awgo nyi vdwv bunugv lvgvlvmabv rikw nyatoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Ogugo ripvkudw um atuk alu lo tvvnvkaanv vdwgv doin a japkarla ngonua minji kunama bunu lvktoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Okv vkvlvgabv, ngonugv chinvpanv nga, ogulvgavbolo so minam gaam mvnwng nga atuk lokv ngo alvrungbv himpv kaapv kunv, hung mvnwngnga nonugv lvgabv jubjirvyi dubv lvkla pvji bolo alvyari vla ngo mvngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Ngo sum ridu ogulvgavbolo nonua minjinam ho gv jvjv mvnwngnga alvbv chimuso mvngla.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jon Baptistnyi bvnglin svnga mincho jitoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 24:10">1Kri 24:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Herod gv Judia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Judia</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Si Palistin mooku mvnwngnga mindu.</char></note> lo Dvbv bv rila singrilo hokaka nyibu go aminv Jakaria vnamgo dooto, nw Abija vnam gv nyibu buli haalung lokv. Ninyigv nyimv gv aminv Elijabet; hvvka nyibu buli haalung lokv. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Anyiv Pwknvyarnv gv kaagialo alvbv rila reto, okv Ahtu gv nyetin Pvbv nga alvbv mvnggapla rila reto. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Bunyi kuu kaamato ogulvgavbolo Elijabet akoka bvngmato, okv nw okv Jakaria bunyi achialvbv nyikam ongu toku. <verse eid="LUK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Alu logolo Pwknvyarnvnaam lo Jakaria nyibubv rila ninyigv kudungkua rise nga naala ridungto, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Nyibu vdwgv riching bv rila, Pwknvyarnvnaam lo nampunv mwkwmwya mwwkulo mwwnam lvgabv amin chinka sila riku lo ninyia chimpa toku. Vkvlvgabv nw Ahtu gv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngtoku, <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>vdwlo nampunv mwkwmwya mwwdw v aapv kudw nyi nyitwng ngv agumlo kumtoku.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Ahtu gv nyidogindung gonv nampunv mwkwmwya mwwku lakbik kiambv daktola ninyia kaatam sitoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Vdwlo Jakaria nyidogindung nga kaapa tokudw, nw lamla okv busuto. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Vbvritola nyidogindung ngv ninyia minto, “Jakaria, busu mabvka! Pwknvyarnv noogv kumnam a tvvpa pvku, okv noogv nyimv Elijabet nam kuunyilo ako bvngjire. No ninyia Jon vla amin minlaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Vdwlo ninyia bvnglin kubolo, noola okv kvvbi vdwv vdwgo mvngpunam gubv ririkudw! <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Num 6:3</ref> </char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Num 6:3</ref></char></note> Nw Ahtu gv kaagialo kainv nyi gobv rire. Nw opo tvngrung mare. Ninyia bvnglin rilokv nw Darwknv Dow gvnvgubv rire, <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>okv nw Israel nyi vdwam Ahtu gvlo bunugv Pwknvyarnv gvlo awgo aagv jireku. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:5">Mai 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MIC 4:6">6</ref> </char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref></char></note> Nw nyijwk Elija gv aingbv gwlwk okv kaibv gwlwk am gvvla, Ahtunyi vngchoyare. Nw lvkodv abu hala kuu vdwa lvkobv naadum sireku; Nw tvvma kaamanv nyi vdwa jvjvgv lamtv yalo vla mvngkur dukubv mvreku; Nw Ahtu gv nyi vdwa Ahtu gv lvgabv mvpvripv jidukubv mvreku.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Jakaria nyidogindung nga minto, “Ngo oguaingbv hum chinbwk sudubv? Ngo nyikam roku okv ngoogv nywng vka ongngu roku.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char>
    </note>Nyidogindung ngv mirwkto, “Ngo Gabriel, ngo Pwknvyarnv gv kaagia lo daknv, nam gaam japdubv okv soogv alvnv yunying nga minpa modubv nw ngam vngmupvnv. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Vbvritola ngoogv doin ridwlo jvjvbv rilin jinvnga no tvvjwngma. No mvngjwng manam lvgabv, no gaam japlin nyuma reku; vdwlo ngoogv nam milvnamv jvjvbv rilin maredw no choibv dooriku.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Vbvrirelo nyi vdwv Jakarianyi kaaya toku okv bunu ninyia ogubvdabvre ogubv Pwknvyarnvnaam arwnglo vkamjegu ringak dvnvdw vla mvngnya toku. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Vdwlo nw agumlo lintokudw, nw bunuam gaam minyu matoku, vkvlvgabv nyi vdwv ninyia Pwknvyarnvnaam arwnglo nyikrw go kaapv nvgo vla mvngnya toku. Gamgoka milin nyumato, nw bunuam laak lokv riringrimabv riji toku.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Vdwlo ninyigv ridung rise nga ritokubvdw nw naambv vngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Dw mego dooro kochingbv ninyigv nywng Elijabet kuu gvvtoku okv poolu pwngu go naam a vngyu matoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Nw minto “Vjak ataranyabv Ahtu ngam ridur pvku, nyi vdwgv kaagialo ngoogv hinying svnga Ahtu naala naa jipvku!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi bvngse nga mincho jitoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elijabet gv kuu gvla poolu pwkv rikulo, Pwknvyarnv nyidogindung Gabrielnyi Galili gv banggu aminv Najareth vnamlo vngmu toku. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mt 1:18</ref> </char></note> Nw gvlo nyijar agv lvgabv minji dubv doin go dooto, hv nyi ako golo aminv Josep vnam gvlo mingak jinam go, Josep Dvbv Dabid gv husi bv rito. Nyijar gv aminv Meri. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Nyido gindung ngv nyijar gvlo aala minto, “Mvngpuv nam lvkobv doolaka! Ahtu nam lvkobv doodu okv nam kairungbv boktalwkjidu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Nyidogindung gv doin lokv Meri achialvbv adwkaku toku, okv nw ninyigv gaam minamv oguvdw vla mvngdung mvngbap kartoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Nyidogindung ngv ninyia minto, “Meri, no busu mabvka; Pwknvyarnv nam achialvbv ayado. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mt 1:21</ref></char></note>No kuu gvvre okv nyilo gobv bvngre, okv no ninyia Jisu vla amin minre. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32,33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Aij 9:7</ref> </char></note> Nw kainvgobv rire okv Kaiyachoknv Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv vla ninyia minre. Ahtu Pwknvyarnv ninyia Dvbv gobv mvre, ninyigv abuapa Dabid aing gubv, <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>okv nw Jakob gv husi lokv doobwngjinv Dvbv gobv rire; ninyigv Karv ngv vdwloka ngekumare!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Meri nyidogindung nga minto, “Ngo nyijar darwk nvgo. Vbvrikunamv si oguaingbv rinyure?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Nyido gindung ngv mirwkto, “Darwknv Dow ngv no gvlo doolwkre, okv Pwknvyarnv gv loung ngv no gvlo doonure. Vkvlvgabv darwknv anga hum Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv vla minre. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Noogv amiasa Elijabetnyi mvngka tvnv. Ninyia vdwloka kuu doonyu kumare vla minyato, vbvritola nw achialvbv ongubv ritolaka vjak atuv kuu gvlaku poolu pwkv pvku. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Atk 18:14</ref></char></note> Vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnv gvlo ogugoka rinyu manamgo kaama.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Meri minto, “Ngo Ahtu gv paknv ngv, noogv minam vbv ngam rimulaka.” Okv nyidogindung ngv ninyia vngyu toku.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Meri Elijabetnyi kaalwk toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Vbvriro sopikda Meri baapubv mvgemvrap sitoku okv Judia mooku gv moodw lokv doonv banggu akolo baapubv vngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Nw Jakaria gv naamlo aato okv Elijabetnyi mvngpula raarwk sitoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Vdwlo Elijabet Meri gv mvngpula raarwk sinama tvvpa pvkudw, leit gv anga ngv biitoku. Elijabet gvlo Darwknv Dowv doolwkto <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>okv gamtv rungbv gokla minto, “Nyimv mvnwng lokv no kaiyachokbv boktalwkji kunamgo, okv noogv anga bvngjinam angv boktalwkji nama gvnvgo! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Svkvnv ogu kainv ngoogvlo ogubv ripv nvdw, v ngoogv Ahtu gv anv ngv aala ngam kaalwkyadunv? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Noogv alvpvri vnama ngo tvvpa sopikda, ngoogv arwng gv anga si mvngpula chumkar toku. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Ahtu gv nam minam v jvjvbv ho rirungre vla mvngjwng kunamv no vdwgo mvngpu vku!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Meri Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvla mirimimpak mintoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1Sam 2:1-10</ref> </char>
    </note> Meri mitoku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ngoogv haapok v Ahtunyi hartv do;<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ngoogv yalu hvka mvngpudo ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv ngoogv Ringnv,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:48 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1Sam 1:11</ref> </char>
    </note>nw nga mvngpa toku, ninyigv anyanv paknv gvbv</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Vjak gvlokv nyi mvnwng ngv ngam mvngpunv vre,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>ogulvgavbolo Kairungnv Pwknvyarnv ngoogv lvgabv kainvgo rijipv</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Ninyigv aminv Darwknv;<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>yvvdw ninyia mvngdv dunv um nw singtam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">gonv lokv singtam gonv lobv aya kaatamdu.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Ninyigv kainv laakv laklinla okv kai mvngsunv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">bunugv rungnam mvnwngnga mvyakriyak toku.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Job 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Nw kainv dvbv vdwa bunugv dvbvdooging vdwloka naalu toku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">okv nyaknyinv vdwa naacha toku.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Nw kanonv vdwa alvnv dvnam lokv dvji motoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">okv nyitv vdwa laak arobv vngmu toku.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Nw ngonugv abuapa vdwa milv kunama vvbwngto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">okv ninyigv pakbu Israel vdwa ridurbv aatoku.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Atk 17:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nw Abraham okv ninyigv husi mvnwngnga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">dvbvsingtambv aya jise nga mvngpa toku!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Meri poolu pwom gubv Elijabetnyi lvkobv dootokula okv vbvrikunamv naambv vngkur toku.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jon Baptistnyi dwrwboklin kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elijabet ninyigv kuu nga bvngkunam lvgabv dw v aatoku, okv nw kuunyilo gobv bvnglin toku. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Ninyigv namrwk ajin okv ninyigv amiasa ngv tvvpatoku vdwgo kairungnv alvnvgo ninyia Ahtu ripv vla, okv bunu mvnwngngv ninyia lvkobv himpu minggv toku.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leb 12:3</ref> </char>
    </note>Vdwlo anga ngv kaila alu pinw tokudw, bunu ninyia ayakmvu dubv aatoku, okv bunu ninyia abu Jakaria gv kochingbv vla Jakaria vla amin mintvto. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Vbvritola ninyigv anv ngv minto, “Maa! ninyigv amin am Jon vdubv.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Bunu ninyia minto, “Vbvritola ho aminv nonugvlo vkvnv amin doringnv kaama!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu ninyigv abua vmia ogu amin minso mvngpvdw vla kaachin dubv rijitoku.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Jakaria lvknvnv atakgo kooto okv lvktoku, “Ninyigv aminv Jon.” Bunu mvnwngngv lamdokpanya toku! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Vbvrire hoka Jakaria lvkodv gaam milin nyutoku, okv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartv raptoku. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Namrwk ajin mvnwngngv lvkobv busu nyatoku, okv svbv rikunam gv yunying ngv Judia gv moodw diringmooku mvnwnglo dupwng toku. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Hum tvvpanv vdwv ho lvkwng nga mvngnyato okv “Si vmi si ogubv riji nvgo bri?” Vla tvvka nyato, vkvlvgavbolo ninyigvlo Ahtu gv jwkrwv kaapadubv doolwk rungpv.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jakaria gv nyikrw kaanam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Jon gv abu Jakaria gvlo Darwknv Dow v doolwkto, okv nw Pwknvyarnv gv doin a minto:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Klvi Ahtunyi hartv laju, Israel gv Pwknvyarnvnyi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Nw ninyigv nyi vdwa ridurnam lvgabv aatoku okv bunua ringlin toku.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Nw ngonua kainv ringria nvgo jipvku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">ninyigv pakbu Dabid gv husi go.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Kvvlo lokv nw milv toku ninyigv darwknv nyijwk vdw gvlokv<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>nw ho ngonua nyimak vdwloka ringria jinvku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">ngonua kaanwng manv vdwgv gwlwk lokv ngaka.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Nw ngonugv abuapa vdwa aya kaatamre vla minto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">okv ninyigv darwkbv milvnam a mvngpa reku.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73-74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73-74"/>Ngonugv atu Abrahamnyi lvkobv gamrw go rwkmi sunam v,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">nw milv toku ngonugv nyimak lokv nga ngonua ringdukubv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">okv ninyia busu kaakumabv ririavngria jidukubv,<verse eid="LUK 1:73-74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Ngonugv singnam alu dvkiam ngonu ninyigv kaagia lo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">darwk okv jvjv kunam lvgabv.”<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:76 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 3:1">Mai 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “No, ngoogv kuu, nam minre Kaiyachok nvgv Pwknvyarnv gv nyijwk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">No Ahtunyi vngchoyare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ninyigv lvgabv lamtv nga pachola papv jire,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>ninyigv nyi vdwa minpa tvka ho bunugv rimur a mvngnga jila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">bunu ringnam a paariku.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Ngonugv Pwknvyarnv aya okv nyanyaknv.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">Nw nyido tolokv ringnvbaanv gv loung am ngonu gvlo unglwk jire<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:79 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Aij 9:2</ref> </char>
    </note> okv hoogv siku gv kanv doonyum lo doonv mvnwng gvlo nyido tolo gvngv ungka dukubv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ngonugv korla vngnam a sarsopoyo lamtvlo chigudabia dukubv.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Vmiv singchala amar lokvla dow lokv chvrvto, okv nw Israel nyi vdwlo kaatam sudw alu lobv mootum lo rito.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi dwrwboklin kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mt 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Ho gv dw lo Dvbvyachoknv Agastas Roman mooku mvnwng gv nyi vdwa kika dubv vla amin lvkdubv kanam go namlin to. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Vdwlo ritu rike bv nyi amin kiraplvkrap tokudw, ho Kuirinas Sairia gv gobunor bv rito. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Vbvrikunamv nyi mvnwngngv, atuatu gv nampum lo amin lvkdukubv vngnya toku.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Josep Najaret banggu Galili lokv Betlehem banggu gv Judia lo Dvbv Dabidnyi bvngku lo vngto ogulvgavbolo nw Dabid gv haalung lokv. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Nw ninyigv nywng bv vla milvla mingak kunam Merinyi lvkobv amin lvkgap dubv vnggv toku. Meri hoka leit lo kuu gvtoku, <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>okv vdwlo bunu Betlehem lo aalwk tokudw ho kuu anga bvnglin dw v aatoku. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Nw bvngtubvngke bv kuunyilo gubv bvnglinto, vji lo kvlap gvrila svv dvgianvnv dooku lo joopvto—hoka hotel lo bunugv lvgabv doojiku aronv karchung go dookumato.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Svlar kaayanv vdwvla okv nyidogindung vdwv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ho gv mooku hoka svlar kaayanv vdwv rongolo ayu a yupram dvla, nwbunugv svlar am kaaya nyato. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Ahtu gv nyidogindung go bunu gvlo daklwkto, okv Ahtu gv yunglit a bunugv aolo kaatamto. Bunu achialvbv busu nyatoku, <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>vbvritola nyidogindung ngv bunuam minto, “Busu mabvka! ngo soka nonugv lvgabv alvnv yunying nga aagvdu si nyi mvnwngnga kairungbv mvngpu more. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Soogv alu so Dabid gv banggulo nonua Ringnv nga dwrwboklin pvku—Hv Ahtu Kristo! <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Okv so sum nonu vbv kaachin riku: Anga go vji kvlap tvla svv dvgianvnv dokv lo doodubv kaapare.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Lamdadubv nyidomooku gv kainv nyidogindung vdwv achialvbv nyidogindung anga lvkobv kaarwksula Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvla mirimimpak minto:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Yunglit namv aoyachoknv nyidomooku lo doonv Pwknvyarnv gvbvkula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">okv mvngpuv Sichingmooku so ninyigv mvnglwkbv rinv vdwlo doolwk laka!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Vdwlo nyidogindung vdwv bunu gvlokv vngro tokudw nyidomooku lo chaakor toku, Svlar kaayanv vdwv raamisito, “Klai ogugo ripvkudw Ahtu gv ngonua minpa kunam vdwsum kaadubv, ngonu Betlehem bv vnglaju.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu baapubv vngla okv Meri nyila Josepnyi paato okv svv dokv arwnglo anga nga doodubv kaapa toku. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Svlar kaayanv vdwv ninyia vdwlo kaato kudw bunu hoka anga gv lvkwng nga nyidogindung vdwv ogugo minpvkudw um bunua mintam jitoku. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Svlar kaayanv vdwgv minama tvvpanv mvnwngngv lamdokpanya toku. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>So ogumvnwng sum Meri mvngapla okv soogv lvkwng nga rungrwngbv mvngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Svlar kaayanv vdwv bunu ogugo tvvpv kudw okv kaapv kudw ho lvkwngbv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvla mirimimpak miyingla vngkur toku: nyidogindung gv bunua minam jvbv si ritoku.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi amin minkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leb 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lk 1:31</ref> </char>
    </note> Alu kanw kochinglo, vdwlo anga nga ayakmvu dw ngv aatokudw, nyidogindung gv ninyia leit lo gvvmadwbv amin minama minla, ninyia Jisu vla amin mintoku.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vnggv kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Moses gv Pvbv gamki kolokv, Josep okv Meri bunyi kumkakjokak sidukubv dw ngv aatoku. Vkvlvgabv bunu anga nga Ahtu gvlo kumlwk dukubv vla Jerusalem lo aagv toku, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Mog 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref> </char></note> Ahtu gv Pvbv lo svbv lvkpvdu: “Kuunyilo bvngchonam dvdv nga Ahtu gvlo kumlwk jidubv.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Leb 12:6-8</ref></char></note> Bunu kobutor vmalo taakw kwpa nvvnyi go erinpeelwk dubv bvnglayila vngto, hv Ahtu gv Pvbv lokv ribwngnam ridung ngv.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ho gv dw lo hoka nyi ako aminv Simeon Jerusalem lo doodung nvgo. Nw alvnvgo, Pwknvyarnvnyi busu nvgo okv nw Israel nyi vdwa ringlinbaalin nama kaayala doonvgo. Darwknv Dowv nw gvlo dooming gvto <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>okv ninyia milv jito nw vdwloka sicho mare Ahtu gv milv kunam Kristonyi nw kaama dvdvlo. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Darwknv Dow gv riku lokv, Simeon Pwknvyarnvnaam bv vngto. Vdwlo Anvabuv anga Jisunyi Pwknvyarnvnaam lo Pvbv gv rise nga ridubv vla aagv tokudw, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeon anga nga naala ninyigv laaklo joobwng gvrila Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vto:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Vjak, Ahtu, no vvpvrungdo noogv milv nama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">okv no noogv nyira nga sarsopoyo bv vngmu riku.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Ngoogv nyik lokv ngo noogv ringlinbaalin nama kaatokubv,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>noogv nyi mvnwng gv kaagia lo mvpvripv jiku nama:<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Aij 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char>
    </note> Noogv mvngnama Jentail vdwa loung bv kaatam svnga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">okv noogv Israel nyi vdwlo yungnam gobv naalwk jise nga.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Ninyigv lvkwngbv Simeon gv minama anga gv anv okv abuv tvvtokula mvngngak patoku. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simeon bunuam boktalwkji toku okv ninyigv Anv, Merinyi minto, “So vmi anga si Pwknvyarnv gv gaknamgo mvyaknam lvgabv okv Israel lo awgo turnama paakunam lvgabv. Nw Pwknvyarnv gvlokv kachinnam gubv rire ho awgo nyi v ninyia minyingre. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Okv vbvrila kaatamre bunugv mvngsila mvngnama. Okv mvngdwkkv, noogv atubogv haapok am rioktung ripunv ako nwkko sunam aingbv rire.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36-37"/>Ho hoka nyimv nyijwk ako dooto, hv hvngmi go aminv Anna, Paanuel gv kuunyijar Asher haalung lokv. Nw anying kanw go nyilo doogvla dootokula okv vjak nw anying chaampinw gula nyingpi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:36-37 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vjak nw anying chaampinw gula nyingpi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hvngmi anying champi gola nyingpi toku. </char></note> loku ongubv ritoku. Nw Pwknvyarnvnaam a vdwloka vngyu mato; aluayu bv nw Pwknvyarnvnyi kumlajola okv yikla dooto. <verse eid="LUK 2:36-37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Ho dw akin hoka nw aalwkto okv Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv hvto okv yvvbunudw Jerusalem um vdwlo ringtv dunvdw um Pwknvyarnv gvlo kaayala doonv vdwgv apumlo vmi anga agv lvkwng nga mintoku.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Najaret lo aakur kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mt 2:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Vdwlo Josep la Meri Ahtu gv Pvbv gv minam rise nga rinya tokudw, bunyi Galili gv banggu Najaret bunugv naamlo akur toku. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Vmi hv okv gwlwk nvgobv singchato; nw chingkipakok nvgobv, okv Pwknvyarnv gv boktalwkji namv nw gvlo doomin gvto.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vmi Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo dootoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Mog 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Det 16:1-8</ref></char>
    </note> Anying dwkibv Jisu gv Anvabu hv Jerusalem bv vngkito vngbo dvmin pumja lvgabv. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Vdwlo Jisu anying nyingring gula nyingnyi tokudw, bunu pumja vngbwng nga vngto. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Vdwlo dvbamnam pumja ngv rinya tokudw, bunu naam bv vngkur raptoku, vbvritola vmi Jisu Jerusalem lo doolwkto. Hum nw gv anvabuv chimato; <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>bunu ninyia nyitwngnga lvkobv vngdunvpv vla mvngto, vkvlvgabv bunu alu logo vngkwng toku okv vbvritola ninyia bunugv amiasa lo okv ajin vdwgvlo makar raptoku. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Bunu nw am mapa kumato, vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia makarla Jerusalem lo vngkur toku. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Alu loum nvnvlo bunu ninyia Pwknvyarnvnaam lo Jius tamsarnv vdwa lvkobv, bunuam tvvriala okv tvunamgo tvvkala doodubv kaapa toku. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Nw gv chingkipakok rungbv mirwk sinam a tvvnv vdwv mvngngakpanya toku.<verse eid="LUK 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Ninyigv anvabu v mvngngakpala mvngto vdwlo ninyia kaapa tokudw, okv ninyigv anv ninyia minto, “Ngoogv Kuunyilo no ogubv svbv ngonua ridunv? Noogv abu okv ngo achialvbv mvngdwkla nam mapadubv vla rikar dunv laka.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Nw bunua mirwkto, “Nonu ogubv ngam makar dunv? Ngo Abu gv naam lo doojinv um nonu chima dunvre?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Vbvritola bunu ninyigv mirwknam a chimato.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu bunua lvkobv Najaret lo vngkur toku, hoka ho nw bunugv mvnglwkbv ritoku. Ninyigv anv ngv ninyigv vbvrinam mvnwng nga haapoklo mvnggapla vvpv toku. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1Sam 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Nyit 3:4</ref> </char></note> Jisu adwn amarbv okv chinvpanv rungbv, Pwknvyarnv gvlola nyi vdwgvlo lvkobv ayummiyum kunam gubv singchato.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jon baptist gv japgo karnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mt 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Dvbvyachoknv Tiberias gv nyingring gola nyingu bv rigvla ririlo; Pontius Pilot nw Judia gv gobunor bv rito, Herod Galili gv regvnvbv, okv ninyigv boru Pilip Ituria okv Trakonitis mooku lo regvnvbv; Laisanias Abilene lo regvnvbv, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>okv Annas okv Kaipas bunyi Butvyachok nvbv. Ho gv dw lo Pwknvyarnv gv gaam v chukrimooku lo Jakaria gv Kuunyilo Jon gvlo aato. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Vkvlvgabv Jon Jordan svko gv mooku mvnwnglo vnggoto japjito, “Rimur lokv mvngdin tokuka okv baptisma naatokuka, okv Pwknvyarnv nonugv rimur a mvngnga jireku.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Aij 40:3-5</ref> </char></note>So si nyijwk Aijaya gv kitaplo lvkpvnam aingbv:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Chukrimooku arwng v nyi ako gokdu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Atu gv lvgabv lamtv nga mvpv jitoka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Nw gv vngkubv lamtv nga dinda dubv mvtoka!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Haakap mvnwng a bagring laka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Moodw diching ditv nga mvring laka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Lamtv pakungpala nvnga dinda dubv mvrung laka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">okv lamtv alvmanv nga alvdubv mvrung laka.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Nyi opi dvdv ngv Pwknvyarnv gv ringlinbaalin a kaapa reku!’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char>
    </note> Nyitwng mvnwngngv Jon gvlo Baptisma jikudubv aato. “Tabw nonu!” nw bunua minto. “Yvvla nonua Pwknvyarnv gv mvritririt jilwk tvkulo nonu aapa mare vla minv? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Jn 8:33</ref></char></note>Vkvnv rinamgo no ritoka noogv rimur lokv lirung duku vla kaabwk dubv. Okv nonu atuv Abraham nonugv abuapa ngv vla nonu vdwloka minrap mabvka. Ngo nonua minpadu Pwknvyarnv so vlwng sum naala okv Abraham gv haalungbv mvlare! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mt 7:19</ref></char></note>Yagwng ngv singnv vdwa miami laarukbv parikla tvngtap lodobv dooyadu; singnv asi alvnv svvma nvnga tvngtapla okv vmvlo orlwk dunv.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Nyi vdwv ninyia tvvkato, “Hv bolo, Ngonu ogugo risegubvri?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Nw mirwkto, “Yvv vji bornyi go doodunv borgonyi yvv gvpamadunv um jirung laka, okv yvv dvnam dvpayadunv dvgvrunglaka.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:29">Lk 7:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lampu naayanv mego baptisma naadubv aato, okv bunu ninyia tvvkato, “Tamsarnv, ngonu ogugo rise vdw?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Nw bunua minto, “Naadin lokv naabo mabvka.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Sipai mego ninyia tvvkato, “Ngonua ogubv? Ngonu ogugo rise vdw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Nw bunua minto, “Akonvgv morko nga dvrit mabvka homajeka akonyi miyum mabvka. Noogv pwtarpaatar lo ho nyumchi laka.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Nyi vdwgv mvngtinnv kaiya toku, okv bunu Jon vnamsi lvkunyika Kristo madw vla lamrap nyatoku. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Vkvlvgabv Jon bunu mvnwngnga minto, “Ngo nonua isi lokv Baptisma jidunv, vbvritola nyi go aadungdu hv ngam achialvbv kaiyanvgo. Ngo ninyigv lvpa gv lvsup ngaka tasok dubv riyin yama. Nw nonua Darwknv Dow okv vmv gv lvkobv baptisma jireku. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Kapkak nvnv upu hv ninyigvlo doodu, amya kaplin reku okv aam akarnvnga naakum lakula ninyigv nesunglo gwlwk reku; vbvritola nw amya nga vdwa ngemanv vmvlo ramyok reku.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Jon akuaku sunv lamtv lokv Gamlv nga nyi vdwgvlo japji toku okv bunua rimur lamtv lokv linto kukv vla mintvmiru toku. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19,20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mt 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref></char></note>Vbvritola Jon gobunor bv rinv Herodnyi yamto, ogulvgavbolo nw ninyigv boru gv nywng Herodiasnyi nywng mvto, okv alvmanv ngaka awjego ritoku. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Vbvrikunamv Herod Jonnyi patwk lwktokula abuyayabv alvmanv nga rimin toku.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi baptisma jikunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mt 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Nyi mvnwngnga Baptisma jirokoching bv, Jisu nyika Baptisma jitoku. Vdwlo nw kumto kudw, nyidomooku v kokdariaka toku, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Atk 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Miri 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Aij 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Lk 9:35</ref></char></note> okv Darwknv Dow v ninyigv aolo taakw jvbv ritola holwkto. Okv gamgo nyidomooku tolokv ito, “No ngoogv pakyachoknam Kuunyilo ngv. Ngo nam lvkobv mvngpu dunv.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv Nwdw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mt 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Vdwlo Jisu ninyigv kudungkua nga rirap tokudw, nw kaila anying chaam toku. Nyi vdwv mvngto nw Josep gv kuunyilo ngv, Josep Heli gv kuunyilo ngv, Heli <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Matthat gv kuunyilo, Matthat Lebi gv kuunyilo, Lebi Melki gv kuunyilo, Melki Jannai gv kuunyilo, Jannai Josep gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Josep Mattathias gv kuunyilo, Mattathias Amos gv kuunyilo, Amos Nahum gv kuunyilo, Nahum Esli gv kuunyilo, Esli Naggai gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Naggai Maath gv kuunyilo, Maath Mattathias gv kuunyilo, Mattathias Semein gv kuunyilo, Semein Josek gv kuunyilo, Josek Joda gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Joda Joanan gv kuunyilo, Joanan Rihesa gv kuunyilo, Rihesa Jerubbabel gv kuunyilo, Jerubbabel Shealteil gv kuunyilo, Shealteil Neri gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neri Melki gv kuunyilo, Melki Addi gv kuunyilo, Addi kosam gv kuunyilo, kosam Elmadam gv kuunyilo, Elmadam Er gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Er Josua gv kuunyilo, Josua Eliejer gv kuunyilo, Eliejer Jorim gv kuunyilo, Jorim Matthat gv kuunyilo, Matthat Lebi gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Lebi Simeon gv kuunyilo, Simeon Juda gv kuunyilo, Juda Josep gv kuunyilo, Josep Jonam gv kuunyilo, Jonam Eliakim gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliakim Melea gv kuunyilo, Melea Menna gv kuunyilo, Menna Mattatha gv kuunyilo, Mattatha Nataan gv kuunyilo, Nataan Dabid gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Dabid Jesse gv kuunyilo, Jesse Obed gv kuunyilo, Obed Boaj gv kuunyilo, Boaj Salmon gv kuunyilo, Salmon Nashon gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nashon Amminadab gv kuunyilo, Amminadab Admin gv kuunyilo, Admin Arni gv kuunyilo, Arni Hejron gv kuunyilo, Hejron Perej gv kuunyilo, Perej Juda gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Juda Jakob gv kuunyilo, Jakob Isaak gv kuunyilo, Isaak Abraham gv kuunyilo, Abraham Terah gv kuunyilo, Terah Nahor gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nahor Serug gv kuunyilo, Serug Reu gv kuunyilo, Reu Peleg gv kuunyilo, Peleg Eber gv kuunyilo, Eber Shelaa gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Selaa Kainan gv kuunyilo, Kainan Arphajad gv kuunyilo, Arphajad Sem gv kuunyilo, Sem Noah gv kuunyilo, Noah Lamek gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lamek Methuselah gv kuunyilo, Methuselah Enouk gv kuunyilo, Enouk Jared gv kuunyilo, Jared Mahalaleel gv kuunyilo, Mahalaleel Kenan gv kuunyilo, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenan Enosh gv kuunyilo, Enosh Seth gv kuunyilo, Seth Adam gv kuunyilo, Adam Pwknvyarnv gv kuunyilo.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Pokayarka kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mt 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mk 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Jisu Dorwknv Dow ngv akomaring tokula Jordan lokv linkur toku okv Dow v ninyia chukrimooku lo vnggvtoku, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Hoka alu champigo dookunamv Uyudvbv v ninyia pokayarkato. Ho dw mvnwnglo nw ogu goka dvkwmato, vdwlo hum doonya kunamv, nw kano toku.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Uyudvbv ngv ninyia minto, “No Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngvbolo, vlwng sum mingvrila vtwng gobv rimutvka.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Det 8:3</ref> </char>
    </note>Vbvritola Jisu mirwkto, “Darwknv Kitaplo mindu, ‘Nyi si vtwng lokv mwng turla madunv.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Vbvrikunamv Uyudvbv ngv ninyia putung gulo chaagv toku okv nyiktap gulo nyiamooku gv karv mvnwngnga kaatam toku. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>“Ngo nam so yikungyira mvnwngnga okv jwkrw a jire,” Uyudvbv ngv ninyia minpa toku. “So mvnwngsum ngam jipvkunv ngo atubogv mvngnambv ngo yvvnyika jilare. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Vbvrinamv, no ngam kumbojobo lo, so mvnwng si no gvbv rire.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Det 6:13</ref> </char>
    </note>Jisu mirwksito, “Darwknv Kitaplo mindo, ‘Pwknvyarnvnyi kumlajolaka okv nw lvgabv rimwng laka!’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Vbvrinamv Uyudvbv ninyia Jerusalem bv vnggvto okv ninyia Pwknvyarnvnaam gv namwng mwnglo-aolo dakmuto, okv ninyia minto, “No Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo gurung bolo, sokv no atu v poklu kaato. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Miri 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char></note>Darwknv kitaplo mindu, ‘Pwknvyarnv ninyigv nyidogindung nga ortojire ho bunu alvrungbv nam kaayare,’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Si mindvdu, ‘Bunu nam bunugv laak aolo dvbwngre ogulvgavbolo noogv lvpa nga vlwnglo tupmu madubv.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Det 6:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Vbvritola Jisu mirwkto, “Darwknv Kitaplo mindu, ‘Ahtunyi noogv Pwknvyarnvnyi vdwloka rikaripakla rikw mabvka.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Vdwlo Uyudvbv Jisunyi nvgwngbv pokayarka svnga rinya tukudw, nw achukgo ayungjvma gv lvgabv ninyia vngyu toku.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Galili lo ninyigv ridung nga rirap toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mt 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mk 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu Galili lo aakur toku, okv Darwknv Dow gv gilwk v ninyi lvkobv dooto. Ninyigv lvga yunying ngv ho mooku mvnwnglo dupwng toku. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Nw Jius vdwgv kumkunaamlo tamsar toku okv nyichar mvnwng gv hartv kunam gubv ritoku.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Najaret lo toa toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mt 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu Najaret lo vngtoku, ogolo ninyia soochapvdw, okv Jius doonualu golo ninyigv vngchingbv Jius kumkunaamlo vngtoku. Nw Darwknv Kitap a puri rilindubv dakrapto <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>okv ninyia nyijwk Aijaya gv kitap a laklwk toku. Nw tibungnam kitap a tikokla okv ogolo svbv lvkpv nama kaapa toku,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Aij 61:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>“Ahtu gv Dow v ngoogvlo doolwkdu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ogulvgavbolo nw ngam gaktoku heemanv vdwa Gamlv bvngji dubv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Nw ngam vngmu toku leela vnam vdwa topunam gv gaam a japgo jidubv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">okv kaapa manv vdwa kaapa modukubv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">okv chaatinnam vdwa anyubv tulin dukubv.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Okv ho gokpa jidukubv dw v aapvku vla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">vdwlo Ahtu ninyigv nyi vdwa ringrekudw.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Jisu tibungnam kitap a taatum toku, okv kaaria riria nvnga jikur toku, okv dootung toku. Jius kumkunaam arwng gv nyi mvnwngngv bunugv nyikkv ninyia kaagap nyatoku. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Nw bunua svbv minto, “Soogv lvknam abor si silu jvjvbv rilin pvku, nonu tvvgvnyibv um rilin nama.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Bunu mvnwngngv lvkobv ninyia achialvbv mvngto okv ninyigv jwknam kioknambv gaam minama lamdok panambv tvvnyato. Bunu minto, “Nw Josep gv kuunyilo mangvri?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Nw bunuam minto, “Ngo jvjvbv mindunv nonu so nyetin sam ngam mintaknvre, ‘Daktor, no atubongv mvpu silak.’ Nonu ngam mindvre ngoogv banggu naam so ridubv, Kaparnaum lo nonugv tvvnam um ripia aingbv. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref></char></note> Ngo nonua sum mintam jidunv,” Jisu mindvto, “Nyijwk ka ninyigv banggu naam lo vdwloka alvbv naarwk suma.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Dv 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ngam tvvriato: So si jvjv ngvrung Israel lo vmiv achialvto Elija gv rerilo, vdwlo nyingngom gola patung go nyido hooku manammv okv mooku mvnwnglo achialvbv dvmayarwng ripwng toku. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1Dv 17:8-16</ref></char></note>Rigvrila Israel lo Elijanyi yvv goloka vngmumato, vbvritola Sidon mookugv Jarepat lo hvngmi ako doodungnv angv lomwng. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2Dv 5:1-14</ref></char></note> Okv Israel mookulo nyijwk Elisha gv doorilo; nyi mvnwngngv achialvbv apin yala silvmabv rinyato rigvrila yvvka poyamato, vbvritola Sairian gv Naaman mvnchik poyatoku.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Jius kumkunaam gv nyi mvnwngngv vdwlo um tvvtokudw, bunu lvkobv sakcha nyato. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Bunu dokrapla, Jisunyi Banggu agumlo tunglin nyato, okv bunugv Banggu a mvlwk koku moodw putunglo ninyia aagv nyatoku. Bunugv vbvrinamv ninyia tarak rakla bv tunglu dubv vla, <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>vbvritola nw nyitwng gv pingkolo vngpikla okv ninyigv lamtvbv vngsu tuku.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyi akolo alvmanv dow go dootoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mk 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu Galili gv banggu, Kaparnaum lo vngtoku, hoka nw nyi vdwa tamsartoku Jius Doonualulo. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mt 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note>Ninyigv tamsarku lokv bunu mvnwngngv lamrwpanya toku, ogulvgavbolo nw tujupkunam gobv japto. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Jius kumkunaam arwnglo alvmanv uyuvram dow doonv nyi ako dooto; nw gamtv rungbv svgok goklinto, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Aa! Najaret lokv Jisu, no ngonua ogugo mvngpv? No so ngonua mvyakmvchak dubvre? No yvvdw ngo chindu: no Pwknvyarnv gv darwknv gindungpingko ngv!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Jisu dow a orto jitoku, “Choibv okv nyi gvlokv agum linroto!” uyuvram v nyi hum bunugv kaakulo orpvpila okv ninyia achijeyo madubv mvpila vngyu toku.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Nyi mvnwngngv kaangak nyatoku okv ajin anying nga mimisito, “Si ogunv gamchar vkudw? Tujupkunam okv jwkrw a lvkobv si nyi si alvmanv dow a charnam v okv bunu agum linro duku!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Okv Jisu gv lvkwnglo so yunying ngv ho mooku mvnwnglo dupwng toku.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyi achialvgo mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mt 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Jisu Jius kumkunaam a vngyu pila okv Saimon gv naam lo vngtoku. Saimon gv ayuv achialvbv tamiram karla dooto, okv bunu ninyigv lvga nga Jisunyi minjitoku. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Nw ho ninyigv dookulo aala daktoku okv tamiram a ninyigv lokv vngroto vla yamto. Tamiram v ninyigv lokv vngro toku, okv nw vjakgobv gudung toku okv bunua dvnamtvngnam jirap toku.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Doonyi poggaro kochingbv nyi mvnwngngv yvv bunu ajin doopv kudw yvv bunu nvgwngnv lvvmabv ridukudw bunua Jisu gvlo aagv jitoku; Nw mvnwngnga akinakinbv ninyigv laak hv lakpv jitoku okv mvnwngnga mvpu toku. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Uyuvram vdwv segokto “No Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngvmabv!” vbvmiying dula nyi megonvgv lokv kelin toku. Jisu uyuvram vdwa yamto okv bunua milin momato, ogulvgavbolo bunu ninyia Kristo rung vla chintoku.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Jius kumkunaamlo japtoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mk 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Alu v loolin tokudw Jisu banggu a vngyu toku okv jemataiku mooku lo vngtoku. Nyi vdwv ninyia kaakar nyatoku, okv vdwlo bunu ninyia kaapa tokudw, bunu ninyia vngyu momare vla rikw nyatoku. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Vbvritola nw bunua minto, “Ngo Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lvgagv Gamlv nga kvvbi banggu loka japji rungdubv ripv, vkvlvgalo Pwknvyarnv ngam rimudubv vla vngmu pvnv.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Vkvlvgabv nw ho mooku mvnwng gv Jius kumkunaam vdwlo japgo jitoku.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv lvbwlaksubv goklin chonam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mt 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1">Mt 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mk 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char>
    </note>Alu golo Jisu Gennesaret svparsvlv adarlo dakto ho nyi vdwv Pwknvyarnv gv gaam tvvdubv vla ninyigv kiambv chapcha nyato. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Nw svparsvlv adarlo svpw anyigo pucha dubv kaapato; ngui naanv vdwv ho kayupila okv vsap a kakdungto. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Jisu svpw akonvlo aatoku—hv Saimon gvbv rito—okv ninyia minto achukgo adar lokv nvnglwk tvkv vla. Jisu svpw lo doopv tvla okv nyitwng nga tamsarto.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Vdwlo nw raanam a raanya tvkudw, nw Saimonnyi minto, “Svpw a adu dubv isi arayabv tunglwkto, okv no la noogv ajin vdwv ngui naanam lvgabv vsap a orlwkto.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:3">Jn 21:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Tamsarnv,” Saimon minto, “Ngonu siyu harkwng pvnv vbvrijvka oguguka naapama. Vbvritola no vbv mindu nvbolo, ngo vsap vdwa orlwkre.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Jn 21:3</ref></char></note>Bunu vsap vdwa orlwkto okv vsap vdwa bokpwk tvdukubv achialv kaibv ngui vkv naatoku. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu bunugv ajin vdwa pudumsedum labvkv vla goklwkto. Bunu aato okv svpw anyilo ngui v aku dubv naaku namv svpw vdwv isi bv hoolwk tvvtoku. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Ogugo ripvkudw um Saimon Pitar kaagv rikula, nw ninyigv lvpa lvkwnglo Jisu gv habolo gipv tvkula okv minto, “Ahtu! ngoogv lokv vngroto, ngo rimurnv nyi vla!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Nw okv ninyia lvkobv rinv kvvbi mvnwngngv bunugv achialvbv ngui naakunama kaangak nyatoku. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Saimon gv ribam ajin Jibedi gv kuunyilo Jems okv Jon bunyi ka kaangak toku. Jisu Saimonnyi minto, “Busu mabvka; vjak lokv no nyi naakar reku.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Bunu svpw vdwa segumlo pucha toku, ogu mvnwngnga kayupila Jisunyi vngming gvtoku.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyi ako mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mt 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Jisu lvkogulo Banggu akolo dooto ho hoka nyi ako apin hv yala arwnam lvvma nvgo dooto. Vdwlo nw Jisunyi kaapa tokudw, nw atubongv gipv gvrila okv Jisunyi kodwkkrwkla kooto, “Tamsarnv, no mvngduboloka, no ngam darwk dubv mvlare!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Darwk dubv mvlare: Si lvvma si nyi ham ayum asi monvgo.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Jisu ninyigv laakkv idaira linla okv ninyia mvsit toku. “Ngo vbv mvngrung dunv,” nw mirwkto. “Darwk tokukv!” Vjakgobv lvvma ngv nyi hum kayupila vngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Leb 14:1-32</ref></char></note>Jisu nyi hum minggapto “Yvvnyika minpa mabvka, vbvritola nyibu gvlo vngdavngra nyika okv ninyia jwngkadaka motoka; vbvrigvrila nyi mvnwngnga chimpakaapa molaka no poorung pvku vla, erin nvsenga jilaka Moses gv minkubv.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Vbvritola Jisu gv lvkwnglo kaiyayabv dupwng toku, nyi nyitwng ngv aala ninyigvlo tvvto okv bunugv lvvma vdwlokv pooya dukubv aato. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Vbvritola nw jematai kolo vngla, hoka nw kumtoku.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu digwngnv nyi ako mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mt 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Alu golo vdwlo Jisu tamsar rilo, Parisis okv Pvbv tamsarnv nyi mego hoka dooto hoka doonv kvgonv Galili banggu mvnwng lokv okv Judia lokv okv Jerusalem lokv aanvgo. Ahtu gv jwkrw v Jisu gvlo doolwkto lvvma nvnga mvpu dubv. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Nyi mego digwngnv nyi go gadw aolo doodubv joolaila aato, okv bunu naam arwng joolwk dubv rikwngto okv ninyia Jisu gv kaagialo joopv jidubv vla. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Nyitwng ngv achialv twngtv kunam lvgalo, bunu ninyia ogoloka arwnglo joolwk jiku mapa matoku. Vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia namwng aolo joocha toku, namwng nga mvkoto, okv ninyia gadw aolo doomu tvla soolu jitoku nyitwng gv pingkolo Jisu gv kaagialo. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Vdwlo Jisu bunugv vkvnvgo achialvbv mvngjwng kunama kaapa tokudw, nw nyi hum minto, “Ngoogv ajin a, noogv rimur vdwa mvngnga jipv kunv.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv okv Parisis vdwv bunu atu v minrap nyato, “Yvvla so nyi si svkvnvgo nyarjitari dunv! Pwknvyarnv mvngchik rimur vdwa mvngnga mvngdunv!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Jisu bunugv mvngnam a chintoku, okv bunua minto, “Ogubv nonu svkvnvgo mvngdunv? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>So si minpubv minse gure, ‘Noogv rimur vdwa mvngnga ropvku,’ vmalo miya svgure ‘Gudung gvrila okv vnglakuka’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Vbvrinam v, ngo nonua himpa more, Nyia Kuunyilo ngv siching gwngda so jwkrw doodunv rimura mvngnga dubv.” Vkvlvgabv nw digwngnv nyi um minto, “Ngo nam mindunv, gudungto, noogv kartaknvnv nga naarapto, okv naam bv vngnyiku!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Vjakgobv nyi mvnwnggv kaagialo nyi angv gudung toku, ninyigv dootak kartaknvnv nga naatoku, okv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvla, naam bv vngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv achialvbv kaangak tangak nyatoku! achialvbv busu datoku, bunu Pwknvyarnvnyi hartv yingla minto “Ngonu silu kaasartabo rungnvgo kaatokubv!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Lebinyi goktoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mt 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>So kochingbv, Jisu agumlo vnglinto, okv lampu nakumyanv nyigo kaapato aminv Lebi, ninyigv opislo dooto. Jisu ninyia minto, “Nga vngming gvlaak,” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Lebi gudung datoku, ogumvnwngnga kayu toku, okv Jisunyi vngming gvtoku.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu gv lvgabv Lebi ninyigv naamlo kainv dvmam go mvpvtoku, okv goklwknam nyen lokv lampu naakumyanv nyi ngv twngtv yato okv kvvbi nyi hvkv ta. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Lk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char></note>Parisis nyi megola okv Pvbv tamsarnv nyi mego bunugv apumlo rinvgo bunu Jisu gv lvbwlaksu vdwa miakaayala minto, “Nonu ogubv lampu naayanv vdwa okv toa kunam nyi vdwa dvbam tvngbam dunv?” vla bunu tvuto.<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Yvvnyi hv chvrv nvngv daktor lodanv mvngma dvnv, vbvritola v bunu mwng yvvbunudw lvvma dunv. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Mvngdwnv nyi vdwa mvngdin modubv ngo aama, vbvritola toa kunam vdwgvbv.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiknam lvkwng nga tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mt 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Nyi mego Jisunyi minto, “Jon gv lvbwlaksu vdwv yikla dookidu okv kumdakumra dvkv, okv Parisis vdwgv lvbwlaksu vdwvkam vbvridu; vbvritola noogv lvbwlaksu vdwv dvki okv twngki nyadu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Jisu mirwkto, “No vbv dvminchok dunvri nyidalo makburiji bongngv najibongv okv ninyigv ajin vdwa doodv mogvrila nyen vdwa ogu dvmatvngma bv vngmu dubvi? Vdwloka vbvrirung mare! <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>vbvritola vkvnv alu hv aare vdwlo makburiji bongngv bunugv lokv naarorikudw vbvrikubolo ho bunu yikrap reku.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Jisu mindvjito bunua so minchisinam sam: “Yvvka vji jenw nga ariap go pulinla jekulo hamtak lwknv kaama. Nw vbvrikubolo vji jinw nga takmure, okv ho jinw ariap v jekulo ape simare. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Yvvka anggor ala anw nga anggor ala aku pumchup lo pwtamlwknv kaama, ogulvgavbolo vbvribolo pumchup hv takla anggor ala ngv yarpok linla pumchup hv alv kumare. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Ho mabvya anggor ala anw nga pumchup anw lo pwlwk rungsego! <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Okv yvvka anggor ala aku tvnggvrila anw lodanv vla mvngmadvnv. Nw mindu, ‘anggor ala aku v alvyadu.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jius doonualu lvkwngbv tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mt 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Det 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jius Doonu alu golo Jisu ampu rongolo vngkarto. Ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv aam amring nga puik gvrila, lakchulo nepung gvrila achar ha dvto. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Parisis nyi mego tvvkato, “Nonu ngonugv Pvbv lo no Jius Doonualu lo riyoka vnam ham ogubv ridunv?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3,4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sam 21:1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Nonu puri rika malare Dabid ogugo ripvdw vdwlo nw la okv ninyigv nyi vdwv kano tukudw? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Leb 24:9</ref></char></note>Nw Pwknvyarnv gv naam arwnglo aatoku, Pwknvyarnv gvlo tolwk jinam dvnam ham naatoku, hum dvto okv hum ninyigv nyi vdwaka jitato. Kvvbi nyi gv lvgabv hv ngonugv Pvbv nga rinying kunamv nyibu mvngchik um dvnam um dvmwng dunv.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Okv Jisu minyala minto, “Nyia Kuunyilo ngv Jius Doonu alu gv Ahtu hv.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyi ako laak gonv lakpik nvgo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mt 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Jius Doonualu gonvnga Jisu Jius kumkunaam lo vngtoku okv tamsarto. Ho nyi ako dooto ninyigv lakbik laak angv digwng nvgo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Pvbv tamsarnv nyi megonv okv Parisis nyi megonv Jisunyi gungnying lwkdubv rimur lodanv mvngto, vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia Jius Doonualulo mvpu gvi jibvre vla kaagap jinjinla kaariato. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Vbvritola Jisu bunugv mvngnam ha chinto okv nyi anga minto, “Dakrap tvka okv kaagia so aato.” Nyi angv gudungto okv hoka daktoku. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu bunua minto, “Ngo nonua tvvka dunv: Ngonugv Pvbv ngv ngonua Jius Doonualu lo ogu rila dubv minpv? Ridur dubvre ma mvki dubvre? Nyi gv singse nga ringya dubvre vmalo um ngoomu dubvre?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Nw bunu mvnwngnga kaagapla kaagoto; vbvrikunamv nw nyi anga minto,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Minto; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">minto hachila</char></note> “Noogv laakkv laklinla lakrapto.” Nw vbv rijito okv ninyigv laakkv lvkodv alv tuku.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Bunu achialvbv sakcha toku okv Jisunyi bunu ogugo rila rikunvdw vla bunugv apumlo tvukapak minsi raptoku.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu vring gola anyia Apostol gubv darlin toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mt 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ho dw lo Jisu kumdubv vla moodw golo chaatoku okv ayu hoka Pwknvyarnvnyi kumyingla dooto. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Vdwlo alu hv loolin tokudw, nw ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa nw gvlo goklwk toku okv bunu vring gola anyia dartoku, bunua Apostol vla amin mintoku: <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Saimon (Yvvnyi Pitar vla nw amin minpvkudw) okv ninyigv boru Andriu; Jems okv Jon, Pilip okv Bartolomiu, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Metiu okv Tomas, Jems Alpius gv kuunyilo okv Saimon (Yvvnyi Toryagayanv vla minpvkudw), <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Judas Jems gv kuunyilo, okv Judas Iskeriot, yvvdw kupnv gobv rikunv.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu tamsar toku okv mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mt 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Vdwlo Jisu moodw lokv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv ito kudw nw mooringku gulo dakto achialvbv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv nyi nyitwng twngtv nvgo hoka aato Judia gv mooku mvnwng lokv, okv Jerusalem lokv, okv svtvpambw adar aigv pamtv Taire okv Sidon lokv. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Bunu nw gvlo tvvdubv aato okv yvv bunua alvmanv dow vdwv mvdwkmvku pvkudw bunuka aatoku okv mvpu tuku. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Nyi mvnwng ngv ninyia mvsit dubv vla rikw nyato, ninyi gvlo jwkrw v linla okv bunu mvnwngnga mvpu toku.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngpu okv mvngru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mt 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa kaagapto okv minto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Heemanv vdwv nonu mvngpuv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv nonu gvngv!”<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>“Vjakgv kanonv vdwv nonu mvngpuv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">nonua dvji more!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">“Vjakgv kapdunv nonu mvngpuv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">nonu nyormin reku!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Pit 4:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Nyia Kuunyilo gv lvgabv, nyi vdwgv kaanwng manam nonu, toa kunam nonu, mvngsa kunam nonu okv alvma vnam nonu, mvnwngngv mvngpuv! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Kri 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Nyim 7:52</ref></char></note> mvngpu laka vdwlo hv vdwv rirekudw, himpula harkwpajok laka, ogulvgavbolo kainv yikungyira go nonugv lvgabv nyidoomooku lo vvpv jido. Bunugv abuapa vdwvka vbvdvdvbv nyijwk vdwaka rito.”<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>“Vbvritola vjak yvv nyitv dunv nonu vdwgo mvngdwk rekudw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">nonu himpula singcho ropvku!”<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>“Vjakgv kitvdvlvnv nonu vdwgo mvngdwk rekunv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">nonu kanola vngreku!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">“Vjakgv nyorminnv vdw nonu vdwgo mvngdwk reku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">nonu mvngdwk reku okv kapreku!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Vdwlo nyi mvnwngngv nonua hartv redw mvngdwk hvla; Bunugv abuapa vdwvka vbvdvdvbv mvvnvrunv nyijwk vdwaka rito.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyirunv vdwa pakto laka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mt 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7:12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Vbvritola nga tvvnv vdwa ngo nonua mindu: Nonua nyirunv vdwa pakto laka, alvnvgo riji laka yvvdw nonua kaanwng madunv, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>nonua beenv vdwa boktalwkji yalaka, okv nonua alvmabv rinv vdwgv lvgabv kumto laka. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Ako nvgonv nam nyukmu tagonyi svbiak boloka ninyia nyukmu tagonyika svbiak modvlaka; ako nvgonv noogv jvtvlaklwk a naapv bolo, ninyia noogv lwkjar aka naamu laka. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Jilaka mvnwngnga nonua ogugo koopvdw, okv vdwlo akonv nonugv yikungyira nga naapv bolo, um kookor kuyoka. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mt 7:12</ref></char></note>Kvvbi nyi gv lvgabv riji laka no bunua noogv lvgabv oguaingbv rijilabv mvngdudw.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Nonuno nonua paknvrinv nyi vdwa pakmwng bolo, nonu oguaingbv boktalwkji namgo paadubv? Rimurnv vdwvka bunua paknv nga pakrwksidu! <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Okv nonuno nonua alvbv rinv vdwa alvbv rimwng dubolo, nonu oguaingbv boktalwkji namgo paadubv? Rimurnv vdwvka um risugvrila! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Okv nonuno yvv gvlo paakor reku mvngnam ma naarrwk nyumbolo, nonuno oguaingbv boktalwkji namgo paadubv? Rimurnv vdwvka rimurnv vdwlo jinama paakor rungreku mvngla narrwk dunv! <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Ma! nonua nyirunv vdwa pakto laka okv alv nvgo bunua riji laka okv paakor reku mvngma bvka. Vbvribolo nonu kairungnv amin go paare, okv nonuno kaiyachoknv Pwknvyarnv gv kuu bv rire. Nw kaalwkmabv rinv haka okv alvmanv haka ayadu. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Noogv Abu oguaingbv aya dudw vbv no ayanvbv rilaka.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kvvbia Jwngkadakanam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mt 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Kvvbia jwngkadaka mabvka, okv Pwknvyarnv nam jwngkadaka mare; kvvbia miakaya mabv, okv Pwknvyarnv nam miakaya mare; kvvbia mvngnga laka, okv Pwknvyarnv nam mvngnga re. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Kvvbia jilaka, okv Pwknvyarnv nam jire. Jvjvrungbv, no lvvpok dubv paarungre, ayabv ridur nama, noogv laaklo joolwk jire—no vdwgo bvngla dvdw. Noogv kvvbia kiinv nvnga hum Pwknvyarnv nam kiinv nvre.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mt 15:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Okv Jisu so minchisinam sam bunua minjito: “Nyikchingnv akonv vdwloka akonyi vnggv nyulamare; nw vnggvbolo, anyiv ungrung golo hoolwkre. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mt 10:24</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note>Tamsarnam vmiv tamsar sarnv nga kaiyama doonv; vbvritola tamsarnam vmiv, vdwlo nw risar minsar nama rinya rikudw ninyia tamsarnv aingbv ridukunv.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“No atubogv nyikgv nyikrw nga mvngmabv, ogubv no noogv achiboru gv nyikgv nyikrw nga kaadunv? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>No oguaingbv noogv achiborunyi minladubv, achiboru, klvi, noogv nyikgv nyikrw nga ngam naalin molabv, vjakgobv no atubogv nyikgv nyikrw nga kaapa magvrila? Kaakudubvrinv no! no atukchochukbv no atubogv nyikgv nyikrw nga naapak chotoka, okv vbvrikubolo no noogv achiboru gv nyikgv nyikrw nga kaabwk riku okv hum naapak nyureku.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Singnv okv ho gv apwasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mt 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Baboknv singnv ngv alvmanv asi svvma dunv, yaagampolonv singnv ngv vdwloka alvnv asi svvma dunv. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mt 12:33</ref></char></note>Asi svvlinnam lokv singnv mvnwngnga chindunv; No tanyum nyumki singnv lokv koksitkokrik pulama vbvmalachin hakar lokv anggor gvma dunv. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12:34</ref></char></note> Alvnv nyihv haapok lokv alv nvnga mvnglin rilindo, alvmanv nyi ngv arwnglo alvmabv mvngkum nama mvnglin rilindo. Haapok lo ogugo mvngkum pvdw vbv gaam lo milindo.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naam mvnv nyi anyigo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mt 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Okv ngoogv minam a rima gvrila, nonu nga ogubv ‘Ahtu, Ahtu,’ vla gokdunv? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Yvv akonv ngoogvlo aala ngoogv gaam a tvvdunv okv um ridunv ngo nonua kaatamre hv yvv aingbv ridunv. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Hv nyi ako ninyigv, naam ha, vlwng aolo achialvbv ungrung runglwkla okv mvnv aingdo. Isi hv achialvbv tvvlula okv naam ha tvvgingto vbvrijvka bidubv mvnyu mato, ogulvgavbolo hv alvrungbv mvnam lvgabv. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Vbvritola yvv akonv ngoogv gaam ha tvvgvrila okv hum rimanv hv vkv aingbv rido, nyi ako ninyigv naam ha alvrungbv mvmabv; vdwlo isi hv tvvlu tvkudw ho naam ha tvvgingto hv vjakgobv taba tuku—okv hv achialvbv alvmabv yaknamgobv ritoku!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu Roman nyigam gv pakbua mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mt 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Vdwlo Jisu so gv minse mvnwngnga nyi vdwa minya jito kudw, nw Kaparnaum bv vngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Roman nyigam ako hoka pakbu go dooto hv ninyia achialvbv mongrumara lo aanvgo; hv nyi angv lvvmato okv sida svngvbv ritoku. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Nyigam angv vdwlo Jisu gv lvkwng nga tvvpa tokudw, nw Jius nyiga vkv vngmuto Jisunyi tvula naam aala okv ninyigv pakbua mvpu modubv vla. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Bunu Jisu gvlo aatoku okv ninyia dinchialvbv minto, “So nyi si jvjvrungbv noogv ridur ha dinchi rungdu. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Nw ngonugv nyi ha ayado okv nw atubongv ngonugv lvgabv jius kumkunaam go mvjito.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu bunua lvkobv vngming gvto. Nw naam lokv adu kuma toku, vdwlo nyigam angv ajin vkv vngmuto ninyia minpa modubv, “Tamsarnv, atubongv agarapi bv mvsuyoka. Nam ngoogv naamlo aamu dubv ngo alvka yama, <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>vbvmaka ngooka noogv dookulo nyidum gubvrila aadu bv alvnv nyi bvka riyama. Gaam bv milin jimwng boloka okv ngoogv pakbu hv pooya reku. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Ngooka ngam kaiyanv nyigam vdwgv arwnglo doonv nyi go, okv ngoogv arwnglo ngoogv sipai vdwv doodu. Ngo so anga, ‘Vngto’ vla orto jibolo okv nw vngdu; ngo olo doonv anga ‘So aato’ vla orto jibolo hv aadu; okv ngo ngoogv nyira nga ‘Sum rito’ vla orto jibolo hv um ridu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Jisu hum tvvgvrila lamtoku; nw dakkur dakrwk dvla ninyia vngming gvnv nyitwng nga minto, “Ngo nonua mindunv, ngo vdwloka svkvnv mvngjwng go himpa tvvma, Israel arwng so lvrika kaama!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Jokjiyanv vdwv nyigam gv naam lo vngkur toku okv ninyigv pakbuv chvrv dukubv kaatoku.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu hvngmi gv kuunyilo nga mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Ayung madwbv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayungjema kochinglo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">alu gonv nga.</char></note> Jisu Nain vnam banggu lo vngtoku, ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv la okv nyitwng go vngming gvtoku. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Nw banggu gv agi lo aachinam gula, svma bvngla vnglinnv vdwa kaapato. Sinv nyi angv hvngmi gv tumpu hotum gubv rito, okv banggu gv nyitwng twngtv nvgo ninyia lvkobv reming gvto. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Vdwlo Jisu hvngmi a kaapa tokudw ninyigv haapok kv achialvbv ninyia aya kaapa toku, okv hvngmi ha minto “Kapma bvka.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Vbvrikunamv nw vngsito okv maari ha mvsitto, bvngnv nyi vdwv daktungto. Jisu minto, “Nyi yaapa bongv! gudungto, Ngo nam mindunv!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Nyi sikunv gudung toku okv gaam raarap toku, okv Jisu ninyia ho anv gvlo jikur toku.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Bunu mvnwngngv busuto okv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartv nyato. “Kairungnv nyijwk go ngonu gvlo aapvku!” bunu minto “Pwknvyarnv aapvku ninyigv nyi vdwa ringdukubv!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Jisu gv lvkwngbv so yunying si jarkar toku mooku mvnwnglo okv adar aigv mooku lo.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jon Baptist gvlokv gindungpingko vdwv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mt 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Vdwlo Jon gv lvbwlaksu vdwv so gv ogumvnwng nga mintam tokudw, nw bunu gvlo anyi gunyi gokto <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>okv bunyia Ahtu gvlo tvvka moodubv vla vngmuto, “No rungri Jon gv aainvkv vla minamv, vmalo ngonu aku kvvbi gunyi kaaya dubvri?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Vdwlo bunu Jisu gvlo aatokudw, bunu minto, “Jon ngonua nam tvvka jilabv vla vngmupvnv ninyigv aainvkv vnam hv no rungre, vmalo ngonu ako gonyi kaaya segore.”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Hoka dw hoka Jisu lvvmanv nyi mego mvpu toku, bunugv achiayakha, okv alvmanv dow vdwa okv nyikchingnv nyi mego kaapa motoku. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Aij 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Aij 61:1</ref></char></note> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Darwk mopvku</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaatoka 5:12.</char></note>Nw Jon gv gindungpingko vdwa mirwkto, “Vngkur yikuka okv Jonnyi minpa teka no ogugo kaadu okv tvvdu: Nyikchingnv kaapa nyuduku, lvpiknv vngla duku, yvvbunudw apin alvmabv lvvmanv vdwa darwk mopvku, rungjinv vdwv tvvpa nyuduku, sinv vdwa turkur moduku, okv Gamlv nga heemanv vdwlo japji duku. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Vdwgo mvngpuv yvvdw ngoogv lvkwng nga mvngngum madunv!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Jon gv gindungpingko vdwgv vngro kochingbv, Jisu nyitwng nga japji raptoku Jon gv lvkwng nga: “Vdwlo nonu Jon gvlo chukrimooku lo vnglin rikulo, nonu ogugo kaapare vla dvminpvnv? Nvmwng anw hv doorilo yapchar dubv? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Ogugo kaadubv nonuno vnglin pvnv? Nyi ako vji kaapubv gvnv gore? Vkvnv nyi vji kaapubv gvnv okv himpukain bv doonv vdwa dvbvkarv vdwlo paadunv! <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Nga minpalabv, nonu ogugo kaadubv vla vnglin pvnv? Nyijwk akore? Am hv jvbo, vbvritola nyijwk ka achialvbv kaiyanv go nonuno kaato. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note> Jon Darwknv Kitaplo minpanam akonv: ‘Pwknvyarnv minto, ngo ngoogv gindungpingko akonyi nonu gvlo vngcho more nonugv lvgabv lamtv nga mvkok modubv.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Ngo nonua mindu,” Jisu mindvto, “Jon kaiyanv singcho dvdvnv nyi lokv. Vbvritola yvvdw Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo miangdunv nw Jonnyi kaiyadunv.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mt 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lk 3:12</ref></char>
    </note>Nyi mvnwngngv ninyigv minam ha tvvtoku; bunu okv lampu naayanv vdwv yabv Pwknvyarnv gv jvjvklv nga mvngya kunv okv Jon gvlokv baptisma naakunv vdwv. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Vbvritola Parisi vdwv la Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv nwbunugv lvgabv Pwknvyarnv gv mvngnamha toa tuku okv Jon gvlokv baptisma naamare vtoku.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Jisu mindvto, “Vjak ngo ogugonyi mintaknvla minladubv svjak silugv nyi vdwsum? Bunu oguaingbv ripv? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Bunu piokpamdorpamlo vmi dopamnv aingbv rido. Twnggonv twnggonyi gokdu, ‘Ngonu nonugv lvgabv nyida sidupvbin dumuto, vbvritola nonuno harkw pajokma! Ngonu siinyimar mvto, vbvritola nonuno kapma!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Jon Baptist aatoku, vbvritola nw yikto okv opo tvngmato, okv nonuno minto ‘Nw gvlo uyuvram doodu!’ vla. <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Nyia Kuunyilo ngv aatoku, okv dvto okv tvngto, okv nonuno minto, ‘Kaatoka so nyi sam! Nw dvria nvgo okv tvngria nvgo, lampu naayanv vdwgv okv kvvbi nyi toakunam vdwgv ajin go!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Pwknvyarnv gv mvnglak kv jvjvrungbv kaatamdu, mvnwng gvlo yvvdw um mvngrwk dvdw.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Saimon Parisis gv naam lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Parisis akonv Jisunyi gokto ninyia lvkobv achin dvbam dubv vla, okv Jisu ninyigv naam lo aatoku okv dvdukubv dootung toku. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mt 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lk 3:12</ref></char></note>Ho banggu lo nyimv nvgo rimurla doonvgo dooto. Nw Jisunyi Parisis gv naam lo dvla doodukv vla tvvpato, vkvlvgabv nw pumchup golo nampunv ala vkv akomaring dubv bvnglwkto <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>okv Jisu gv lvpa koching kiambv lvpa nga ninyigv nyikla ngv sarbum dubv kapla dakto, vbvrikunamv nw ninyigv dwmw lokv Jisu gv lvpa nga tipw to, mopup to, okv nampu nvnga lvpa lo pwke toku. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Vdwlo Parisis angv um kaato kudw nw atubongv minsuto, “So nyi si jvjvbv nyijwk guloka, ninyia gakka nvnga chindu nvpv ogu nyimv gudw; ogu rimur go rila nw svngpv nvdw!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Jisu gamtv rungbv ninyia minto, “Saimon, ngo nam mintam segu doodukv.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">“Vkv, tamsarnv,” nw minto, “Nga mintam labv.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>“Ho hoka nyi anyigo dooto bunyi morko narnv gvlo morko narto,” Jisu minrap toku. “Akonv ninyigvlo ain lokdwng lwngu go narto, okv kvvbi angv chamngu go narto. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Bunyi lokv yvvka ninyia jikur nyuma toku, vkvlvgabv nw bunyi gv dvdu doonam a kayu jitoku. Vbvrikunamv, ogolo angv ninyia kaiyabv ayare?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>“Ngo mvngkanamv,” Saimon mirwkto, “Hv ho angv nvpv yvvnyi kaibv kayu jinam angv.” “No minjwk gvibv,” Jisu minto. <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Vbvrikunamv nw nyimv nvnga kaarwk toku okv Saimonnyi minto, “No so nyimv sum kaadure? Ngo noogv naam lo aato, okv no ngoogv lvpa lvgabv isi jimato, vbvritola nw ninyigv nyikla lokv ngoogv lvpa nga harkakto okv ninyigv dwmw lokv hum tipw toku. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>No ngam naam lo alvbv aamu rilo moopup mato vbvritola nw ngoogv aaro lokv lvpa nga moopup nama topuma. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>No ngoogv dumpo lvgabv olib tvli jimato, vbvritola nw ngoogv lvpa nga nampunv vkv harbum pvku. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Ngo nonua mindunv, vbvrikunamv, nw gv kairungbv aya kaatam kunam si ninyigv achialvbv rimur vdwa mvngnga jipvku vla chimu rungduku. Vbvritola yvvnyi miang go mvngnga jipv kudw miang go aya nga kaatam mvngdo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu nyimv nvnga mintoku, “Noogv rimur vdwa mvngnga jipvkunv.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Tvbul lo doodungnv kvvbi vdwv atu hv minrap suto, “Yvvdw si, rimur haka mvngnga jikunv?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Vbvritola Jisu nyimv nvnga mintoku, “Noogv mvngjwng ngv nam ringsupvku; alvbv vngnyiku.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi vngming gvnv nyimvmvvga vdwv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Ayungjvma gv kochinglo Jisu banggu vdwlo okv nampum vdwlo vngkarto, Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lvgabv Gamlv nga japgo jito. Lvbwlaksu vring gola anyi vka ninyia lvkobv vngto, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mt 27:55</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mk 15:40</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:4">Lk 23:4</ref></char></note> vkv aingbv nyimv vdw—vka yvv bunua alvmanv dow okv lvvma vdwloka mvpu kunam vdwv: Meri (Yvvnyi Magdalene vla minpvdw), yvv gvlokv uyuvram kanw go charlin pvkudw; <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Joana, Yvvgv nyilu ngv Chuja yvvdw Herod gv naamlo nyigam bv rinv; okv Susanna, okv achialv nyimv vdwvka yvv bunu atugv pwnampaanam lokv Jisunyi okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa ridur kunv.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amw chinv lo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mt 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Nyi vdwv Jisu gvlo aadung nyato banggu akonvgv kochinglo akonv; okv vdwlo kairungnv nyitwng gubv vngdum tokudw, Jisu mintoku minchisinam sum:<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Alu golo nyi ako rongolo radv chitv bv vnglinto. Ninyigv vbv rongolo amw chirilo, kvgonv lamtv korpv kolo holula hopvto, okv pvta vdwv um pala dvtoku. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Mego-kvgonv lvngtak aolo hopvto, okv vdwlo amw hv boksu tokudw, bunu sintoku ogulvgavbolo kvdw v dwsidwla kaamato. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Amw megonv yamdwng yamchum tvv pvdwng lo holwkto, hv singnv vdwa lvkobv svngto okv bunua yuptoku. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Okv amw megonv alvnv kvdwlo holwkto; agar v svngtoku okv dabak baklin toku, akin-akinlo lwnggobv dachar charlin toku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Okv Jisu minyabv mintoku, “Vbvrikunamv, tvvtoka nonuno nyarung gvdubolo!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minchisinam gv lwkwng ngv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mt 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Minchisinam si ogu v vla Jisunyi ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv tvvkato, <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Aij 6:9</ref> </char></note> okv nw mirwkto, “Pwknvyarnv gv Karv gv arwng gaam vdwa nonua chimu pvkunv, vbvritola kvvbi vdwa minchisinam vdwlo aadunv, vkvlvgalo bunu kaadu vbvritola kaapama, okv tvvdu vbvritola tvvchinma.<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu amw chinv minchisinama minbwk jito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mt 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>“Si ogu hv minchisinam gv lvga ngv: Amw ali vdw hv Pwknvyarnv gv gamchar hv. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Amw lamtvlo hopvnv bunu tvvpvdw; vbvritola Uyudvbv hv aala okv doin a bunugv haapok lokv-nga naaro toku ogulvgavbolo bunua mvngjwng okv ringnam lo doomu madubv vla. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Amw hv lvngtak aolo hopvnv yvvbunudw doin ha tvda namgola okv um mvngpula torwk sito. Vbvritola hv bunu gvlo alvbv rungrwng lo harlwk manam lvgabv; bunu miang go mvngjwng mvngto vbvritola vdwlo gwngkarika ngv aakunamv, bunu kayu toku. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Amw hv yamdwng yamchum tvv vdwlo holwknv hum mindo yvv bunu tvvpvkudw; vbvritola nyitv nyigam okv himpukain bv mvngla mvngdwk hv dooyum laku okv bunua yuptoku, okv bunugv asi hv vdwloka ngimareku. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Amw hv alvnv kvdw lo holwknv hum mindo yvv bunu doin a tvgvrila okv um alvbv haapok lo vvpv gvrila mvnggapla rinv, okv bunu asi svvma dvdvlobv rwkrwk mvbwngto.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvdurupum ako bati kyampwk lo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mk 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lk 11:33</ref></char>
    </note> “Yvvka mvdurupum a runu gvrila okv bati takmamla vmalo gadw kyampwk lo vvpvnv kaama. Ho mabvdv, nw hum tunggingnvnv aolo vvpv yadunv, vkvlvgavbolo nyi vdwv bunu arwng aarilo loung nga kaapa yadubv.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mt 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lk 12:2</ref></char>
    </note> “Ogugo vvsila vvsum pvpvdw agumlo naakok linreku, okv ogugo takmam pvkudw kaapa reku okv lounglo naalin reku.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mt 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lk 19:26</ref></char>
    </note> “Himasuto laka, vbvrinamv, nonu oguaingbv tvvdudw; ogulvgavbolo yvvdw ogugo doodudw jitam yayare, vbvritola yvvdw arochoko dunv ninyigv achukgo doonv ngaaka dvrit reku.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv anv okv boru vdwv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mt 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Jisu gv anv okv boru vdwv ninyi gvlo aato, vbvritola nyi twngtv kunam lvgabv ninyia vngming gvla nyumato. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Nyi gunv Jisunyi minto, “No gv anv okv boru vdwv agum vka dakdungdu okv nam kaanwng pvkv vla.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Jisu minto bunu mvnwngnga, “Yvvbunudw Pwknvyarnv gv gaam a tvvgap gvrila ridunv v ngoogv anv ngv okv boruv.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu dooridoogum a mvtor toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mt 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Alu logo lo Jisu svpw golo dooto ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv okv bunua minto, “Klai svparsvlv takdv gonvbv vngrap laju.” Vkvlvgabv bunu vnglinla vngrap toku. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Bunu vdwv dula vngrilo Jisu yuplwk toku. Lamdadubv kairungnv dooridoogum go rilula svparsvlv nga rigingto, okv svpw lo isi hv yarlwk raptoku, vkvlvgabv bunu mvnwngngv achialvbv busu kaapala dootoku. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv Jisu gvlo vngtoku okv ninyia mvu toku, vbv miyingto, “Tamsarnv, Tamsarnv! ngonu sida jikunvkv!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Jisu gudung toku okv dooria gaamgo gamkito okv isi sekiok hwknv haka; bunu ringin toku, okv hoka kairungbv sarsopoyo toku. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Vbvrikunamv lvbwlaksu vdwa nw mintoku, “Ogulo nonugv mvngjwng ngv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Vbvritola bunu lamrwpato okv busuto, okv akonv ako nvnga mimisito “Yvv bvri so nyi si? Nw doori okv sekiok a gamki namv, okv bunu ninyi tvjidu!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu uyuvram vdwgv naanam nyi go mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv Gerasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gerasa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gadara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mt. 8:28 a kaatoka); dvbv vdwv </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gergesa.</char></note> mooku lo dulwk toku hoka hv Galili svparsvlv takdv gonv ngv. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Jisu gv isi segumlo korpv rilo, ninyi nyi ako kaarwk sito hv banggu lokv ngv okv nw gvlo uyuvram vdwv dooto. Mvngchi kuma nvgo so nyi si vji koomabv relin nvgo okv naam lo dooma nvgo, okv ninyigv singnam ha nyibung bungpam gv lvngpwk lo relwk nvgo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Vdwlo nw Jisunyi kaapa tokudw nw achialvbv gokla kapto, atubongv ninyigv lvpa lvkwnglo gipvto, okv segokto, “Jisu, Kaiyachoknv Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo! No ngoogvlo ogugo mvngdunv? Ngo nam koodwkkrwk la koodunv nga mvrit mabvka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Nw vbv minto ogulvgavbolo Jisu uyuvram dow ha ninyigv lokv linro toku vla gamkinam lvgalo. Ninyia achialvgo naatung pvla vvkwto, okv ninyia tumla vka lakuka ninyigv lvpa okv laak ha rwngja lokv leela, nw rwngja nga dokpwkto okv uyuvram hv ninyi mvdok laila chukrimooku bv limuto.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Jisu ninyia tvvkato, “No gv aminv ogu hv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">“Ngo gv aminv ‘Mob’” nw mirwkto ogulvgavbolo uyuvram achialvgo nw gvlo aatoku. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Uyuvram hv Jisunyi koodwkkrwkla kooto bunua dotarkamanv ungrong <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ABYSS: Vbv mvngnyato uyuvram vdwa jwngdakala mvritririt alu v aama dvdv lobv sichingmooku arwng bolo arwng bolo tumla vvpvre.</char></note>bolo charlu mabvkv vla.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Ho hoka nvchilo vrik riktwng go reto, moodw lo dvkar nyala. Vkvlvgabv uyuvram vdwv Jisunyi koodwkkrwk la kooto bunua riktwng arwnglo vngmulabv vla, okv nw bunua vngmuto. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Bunu nyi golokv lintoku okv riktwnglo aatoku. Riktwng mvnwngngv chapchar minsula tarakbv riolula svparsvlv lo riolwk nyala sitoku.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Riktwng nga kaayanv vdwv ogugo ripvdw um kaatoku, vkvlvgabv bunu joktoku okv yunying nga banggu okv rongo vdwlo dupwng motoku. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Nyi vdwv vnglintoku ogugo ripvdw um kaadubv vla, okv vdwlo bunu Jisu gvlo aatokudw bunu uyuvram linrokunam nyi anga kaapa toku Jisu gv lvpalo doodu kubv vji koto kula okv mvngnamsaknam hv alv tokula; okv bunu mvnwngngv busu nyatoku. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Yvv bunu um kaatokudw nyi vdwa minpa toku nyi angv oguaingbv poyapvku nvdw. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Vbvrikunamv ho mooku lokv nyi mvnwngngv Jisunyi mintoku vngro tokuka vla, ogu lvgavbolo bunu achialvbv busu nyatoku. Vkvlvgabv Jisu svpwlo dootoku okv vngyu toku. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Uyuvram linrokunam nyi angv Jisunyi kodwkkrwkla kooto, “Ngam noogv vngkulo lvkobv vngmulabv.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Vbvritola Jisu ninyia vbv mintola vngmuyato, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Naam bv vngkur nyikuka okv minpa laka Pwknvyarnv noogv lvgabv ogugo rijipvdw.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Nyi angv Jisu ninyigv lvgabv ogugo rijipvdw, banggu lo vnggola minkar toku.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jairas gv kuunyijar okv Jisu gv vji a mvsitnv nyimv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:8-26">Mt 9:8-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Vdwlo Jisu svparsvlv takdv gonvlo rapkur lintokudw, nyi vdwv ninyia alvbv kaarwk toku, ogulvgavbolo bunu ninyia kaaya nyatoku. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Vbvrikunamv nyi ako aminv Jairas vnamgo aachito; nw Jius kumkunaam gv rigvnv akobv rito. Nw atubongv Jisu gv lvpa lvkwnglo gipvto okv kodwkkrwkla Jisunyi kooto ninyigv naam lo vngji labv vla, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Ogulvgavbolo ninyigv kuunyijar akin v, yvvdw anying nyingring gola nyingnyi mwngnv, sitv tvku. Jisu gv vngrilo nyipam hv apum bv ninyigvlo pamlwk nyato vngku mvnwng lokv. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Bunu nyipam lokv anvnyimv nvgo yvvdw oyi sarla lvvma la nyingring gola nyingnyi kunvgo; nw gv paanam mvnwngnga daktor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">daktor lo ninyigv ogumvnwng nga mva toku. </char></note> vdwlo mva toku, vbvritola yvvka ninyia mvpu nyumato. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Nw nyipamlo aalwk dabuv Jisu gv kochinglo aalwkla okv Jisu gv vji jvlap a mvsit toku, okv vjakgobv ninyigv oyi sarnam hv sarngin toku. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Jisu tvvkato, “Yvvla nga mvsit nvngv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Mvnwngngv um miasuto, okv Pitar minto, “Tamsarnv, Nyi mvnwngngv nam dooyumdo okv no gvlo nyipam bv nam pamyumdu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Vbvritola Jisu minto, “Nyi gunv nga mvsit gvibv, ngo um chinto vdwlo jwkrw go ngo gvlokv lintokudw.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Nyimv nvngv kaatoku ninyia kaapa gvi kubv vla, vkvlvgabv nw jinjinrumrum la aatoku okv nw atuhv Jisu gv lvpa lvkwnglo gipv toku. Hoka nw nyi mvnwng gv kaagialo, nw Jisunyi minpa toku ogulvgabv nw ninyigv vji a mvsit pvnvdw okv oguaingbv nw vjakgobv poyapvku nvdw. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Jisu nyimv nvnga mintoku, “Ngoogv kuunyijar a, noogv mvngjwng ngv nam alv mopvku. Alvbv vngto kulaka.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Jisu gv vbv mindung rilo, gindungpingko ako aatoku nyigam gv naam lokv. “Noogv kuunyijar hv siro yikubv,” nw Jairasnyi minto; “Tamsarbonyi vkvnvgo mindwkminku mabvk.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Vbvritola Jisu um tvvpato okv Jairasnyi minto, “Busu mabvka; mvngjwng mvngtoka, okv nw alv reku.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Vdwlo nw naam lo aachi tokudw, nw yvvnyika ninyia lvkobv arwng lo aamu mato, Pitar, Jon okv Jems mvngchik okv vmi gv anv okv abua. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Hoka nyi mvnwngngv vmi gv lvgabv kapdungto okv mvngdwk dwkdung nyato. Jisu minto, “Kapma bvka; vmiv siima kv—nyi yupmwng dunv!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Nyi mvnwngngv ninyi nyarji nyato, ogulvgavbolo bunu chintoku nyijar angv siro pvku vla. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Vbvritola Jisu ninyigv laak a gakbwng toku okv goklinto, “Ngoogv anga, gudungto!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Nw gv turnam hv aakur toku, okv nw vjakgobv dakrap toku, okv Jisu bunua minto ninyia dvnam go jila dvmuto. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Nyijar gv anvabu hv lamrwpatoku, vbvritola Jisu bunua minggapto yvvnyika minpa mabvka ogugo ripvkudw.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu lvbwlaksu vring gola anyia vnglin motoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mt 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Jisu lvbwlaksu vring gola anyia gokdumto okv rigum minggum nvnv nga jitoku okv uyuvram mvnwngnga charanvnv jwkrw haka okv lvvma vdwaka mvpunvnv nga. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Vbvrikunamv nw bunua vnglin motoku Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lvga nga japji modukubv okv lvvma nvnga mvpu modukubv, <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lk 10:4-11</ref></char></note> bunua miro kochingbv, “Moing lvgabv ogu guka gvyoka: daadwng gvyo, giagonvnv kochak guka gvyo, dvnam gvyo, morko gvyo, jekok borgu lvvya gvma bvka. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ogolo nonua alvbv aamu pvdw, ho banggu lokv vnglinma dvdvlo naam akinlo doobwng laka; <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Nyim 13:51</ref></char></note> Ogolo nyi vdwv nonua alvbv aamu mapvdw, ho banggu ha vngyu laka okv lvpa gv pvmar haka kaklu laka bunua rirw mvrw chonam aing gubv.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv vngtoku nampum mvnwnglo vnggola, Gamlv a japji toku okv mooku mvnwnglo nyi vdwa mvpu toku.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herod gv Abwkmanam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mt 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mt 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lk 9:19</ref></char>
    </note> Vdwlo Herod, Galili ha rigvdakgvnv, ogugo ripv kudw ho mvnwng gv lvga nga tvvpa toku, nw achialvbv abwkmato, ogulvgavbolo nyi megonv minto Jon Baptist turkur pvkukv vto. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Kvvbi vdwv minto Elija aapvku, vjakgobv kvvbi vdwv krim gv nyijwk ako turkur pvkukv vto. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Herod minto, “Ngo Jon gv dumpo nga paa pvnv; vbvritola so nyi si yvv bvri ngo soogv lvga nga tvvdu?” Okv nw Jisunyi kaadubv vla rikwng to.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu hejar angu nyi vdwa dvnam dvmu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mt 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-34">Mk 6:30-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Apostol vdwv aakur toku okv bunugv rinam mvnwngnga Jisunyi minpa jitoku. Nw bunuam nw gv lvkobv naatoku, okv bunu atuhv Betsaida vnam banggu akolo vngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Vdwlo nyipam hv ho gv lvga um tvvpa tvkudw, bunu ninyia vngming gvtoku. Nw bunua alvbv aamu tuku, bunua Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lvga nga japji toku, okv dinchinv vdwa mvpu jitoku.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Vdwlo doonyi hv pokga tvvtokudw, lvbwlaksu vring gola anyiv nw gvlo aatoku okv minto, “Nyi vdwa vngmu tukuka ogulvgavbolo bunu nampum vdwlo okv rongo rwktak vdw soka vngla dvnam okv yupku paamu tvka, ogulvgavbolo so si jvmataiku mooku go.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Vbvritola Jisu bunua minto, “Nonu atu hv bunua dvnam go jila dvmu tvka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Bunu mirwkto, “Ngonu mvnwng gvlo vtwng takngu gola ngui nvnyi gomwng. No ngonua vngla so nyipam mvnwng gv lvgabv dvnam rvvkar teka mvngdure?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>(Hoka nyiga vdwv hejar angu gobv ritoku)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa mintoku, “Nyi vdwa nyipamlo chamngu-chamngu bv mvgvrila doomu tvka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwgv svbv mvro kochingbv, <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Jisu vtwng takngu okv ngui nvnyi a naatoku, nyidomooku bv kaadung to, um Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vto, um pimwktoku, okv um lvbwlaksu vdwa jitoku nyi vdwlo ormu dubv. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Bunu mvnwngngv dvtoku okv dvgu nyatoku, okv lvbwlaksu vdwv dvlv nga paapi vring gola anyigo naakum toku.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu yvvdw um Pitar gv milin kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mt 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mk 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Alu logo lo Jisu akinv kumla doorilo, lvbwlaksu vdwv nw gvlo aatoku. Nw bunua tvvkato “Nyipam v nga yvv vla mindu?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mt 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Lk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>Bunu mirwkto, “Megonv nam Jon Baptist kv vdu.” “Kvvbi vdwv nam Elija kv vla mindu, kvvbi vdwv vbv mindungdo krimklu gv nyijwk go turkur pvku vla.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>
    </note> Nw bunua tvvkato, “Nonu gvbv oguhv?” “Nonu ngam oguhv vla mindunv?” Pitar mirwkto, “No Pwknvyarnv gv Kristo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv hinchingchingla sise nga mintoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mt 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mk 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu bunua mingap linlinla minto sum yvvnyika minji mabvkv vla. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Nw bunua mintato, “Nyia Kuunyilo ngv hinching rungre okv nyigagaatv vdwgv, butv vdwgv, okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwgv toa kunam gobv rire. Ninyi mvki reku, vbvritola alu loom kochingbv nw turkur reku.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14:27</ref></char>
    </note>Okv nw mvnwngnga minto, “Yvv akonv ngam lvkobv vngming gvso mvngdunv, nw atua mvngnga sitola, alu gv loki a ninyigv daapo nga bvngla okv ngam vngming gvlaka. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note>Vkvlvgabv yvvdw atu atubogv singdung nga singmu nvpv mvngdunv um ngoomu re, vbvritola yvvdw ninyigv singdung nga ngoogv lvgabv ngoomu yadunv um singmu yare. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Nyidum gunv mooku mvnwngnga mvgumrigum gvrila vbvritola nw atu v ngooya kunv gubv vmalo yaaku kunv gubv riku bolo hv ogu tuksarnam go paarikudw? Vbvrirung maare! <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Nyidum gunv ngam okv ngoogv tamsar sarlwk nama hinying bolo, vbvrikubolo Nyia Kuunyilo vka ninyia hinying reku vdwlo nw gv okv Abu gv okv nyidogindung gvka kairungnv yunglit gubvrila aari kunyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Ngo nonua jvjvbv mindunv ho megonv si doodu bunu simare vdwlo Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga kaama dvdvlo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ayak akuavnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mt 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mk 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2Pit 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note> Lokkanw dvse toku nw gv so ogu a minro kochingbv, Jisu nwha lvkobv Pitarnyi, Jonnyi, okv Jemsnyi vnggvla okv kumdubv moodwlo chaatoku. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Nw gv kumdung rilo, nw nyukmu v angu suto, okv nw gv vjiv yapung toji toku. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Lamdadubv hoka nyi anyigo ninyi lvkobv gaam raami suto. Ho anyiv Moses okv Elija, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>bunyiv kairungnv nyidomooku gv yunglit nama kaatam toku okv Jisunyi lvkobv gaam raami suto ninyigv Jerusalem lo sigv rila Pwknvyarnv gv minkipvvnam a baapu alvbv rilin jise gv lvkwngbv. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Pitar okv nw a lvkobv rinv vdwv yupngak toku, vbvritola bunu hurap datoku okv kaapa toku Jisu gv yunglit a okv nyi anyi ninyi lvkobv daknam a. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Nyi anyi gv Jisu nyi vngyu tvrilo, Pitar Jisu nyi minto, “Ahtu, ngonugv so doonam si alvrungnv go! ngonu so taabio aom go biore, akonyi no lvgabv, akonyi Moses gvbv, okv akonyi Elija gvbv.” (Nw ogugo mindungdvdw um alvbv chimato.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Nw gv vbv mindung rilo, haapam ako kaklwkto okv bunua doonyum bv nyumrum toku; okv lvbwlaksu vdwv busu toku haapam gv vbv bunu gvlo kaklwk rilo. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Aij 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref></char></note>Haapam lokv gaamgo milinto, “Si ngoogv darnam, Kuunyilo ngv—ninyi gvlo tvvtolaka!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Vdwlo gaam v minya tokudw, hoka mvnwnglo Jisu akin mvngku. So mvnwng gv lvga nga lvbwlaksu vdwv choibv doobwngto, okv bunu ogugo kaapvdw ho dw hoka yvvnyika minpa mato.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu vmiyapa alvmanv dow gvnvgo mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mt 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mk 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Logo nvnga Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv moodw lokv lvkwng itoku, okv kairungnv nyipam go Jisunyi kaarwksuto. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Nyipam lokv nyi ako gokto, “Tamsarnv! ngo nam kodwkkrwkla koodunv, ngoogv kuunyilo nga kaakato—ngoogv kuunyilo akin a! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Dow v ninyia lamdubv mvrapla okv ninyi semit taplwk modu, vkvlvgabv nw gaam lo sepit taik lindubv mvdu; vbvdvdvbv ninyia achi dubv mvbwngla okv vngnyu madubv ninyia vngmudo! <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Ngo no gv lvbwlaksu vdwa kodwkkrwkla kooto um chara modubv vla, vbvritola bunu mvnyu mato.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>“Nonu vdwnvgo mvngjwng manv okv rimurnv nyi vdw golaka! ngo nonua lvkobv vdwgo doodubv? Vdwgo ngo nonu gvlo laklwk sula doodubv?” Vbvrikunamv, nw nyi anga minto, “Noogv kuunyilo nga so aagv teka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Vmi gv aadungrilo, alvmanv dow hv ninyia kvdw lo hwkluto okv semit taplwk dubv mvtoku. Jisu uyu dow a orto jitoku, vmi a mvpu toku, okv ninyi ninyigv abua jikur toku. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Nyi mvnwngngv Pwknvyarnv gv kairungnv jwkrw a kaala lamrwpanya toku.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Jisu ninyigv sise lvkwng nga lvkodv mintoku</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mt 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Nyi vdwv vjaklodvbv lamrwpanyato Jisu gv ogu mvnwng ridung nama, vdwlo nw ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto kudw, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Mvngpa mabv riyoka ngo nonua ogugo mintam tvdudw! Nyia Kuunyilo nga nyi vdwgv laak lo laklwk tvduku.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Vbvritola lvbwlaksu vdwv chimato ho gv minam v ogu vdw. Bunugv lokv si toosi nam gubv rito vkvlvgabv bunu hum chinyu maatoku, okv ho gv lvga nga bunu ninyia tvvka svngaka busu nyatoku.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yvvla kaiyachoknv?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mt 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lvbwlaksu vdwv bunugv lokv yvvdw kaiyachok jinv vla larmisinya toku. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Jisu chintoku bunu ogugo mvngdung dudw, vkvlvgabv nw vmi ako naatoku, nw gvlo dakmu toku, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char></note> Okv bunua minto, “Yvvdw ngoogv amin bv so vmi sum alvbv torwk sidunv, nga torwk sinamv; okv yvvdw nga torwk sidunv, nga imu nvnga ka torwk sidunv. Vkvlvgabv nonu mvnwng gvlo yvvdw miangyachok dunv hv kaiyachok nvngv.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yvvdw nonua rinying madunv hv nonu gvngv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mk 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Jon minto, “Tamsarnv, ngonu nyi ako noogv amin lokv uyuvram charlin nvgo kaapa tvbv okv ngonu ninyia mintorto, ogulvgavbolo nw ngonugv rikulo rinvma.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>“Ninyia mintor dubv rikw nyayo ka,” Jisu Jonnyi okv kvvbi lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Ogulvgavbolo yvv nonua rinying maadudw hv nonu gvngv.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samaritan nampum hv Jisunyi naarwk manam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Jisunyi nyidomooku bv naachadw hv kvnwk lvlv toku, nw mvngnam a mvngbwk datoku okv Jerusalem lo vngdubv ninyigv lamtvlo vnglintoku. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Nw gindungpingko vkv vngcho moto, v samaria nampum arwnglo vngto ninyigv lvgabv ogumvnwngnga paala mvkimvak pvvdukubv. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Vbvritola nyi vdwv ninyia naarwk sima toku, ogulvgavbolo ho v nw ninyigv lamtv nga Jerusalem bv vngdu vla abwk toku. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2Dv 1:9-16</ref></char></note> Vdwlo lvbwlaksu Jems okv Jon hum kaatokudw, bunu minto, “Ahtu, no ngonua nyidomooku tolokv vmv go goklu la bunua guyak guchak modubv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo lvktamdu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Elija gv rinam jvbv.</char></note> mvngdure?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Jisu dakrwk la bunua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo lvktamdu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">okv mintoku, “Nonu chima nonu ogu dow lo doodu nvdw; vkvlvga nyia kuunyilo ngv nyi gv svngtung a mvyak tebv aama, vbvritola bunua ringya tebv.”</char></note> yamto. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv kvvbi nampum lo vngtoku.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi reming gvnam gv arv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mt 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Vbv bunugv lamtvlo bunu vngdungrilo, nyi ako Jisunyi minto, “No Ogolo vngdaka nam ngo vngming gvvre.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Haaringpaksar ngv ungrung doonyado, okv pvta ngv asup doosu nyadu, vbvritola Nyia Kuunyilo ngv oguloka karku guka okv doonu jiku guka kaayama.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Nw kvvbinyi akonyika minto, “Nga vngming gvlaak.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Vbvritola ho nyi angv minto, “Tamsarnv, atukchochukbv nga vngkur mola okv ngoogv abunyi svma riiso molabv.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Sinv nga bunugv svma nga risu motoka. No vngnyika Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga japgo tvka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1Dv 19:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kvvbinyi akonv minto, “Ngo nam vngming gvvre vbvritola atokchochukbv nga ngoogv vpin a alvbvka vmu labv.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Jisu nw a minto, “Yvvnyi akonv kvdw a gwor raptokula okv vbvrinamv kochingbv kaakor dvdvnv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo rinv nvdu bv rima dunv.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu chamkanw gula anyia vnglin motoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>So kochingbv Jisu kvvbi nyiga vkv chamkanw gula anyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Chamkanw gula anyi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">chamkanw</char></note> go gokla, nw atu v vngjiku banggu mvnwnglo okv mooku lo anyi anyibv vngcho moto. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mt 9:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref></char></note> Nw bunua minto, “Aam nvvse ngv hoka achialv duku, hum nvvji nvngv miang gumwng. Kumtoka aam atu gv lvgabv nw aam nvvji nvnga vnglin more ninyigv aam nvvse um nvvmure. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mt 10:16</ref></char></note> Vngnyika! ngo nonua svcha chaapamlo svlar vdw jebv vngmu gvrinvla <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mt 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mk 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Lk 9:3-5</ref></char></note>Nonu morko vgianvnv, vmalo giagonvgv chapa vmalo lvsup; lamtvlo nyi vdwa alvpvri vla minam a topu mabvka. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Vdwlo nonu naam ako gv arwng aarinyi, atokcho bv minlaka ‘So naam soka mvngpu v lvkobv doolaka.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Hoka sarsopoyonv nyi go doodu bolo, nonugv sarsopoyo ngaaka ninyigvlo doolwk molaka; vkv kaama bolo, nonugv sarsopoyo nga naakur lakuka. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Tim 5:18</ref></char></note>Ho gv naam akinlo doobwng laka, dvdunglaka okv tvngdung laka oguggo nw nonua jilin dudw, rinv nga ninyigv rijo nga jirung dunv. Naam namgunv lokv kvvbi namgu nvlo vnggo mabvka. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Vdwlo nonu banggu ako gv arwnglo vngrikudw okv alvbv aamu pvkulo, ogu go nonua mvpvripv jipvdw dvlaka, <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>ho banggu gv lvvma nvnga mvpu jilaka, okv hoka nyi vdwa minlaka ‘Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv nonu lo nvchibv aapvku vla.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10,11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Nyim 13:51</ref></char></note> Vbvritola vdwlo nonu banggu akolo vngridw okv alvbv aamu mapvlo, vnglin lakuka lamtvlo hoka minlaka, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘nonugv banggu gv dwmar ngonugv lvpalo doonv haka ngonu nonua rinying bv mvlu jidunv. Vbvritola mvnggap laka Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv aapvku nonugv nvchilo!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Atk 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mt 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mt 10:15</ref></char></note>Ngo nonua milv jidunv Jwngkadaka Alu lo Pwknvyarnv ho banggu um svnga Sodom a kaiyago aya kaatamre!<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngjwng manv banggu vdwv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mt 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Aij 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Eje 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Jol 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Jek 9:2-4</ref></char>
    </note>“Chorajin! no lvgabv vdwgo mvngdwk dwknam gubv rire, Betsaida! no lvgabvka vdwgo mvngdwk dwknam gubv rire, nonu gvlo lamrwpadubv mvkunam vdwa Taire okv Sidon lo rinv guilo, ho gv nyi vdwv krim doopam dukunvpv, tagiam vjia kooto kula okv mvchu a bunu atu v harbum sitokula, nw bunu rimur lokv mvngdin dukunv vla kaatam bvku ripv kunvpv! <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Nonu am svnga kaiyago Pwknvyarnv Taire okv Sidon ha aya kaatamre Jwngkadaka Alu lo. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Aij 14:13-15</ref></char></note>Karparnaum! Okv no lvgabv, no atu hv nyidomooku ao tolo harsa sidubv mvngdure? Nam uyumooku bolo paalu rinvla!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char>
    </note>Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Yvv bunu nonua tvriadunv hv ngamka tvriadunv; yvv bunu nonua toa dunv hv ngamka toa dunv; okv yvv bunu nga toa dunv hv nga so imu nvngaka toa dunv.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chamkanw gula anyi gv aakur kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Nyiga chamkanw kanw gula anyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Chamkanw gula anyi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu chamkanw (kaatoka bars 1)</char></note> vdwv aakur toku kairungbv himpula. “Ahtu” bunu minto, “Uyuvram vka tvvdu vdwlo ngonu noogv amin bv bunua mintodw!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Ngo Uyu nga nyidomooku lokv dooriak jvbv hoolu dubv kaato. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Tvriato! ngo nonua jwkrw a jipv kunv, vkvlvgabv nonu tabw vdwgv okv dwkung vdwgv aolo vngla dukubv okv nyimak gv jwkrw mvnwngnga rigum yadubv, okv nonua ogugoka alvmanv rika madubv. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Vbvritola alvmanv dow vdwv nonua tvvdu vla himpu mabvka, vmabvya himpu yalaka ogulvgavbolo nonugv amina nyidomooku tv lvkpv yadu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv himpunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mt 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Ho dw lo Jisu himputo Darwknv Dow<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Darwknv Dow doonam; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dow lokv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvbi lo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nw gv dow lo</char></note> doonam lvkwng lokv okv minto, “Abu, nyidomooku gvla Sichingmooku gv Ahtu! Ngo nam umbonyika mvngdunv ogulvgavbolo no chima nvnga kaatam jikunam lvgalo noogv chinkichiak okv chinvpanv lokv vvsivrum nama. Vmabv Abu si noogv mvnggv rila rimu nvpv mvngnam a rimunamv.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:5">Jn 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char>
    </note> “Ngo gv Abu nga ogumvnwng nga jito. Kuunyilo ngv yvvdw um yvvka chinv kaama Abu mvngchik chindu, okv Abu yvvdw um yvvka chinv kaama Kuunyilo mvngchik okv Kuunyilo gv ninyia kaatam dukubv vla darkunam vdwv.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa dakrwk toku okv bunua minsila minto, “Nonuno gamdak nvgo laka nonugv ogu kaadubv mvngnam a nonu kaapa mindu! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Ngo nonua mintam jidunv vdwnv nyijwk vdwv okv kvvbi vdwv nonugv kaanam um kaanwng nyato, vbvritola bunu kaala matoku, okv nonugv tvvnam hum bunu tvngnwngto vbvritola bunu tvvpa kuma toku.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alvnv Samaritan gvlo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mt 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref></char>
    </note> Pvbv tamsarnv ako aato okv Jisunyi mingkup tvvto. “Tamsarnv,” nw tvuto, “Turbwngla singnam a paanam lvgabv ngo ogugo rise gubvre?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Darwknv Kitaplo ogu vla minpv? Okv um no oguaingbv japjidunv?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Det 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leb 19:18</ref></char>
    </note>Nyi angv mirwkto, “Atunyi, noogv Pwknvyarnvnyi no haapok mvnwng lokv, noogv yalu mvnwng lokv, noogv gwlwk mvnwng lokv, okv noogv mongrumara mvnwng lokv; okv no atu hv oguaingbv paksu dudw vkv aingbv noogv namrwk ajin a pakmi sulaka.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Leb 18:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“No alvbv mingvnyibv,” Jisu mirwk suto; “sum rilaka okv no turriku.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Vbvritola Pvbv tamsarnv nyi angv atu v abwk nvpv mvngtoku, vkvlvgabv nw Jisunyi tvvkato, “Yvvla ngoogv namrwk doobam ajin v?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Ho hoka nyi ako dooto, nw Jerusalem lokv Jeriko bv idungto ho ninyia dvchotvnglanv nyi vdwv naatungto, ninyia vji pibinto, okv achialvbv dvngto, siloyasi dubv mvtola kayuto. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Hum hoka vbv rimutvla lamtv hoka nyibu ako idungto; vbvritola nyibu angv nyi anga vdwlo kaapa tokudw, nw vngyela, kvvbi lamtvbv vngto. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Vbvdvdvbv Libait ako vngtato, vngsito okv nyi anga kaato, okv vbvrikunamv vngyela, kvvbi lamtvbv vngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33,34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2Kri 28:15</ref></char></note>Vbvritola samaritan ako ho lamtvlo vngdung nvgo aala nyi angv gv dookulo aato, okv vdwlo nw ho nyi anga kaatokudw, ninyigv haapok hv aya mvngpa toku. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Nw nyi angv gv dookulo aato, nyi angv gv ungvlo tvli okv opo pwbumto okv hum putum toku; vbvrikunamv nw ho nyi a ninyigv svnwng aolo joopvto okv hotel golo baklwk toku, hoka nw nyi anga ringchum yatoku. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Alu logo nvlo nw ain lokdwng charnyi go naalinto okv hum ringchum nvnga jitoku. ‘Ninyia ringchum laka,’ nw ringchum nvnga mintoku, ‘okv vdwlo ngo so lamtvbv vngkur rikudw, no nyi so gv lvgabv ogugo ngoopvdw um ngo nam jireku.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Okv Jisu minyabv minto, “Noogv mvngnam lokv, so nyi aom sokv yvvla namrwk ajin jvbv ripvnv dvchonv nyi vdwgv dvngnam nyi anga?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Pvbv tamsarnv angv mirwkto, “Ninyia ayanv angv.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Jisu mirwkla minto, “Vbvrikunamv no vngnyi, okv vbvdvdvbv rilaka.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Marta nyila Merinyi kaalwkto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38,39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Jn 11:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jisu la ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv bunugv lamtvlo vngrilo nw nampum golo aatoku hoka Marta vnam nyimv go ninyigv naam lo Jisunyi alvbv aamu toku. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Nw bormv ako dooto aminv Meri, nw Jisu gv lvpa lvkwnglo dootola ninyigv tamsar nama tvvriato. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Marta ninyigv gwngserise ngv achialv kunam lvgalo nw timbuto, vkvlvgabv nw aato okv ninyia minto, “Ahtu, ngoogv bormv, nga gwngserise ngv awgo doomu gvrila nga vngyunam sum no kaachin malare? Ninyia ngam ridumdubv mintokv!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Ahtu ninyia mirwkto, “Marta, Marta! no gwngserise achialv gv aolo timbula okv adwkaku dunvre, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>vbvritola akin go dinchi yadu. Meri alvyanv go gakyapv, okv sum nw gvlo vdwloka dvrit nyulamare.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kumnam a Jisu gv kumsarnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mt 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Alu logolo Jisu mooku golo kumla dooto. Vdwlo nw kumngin tokudw, ninyigv lvbwlaksu akonv ninyia minto, “Ahtu, ngonua kumsar labv, Jon ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa kumsarnam jvbv.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Vdwlo nonu kumrinyi, sum minto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Abu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Noogv darwknv aminv mvngdvnam gubvka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">noogv Karv ngv aalaka.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Ngonugv dvsetvngse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngonugv dvsetvngse dinchinama; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">logo nvgv dvse nga</char></note> nga alu-alua jilaka.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Ngonugv rimur vdwa mvngnga jilaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">ngonua rimurnv vdwa ngonu mvngnga jidunv.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Okv ngonua alvmanv gwngkarika moyoka.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Okv Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa mintoku, “Svkv aingbv nonu gvlokv akonv ayuyupra nga ajin gv naam lo vngla minre, ‘Ajin, nga vtwng taggom go narlabvkv. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Ngoogv ajin ako moing vngnvgo nw vjakpi ngoogv naam lo aalwkpv, okv ngo ninyigv lvgabv dvnam go dooma!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Okv svkv aingbv noogv ajin v naam arwng lokv mirwk bolo, ‘Nga no mindwkmingku mabv! vriap agi ngv koktum ropvku, okv ngo la ngoogv kuu vdwv gadw lo doopv kunv. Ngo gudungla nam ogugo jinyuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Alvdo, vbvrikunamv ogugo rire? Ngo nonua minpadu, nw ngoogv ajin v vla gudungla nam ogugo jima jeka noogv hinying mabv koodv-koodvnam lokv nw gudungla nam ogugo jirung reku. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Okv vkvlvgabv ngo nonua mindunv: Kolaka okv no paarungre; makar laka no mapare; takdin laka, okv agi nga no lvgabv kokda pvjire. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Mvnwngngv yvv koodunv hv paadu, okv yvvdw makar dunv mapare, okv yvvdw takdin dunv ninyigv lvgabv agi a kokda pvjire. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Nonu gv abu vdwv yvvla kuu nga vtwng go koomu gvrila tabw go jinv? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Vmalo no ninyia pvpw go koomu gvrila dwkung go jiredw? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>No alvmanv gubv rijeka, no chindu oguaing bv alvnvgo kuu nga jise ngvdw. Vbvrikunamv ung achialv kaiyanv go, nyidomooku lo doonv Abu Darwknv Dow a jirungre yvvdw ninyia koodunv!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Biljebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mt 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mk 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Jisu milin momanv uyuvram ako charlin toku; vdwlo uyuvram angv vngro tokudw, nyi angv milin raptoku. Nyipam vdwv lamrwpatoku, <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> vbvritola megonv nyi vdwv minto, “Si Biljebul pvnv go, uyuvram vdwgv dvbv, v ninyia bunua charanvnv jwkrw a jiriadu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mt 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mk 8:11</ref></char>
    </note> Kvvbi vdwv Jisunyi gwngkup dvbv mvngto, vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia lamrwpanam go kaatam labv Pwknvyarnv nam yarlwk pvnvlo vla kooto. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Vbvritola Jisu bunugv mvngnam a chinto, vkvlvgabv nw bunua minto, “Diringmooku gunv atu v apum-apum gubv yakpin sila hv padar minsu kubolo hv vdwloka doobwng lamare; vpin akonv atu v apinain sila rinying minsunv, hv ngoopinngoin dukunv. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Vkvlvgabv Uyu gv karv ngv apum gubvrila padar minsu kubolo, oguaingbv hv doobwng nyudubv? Nonu mindu nga uyuvram vdwa charadu ogulvgavbolo Biljebul ngam jwkrw jinam lokv vbv rimu doonv vla. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Vbv rungbv ngo bunua charlin dunv bolo, nonua reming gvnv vdwv oguaingbv bunua charlindunv? Nonua reming gvnv vdwv nonua rimur do vla gakdu! <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Ma ho mabvdv ngo Pwknvyarnv gv jwkrw lokv bunua charlindunv, okv si kaatamdu Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv nonu gvlo aapvku vla.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>“Vdwlo gwlwknv nyi akonv, ninyigv panvnaanv nvnga lvkobv doogu sila, atubogv naam a kaaria sikubolo ninyigv yidu vdwv ngemare. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Vbvritola vdwlo nyi gunv ninyia gwlwk yanvgo nw gvlo palwk laku ninyia mvya yaku bolo, atu gv mvngging kunam yidu vdwa gvla yikula okv ogugo dvrit pvkudw orpin-oryin sireku.”<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mk 9:40</ref></char></note>Yvvdw ngogvbv rima dunv jvjvbv hv nga rinying nvngv; yvvdw nga ridur madunv, naakum nvngv ka jvjvbv ayakapakdu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alvmanv dow gv aakur kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mt 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Vdwlo alvmanv dow v nyidum lokv linri kunyi, hv pvtwngko mooku lo dooku makarla vnggo kardu, hv dooku akoka mapa kuma bolo, hv atu v mindu, ‘Ngo ngoogv naam lo aakur reku.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Vkvlvgabv nw aakur dukula naam a doin doopa dubv kaapa duku. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Vbvrikunamv vnglinlaku okv ninyia alv mayanv uyu dow kanw go aagv dukunv okv bunu aalaku hoka doolwk duku. Vkvlvgabv vdwlo vbv rirekudw, ho nyi gv rinamdaknam hv kvvlo gvnga kaiyabv alvmayabv ridu kunv.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jvjv bv mvngpu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Vdwlo Jisu hum minto kudw, nyimv nvgo nyipam lokv goklin la ninyia minto, “Achialv mvngpu v ho nyimv angv nam dwrwboklin la sootv bongv!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Vbvritola Jisu mirwkto, “Vmabvya, achialv mvngpu v yvvdw Pwknvyarnv gv gaam a tvvdunv okv hum ridunv!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lamrwpanam go koonam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mt 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref></char>
    </note> Nyi vdwv Jisunyi nyipam bv dooyum lvlv toku, nw mimbwngla minto, “Silu meriu gv nyi vdw si achialvbv alvmado! bunu lamrwpanam go koodu, vbvritola Jona gv lamrwpanam a jimwngre kvvbi lamrwpanam yagu bunua jimare. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:4">Jon 3:4</ref></char></note>Ho apiabv nyijwk Jona Ninebe nyi vdwgv kaaringtamanam gobv rito, vkvlvgabv Nyia Kuunyilo vka silu meriu gv nyi vdwgv kaaringtama nam gubv rire. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Dv 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Kri 9:1-12</ref></char></note>Jwngkadaka Alu lo Seba gv Dvnv angv dakrapre okv silugv nyi vdwa gungnying milwkre, ogulvgavbolo nw ninyigv mooku lokv lamtv mvnwngnga vngmila vngtoku Solomon gv mvnglakmilak a tvvdubv vla; okv ngo nonua mindu Dvbv Solomon nyika kaiyanv ogugo sika si doopv. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Jon 3:5</ref></char></note>Jwngkadaka Alu lo Ninebe gv nyi vdwv dakrap dvla nonua gungnying milwkre, ogulvgavbolo bunu Jona gv japji nama tvvla bunu bunugv rimur lokv mvngdin toku; okv ngo nonua jvjv bv mindunv Jona nyika kaiyanv go sika si doopv!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayak gv Loung ngv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mk 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lk 8:16</ref></char></note>Yvvka mvdurrupum a baanu gvrila vsila vmalo bati lvkwnglo vvpvnv kaama;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo domadu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vmabolo bati lvkwnglo vvpvto lvkchonam lo vmalo ochu lvkwnglo vvpvnvto</char></note> vmabvya, nw hum tunggingnvnv lo vvpv yadunv, ogulvgavbolo nyi aanv vdwa kaapa modubv. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Noogv nyik vdwv ayak gv lvgabv mvdurrupum jvbv rido. Vdwlo noogv nyik vdwv alvbolo, noogv ayak mvnwnglo loung ngv akomaring do; vbvritola vdwlo noogv nyik vdwv alvmabolo, noogv ayak mvnwngngv kanv arwng lo dooreku. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Vbvrikunamv, mvnggap tvvlaka, no gvlo loung doodunv am kanv madubv. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Noogv ayak mvnwnglo loung yayabv, ogugoka kanvnamgo kamabv ridu bolo, hv mvnwnglo achialvbv loungre, mvdurrupum gonvgv achialvbv ungnam loung ngv, nam ungkanam jvbv rire.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu parisis okv pvbv tamsarnv vdwa yamtoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mt 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Vdwlo Jisu mintung nga minya tokudw, Parisis ako ninyia lvkobv dvnam dvbam dubv vla gokto; vkvlvgabv nw vngtoku okv dvdubv vla dootung toku. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Jisu gv dvma dwbv lasok manama Parisis nyi angv kaatokula lamkisak patoku. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu ninyia mintoku, “Vbvrikunamv vjak, nonu Parisis vdwv nonugv koobu okv taali a agum a harkakdu, vbvritola arwnglo nonu dokchanam okv alvmanam v yarbingdu. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Pvchanv! Pwknvyarnv yvv agum gvnga mvnv, arwng gvnga mvmapvnvre? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Vbvritola noogv koobu okv taali arwnglo ogugo doodudw um heemanv vdwa jitoka okv ogu mvnwngngv nonugv lvgabv darwk reku.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Leb 27:30</ref></char></note>Vdwnvgo hirukaya gubv rire nonu Parisis nonu vdwa! nonu Pwknvyarnvnyi uji-uu linku loka vring lokv akonyi jinam a jidu, pudina uu okv achialv amok jungnv nvmwng uu okv kvvbi mvnwng uu hvkv nvnga, vbvritola nonu alvbv rinam a okv Pwknvyarnvnyi paknam a rimadu. So vdw sam nonu risar-sise ngvrung, dvbv vdwaka topu mabv.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Vdwnvgo hirukaya gubv rire nonu Parisis vdwa! nonu Jius kumkunaam vdwlo alvyachoknv doogingnvnv nga mvngbiu nvngv okv piokpam dorpamlo vdwlo alvyochok bv mvngdv konwng nvngv. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Vdwnvgo hirukaya gubv rire nonua! nonuno nyibung bungpam a mvu magvrila nyi vdwgv chimabv vngkarnam jvbv rido.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Pvbv tamsarnv nyi akonv ninyia minto, “Tamsarnv, vdwlo no svbv minam v ngaaka miyakaya tadunv!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Pvbv tamsarnv nonuaka vdwnvgo hirukaya gubv rire! nonu nyi gv nangkulo bagla madubv vge mvlwkdu, ho vge a bagdubv nonu atu v lakching vka ridur dubv chilin manv. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Nonua vdwnvgo hirukaya gubv rire! nonu nyijwk vdwgv lvgabv alvnv nyibung mvpvdo, ho nyijwk vdwa nonugv abuapa vdwgv gwngrw mingku namv. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Vbvrikunamv nonuka ho aaming gvduku, nonugv abuapa gv rinam am tolwk duku; bunu nyijwk vdwa gwngrw mintoku, okv nonu bunugv nyibung vdwa mvto. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>So lvgabv Pwknvyarnv gv mvnglak v minto, ‘Ngo nyijwk vdwa okv gindungpingko vdwa vngmure bunu gvlo; bunu mvkire bunu kvgonam okv kvgunam mvritre.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Vkvlvgabv selu gv nyi vdw sum mvritre ogu lvga nyiamooku a pwklin rilokv rila nyijwk mvnwngnga mvkijinam lvgalo, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Atk 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2Kri 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref></char></note> Abelnyi gwngrw gwnam lokv rila Jakarianyi gwngrw gwnam lobv bunua mwkwmwya mwwku gvla darwknv kumku pingkolo mvkitoku. Hum, ngo nonua mindunv, bunu mvnwng gv lvgalo selu gv nyi vdw sum mvritre!”<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Vdwnvgo hirukaya gubv rire Pvbv tamsarnv nonua! nonu chinampanam gv naam a yikoknvnv chabi a vvpv riadu; nonu atu v hoka arwng aama gvri okv kvvbi vdwaka arwng aamu mado!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Vdwlo Jisu ho mooku a vngyu tokudw, Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv la Parisis vdwv ninyia achialvbv minjimio rapto okv ninyi ogumvnwngnga tvuto, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>bunu ninyia kupdubv vla okv rimur go gakdubv vla rikw nyatoku.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Kaakudubv rinvpanv vdwa gamrwnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mt 10:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mt 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mk 8:15</ref></char>
    </note> Hejar hejar nyi v nyipam bv aakum kunamv, vkvlvgabv bunu chaajap minsu toku, Jisu mintuminke bv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Parisis vdwgv vpap am himasuto laka—Ngo minamsi bunugv kaakudubv rinam a. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mk 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lk 8:17</ref></char></note> Ogugonyi mvtum pvdw hum mvkok reku, vvsinam mvnwng vdwa chimu reku. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Vkvlvgabv, nonu ogugo kanv arwnglo minpvkudw hum alulvpa loung kolo tvvpa reku, nonugv naam a koktum tvvla arwnglo japsi nama naam mwnglo aolo chaapv tvvla gokpa reku.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yvvnyila busu svngv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mt 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Ngo nonua mindunv, ngoogv ajin vdwa, ayakka mvki jinv nga yvvnyika busu mabvka vbvritola ayungjvma kochinglo ogu alvmanvgo rinyu mare. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Yvvnyi busu svngvdw ngo kaatamre: Pwknvyarnvnyi busu laka, nw gvlo, mvkiro kochingbv, uyumooku bolo horlu nyudubv jwkrw doodu. Nga tvjwng laka, ninyinv nonugv busu svngv!”<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Pvdwng nvnga barnyi gubv piokma dvnvri? Vbvrijvka Pwknvyarnv pvdwng nvvkin gunyika mvngpa mabv rima. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Nonu gv dumpo gv dwmw mvnwng haka kingam ropv. Vkvlvgabv busu mabvka; No pvdwng vdwa achialvbv arv doya nvgo!”<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristonyi turwknam okv toanam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mt 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Ngo nonua jvjvbv mindunv yvvdw nyi vdwlo ngo gvngv vla nw minpok jidunv, Nyia Kuunyilo ngvka vbvdvdvbv bunua rire nyidogindung vdwgv Pwknvyarnv gv kaagialo. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Vbvritola yvvdw nga nw gvngema vla minpok dunv, Nyia Kuunyilo ngvka bunua nw gvngvma vla mintare nyidogindung vdwgv Pwknvyarnv gv kaagialo.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mt 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mk 3:29</ref></char></note>Yvvdw Nyia Kuunyilo nga minying dunv hum mvngnga nyulare; Vbvritola yvvdw Darwknv Dow a minying dunv hum vdwloka mvngnga nyulamare.”<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11,12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mt 10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mk 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Lk 21:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref></char></note>Vdwlo bunu nonua Jius kumkunaamlo rika dubv vmalo gobunor vdwgv kaagialo vmalo kvvbi vdwgvlo, nonu atu v oguaingbv mvnging svngvdw vla vmalo nonu ogugo minsedw vla mvngdwk mabvka. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Nonu ogugo mirung svngvdw hum hoka Darwknv Dow v nonua tamsarre.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyitv nyi pvcha nvgolo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Nyipam lokv nyi ako Jisunyi minto, “Tamsarnv, ngoogv achiboru a minjilabv abu gv yikungyira vngyu nama ngam lvkobv orpin sudubv.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Jisu ninyia mirwkto, “Ajin, nga nonyi gv pingkolo miriadubv vmalo yikungyira nga baag nyuladubv jinv ngv yvvla?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Okv nw mvnwngnga minbwngto, “Raarwnv mvnwng gvlokv nonu atuv himasuto laka; ogulvgavbolo nyi gv jvjvbv singnam v ninyigv yikungyira lokv mvvma, nw vdwgo nyitv dajvka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu so minchisinam sum bunua miji toku: “Ho hoka nyi ako dooto nw kvdw go rongo ali amw alvbv linji nvgo dooto. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Nw atu v mvngrap sutoku, ‘Ngo ngoogv ali amw a vvpv jikugo kaakuma. Ngo ogugo rila dukunv? <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Ngo so svbv rireku,’ nw atu v minsuto; ‘Ngo ngoogv nesung nga mvyak reku okv sungtv nvgo mvgvrekula hoka ngoogv ali amw okv ngoogv yikungyira mvnwngnga vvpv reku. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Vbvrigvrikula ngo atu v minsureku, Gamdaknv nyi go! no achialv anying gv lvgabv dinchijinam alvnv ogu mvnwng ngv doosupvku. Himpu alvbv svngmin laka, dvmin laka, tvngmin laka okv no atuv himpu dubv rimin sulaka!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Vbvritola Pwknvyarnv ninyia minto, ‘Pvchanvno! Siyu gv ayulo no noogv singnam a topu rungdubv rireku; vbvrikunamv no atubogv lvgabv ogu mvnwng nga mvpvripv kunama paajikunv yvvkudw?’”<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Okv Jisu minyabv minto, “Atubogv lvgabv nyitv tvvtola vbvritola Pwknvyarnv gv lvgabv nyitv manv ngv so svbv ridunv.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngjwng laka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mt 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Okv vkvlvgabv ngo nonua mindunv nonu dvla singdubv vla dvse lvgabv vmalo nonu ayak gv lvgabv vji kose go vla mvngdwk mabvka. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Singnam si dvnam a achialvbv kaiyanv, okv ayak si vji a achialvbv kaiyanv. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Paak ka kaatoka: bunu ali lilwkma vmalo aam nvvma; bunu nesung naam kaama; Pwknvyarnv bunuam dvmu tvngmudu! nonu pvta vdwa achialvbv arv doya nvgo! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Hum mvngdwk gvrila nonu gvlokv akonv yvvla svnggv nama achukgo svngsu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Achukgo singsu yadubv</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">achukgo asu yadubv</char></note> yadubv svnglajinv? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>No svkvnv ogu miang nvnga rilwk nyuma bolo, ogubv kvvbi ogua mvngdwk yadunv? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Dv 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Kri 9:3-6</ref></char></note>Kaatoka mootum gv apung ngv oguaing bv svngdu: bunu ogugo rima vmalo bunu atugv lvgabv vji vbi mvvma. Vbvritola ngo nonua mindunv Dvbv Solomon achialvbv nyitv nvgobv rikubvka vji vbi gvnam vka so apung vdwgv kaapu aingbv rinv gvmato. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>So si Pwknvyarnv yvvdw mootum gv nvsing nvmwng nga vji koomunv—nvmwng v silu doodu okv aarunyi nyeji kunv, vmvlo rampak svngv. Nw nonua vji gvmu dubv vla ogumvnwngnga mvngma rungredw? Nonugv mvngjwng ngv miang gomwng doodu!”<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Vkvlvgabv mvnwnglo ogugo dvsvdw okv tvngsedw vla alu gv dwkia mvngap dvdvla mvngdwk mabvka. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>(Sichingmooku so gv Pwknvyarnvnyi chimanv vdwv aludwkia so ogu mvnwng gv lvgabv mvnggap dvdv dvnv.) No so vdw sum dinchi dunv vla noogv Abu chindu. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Vmabvya Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lvga nga mvnggap yato, okv nw nonua so gv ogumvnwngnga jire.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyidomooku tolo nyitvyachoknam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mt 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>Twngtv manv nonu, busu mabvka, nonugv Abu nonua ninyigv Karv nga jidubv mvngbiudu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>No ogugo doodudw hum mvnwngnga pyoktoka okv morko nga heemanv vdwa jitoka. Morko vgianvnv ungko manvlo no atu v orsu laka, okv no gv nyitv a aomooku tolo tvvpv tvka, tolo vdwloka ngoomare, ogulvgavbolo dvcho nvngv tolo bunu gvlo aachi mare, okv bunua taram dvmwk jinv guka kaamare. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Ogolo no gv nyitv nga tvvpv pvdw hoka no gv haapok vka alu loki a doore.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Huula doonv Pakbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mt 25:1-13</ref></char></note>Ogugo aaridw ho lvgabv Kaya laka, rinam lvgabv kaya laka, okv no gv mvdurrupum a baanu tvla doogv laka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mk 13:34-36</ref></char></note> Nyira vdwgv bunugv atu v nyida lokv aari kunvpv vla kaayala doonam aingbv. Vdwlo nw aalaku okv takdin kubolo bunu vjakgobv agi nga ninyigv lvgabv kokda jiriku. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Ho nyira vdwv mvngpu v yvvgv atu v aakur rikulo bunua hula doodubv okv kaayala doodubv kaanam vdwv! Ngo nonua mindu, nw ninyigv jvtv am pilin reku, okv bunua dootung dubv minreku, okv bunuam jilahola rireku. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Vdwgo mvngpu guku bunu nw bunua kaayala doodubv kaapa kubolo, nw yupra jama nga aaku jvka vmalo koching nyijvka! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39,40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mt 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref></char></note>Nonu chinsudo naam namgo gv atu v dvcho nvgv cholwk dwa chincho bolo, nw vdwloka dvcho nvnga ninyigv naam a tarkola amumare. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Okv nonuka, dooya segorung, ogulvgavbolo nyia Kuunyilo ngv nonugv vdwlo dvmin mari gonyika aariku.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jwkjwkvrwknv okv jwkjwkvrwk manv pakbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mt 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Pitar minto, “Ahtu so gv minchisinam si ngonua mindu nvre, vmalo mvnwngnga mindu nvre?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Ahtu mirwkto, yvv, vbvrikunamv, alvnv okv mvnglaknv nyira ngv? Hv ho angv ninyigv atu hv ninyia naam nyi vdwa rigv dubv jinam, okv nyira kvvbi a bunugv dvse nga dvdw lo dvnam jinam. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Vdwgo mvngpu vku ho pakbu angv ninyigv atu v vdwlo naam aaku namv ninyia vbvridubv kaapa koku namv! <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Vbvrung, Ngo nonua mindunv, Atu v ho pakbua-nga ninyigv yikungyira nga rigv modubv jire. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Vbvritola ho pakbu angv nw atu v minsu bolo ninyigv atu moing vngro baapubv aakur nyuku mare vla kvvbi nyira vdwa okv nyimv daka nyilo daka dvngrap laku, dvlaku tvnglaku okv dvkium tvngkium kubolo. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Vbvrikunamv Atu alugonyi aakur reku vdwlo pakbu gv ninyia dvmin marilo ho gv dwa nw chimpa kuma. Atu v ninyia patungpayung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:46 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ninyi patungpayung mvreku</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">agum lo orlinto</char></note> mvriku okv nw gv tvvma nvnga hingkw moreku.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Pakbu ngv yvv atu gv nw a ritokv mvngnam chindunv, vbvritola nw atu v hum ridubv okv agiarap madunv, hum achialvbv svnyakpare <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Vbvritola pakbu ngv yvvdw ninyigv atu gv mvngnam um chima gvrila nw dvngku yadubv riredw hum miang yabv dvngre. Yvv nw kaigo jipvdw hum kaigo koore; Yvv nw kaiyachok go jipvdw um kaiyachok go koyare.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu apinain sigvnvnv gv koolv ngv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mt 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Ngo nyiamooku so vmv rulwk tebv aato okv hv vbv ngoogv mvngkulo riro duku nvgo vla ngo mvngdu! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mk 10:38</ref></char></note>Ngo baptisma naase go doodu, okv hum richima dvdvlo ngo mvngdwk sakdwk bv ridu! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Nonu nga nyiamooku so sarsopoyo alvbv rigv nvnv nga aagvla aapvnv mvngdu nvlare? Ma, sarsopoyo bvma, vbvritola apinain dubv. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Vjak gvlokv rila vpin akolo nyi angu go doonv apin-ain reku, aom gunv anyia rinying reku okv anyiv aom a rinying reku. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mai 7:6</ref></char></note>Abu vdwv bunugv kuunyilo vdwa rinying reku okv kuunyilo vdwv bunugv abu vdwa rinying reku; anv vdwv bunugv kuunyijar vdwa rinying reku okv kuunyijar vdwv bunugv anv vdwa rinying reku; ayu vdwv bunugv dungnv vdwa rinying reku okv dungnv vdwv bunugv ayu vdwa rinying reku.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dw nga chinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mt 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Jisu nyi vdwa mindvto, “Vdwlo nonu haapam a pogga takbv chaadubv kaapa bolo, vjakgobv nonu mindado nyido hotv dvnvgo vla—okv v vbv rido. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Okv vdwlo mooko takbv doori richa nama nonu himpa bolo, nonu mindu si agu v gurap tvdu vla—okv vbvridu. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Kaakudubvrinv! nonu nyiamooku a okv nyidomooku a kaagvrila doonyi nyinam nyima nga minla gvri; ogubv vbvrinamv, vjakgv dw sum chima dunv?”<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Noogv nyiru minsi nama japdarjapa minsu laka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mt 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Ogulvgabv nonu atubongv alvnvngam mvngchinla kaakw sima dunv? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Nyi gunv nonua kvba japmi sidubv vla nonua mila yila kvba naambv vnggvbolo, nonu um rikin a ninyi alvbv minjupminsi dubv rilaka kvbanaam ha vngsi madvbv. No vbv rima boloka, nw nonua boola yila kvba japji nvgv kaagialo boolwkre, hv bunu nonua pulis vdwgvlo laklwk reku, okv nonua patwklo tumriku. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Ngo nonua mindu, nonu morko dvdua dornya ma dvdvlo, hoka nonu dooreku.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Nonugv rimur vmalo siku lokv kelin tokuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Ho hoka nyi mego dooto bunu Jisu nyi minjito Pilot gv Galili nyi vdwa Pwknvyarnvnyi kumla erin rijila rimu gvrila mvki namgv lvga nga. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto. “Ogulvgavbolo ho Galilian vdwa vbv mvkito, hum nonu bunua kvvbi Galilian vdwa kaiyabv rimur morya nvnga kaatam dubv ripv vla mvngdunvre? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Ma vbvmare, Okv ngo nonua mindu nonu vdwlo nonugv rimur lokv linku mabolo, nonu mvnwngngv bunugv sinam aingbv sire. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Nyi vring gula pinw go Siloam lo aokoko dubv rakchanam naam hv vdwlo darlula darki nama ogubv mvngpv? Um nonu bunua Jerusalem gv nyi mvnwngnga kaiyabv rimur murnv go vla kaatamnam gubv ripv vla mvngdure? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Ma vbvmare! Okv ngo nonua mindu, vdwlo nonu nonugv rimur lokv linku maridw nonu mvnwngngv vbvrila sire.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koksitkokrik semanv singnv lo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu so minchisinam sum bunua minjito: “Ho hoka nyi ako dooto nw ninyigv nayamlo koksitkokrik singnv vkv soto. Nw vngtoku hoka apw kaakarla vbvritola kaapa kuma toku. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Vkvlvgabv nw ninyigv nayam kaaya nvnga minto, ‘Kaatoka, so gv koksitkokrik singnv so ngo apw lvgabv anying nyinghom go kaalwkto, okv ngo ogu goka kaapa ma. Um tvnglwkto! vlam oguaingbv kvdw lo doomu dubv?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Vbvritola nayam kaayanv angv mirwkto, atu, anying goda akinbv vlam doomuto; ngo vlam kvdwa dugo gvrila naya-naka lo lwkbum kwnvpv. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Aarinv anying tolo singnv ngv apw charlin bolo, v alvyachok namv; vbv maloka, no um tvngnga toku mabv.”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Jius doonualu lo pookungnv nyimv go mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Jius Doonualu golo Jisu Jius kumkunaamlo japjila dooto. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Hoka nyimv nvgo nyingring gola nyingpinw go alvmanv dow hv ninyia lvvmala doodubv mvkunam go dooto; nw pookung toku okv achukguka gudung nyuku matoku. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Vdwlo Jisu nyimv nvnga kaapa tokudw nw nyimv nvnga goklinto, “Nyimv angv, no noogv lvvma lokv adu dukunv!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Nw ninyigv laak v nyimv nvngv gv aolo lakpvto, okv vjakgobv nyimv nvngv adinabia dakunv gudung toku okv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartv toku.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9">Mog 20:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Det 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref></char>
    </note>Jius kumkunaam gv rigvdogvnv haachi toku Jisunyi doonualu lo mvpu nvgobv vla, vkvlvgabv nw gamtv rungbv gokla, okv nyi vdwa minto, “Ngonu kudungkua ridubv alu lookv go doodunv; vkvlvgabv ho alulo aatoka okv mvpu kotoka, vbvritola doonualu loma!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Ahtu ninyia mirwkto, “Kaakudubvrinv nonu! Nonu gv lokv akonv ninyigv svv vmalo siak ka Jius Doonualu lo oso nga pakyak laila isi tvngmu dubv naam lokv vnglin madunvre? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Vjak so si Abraham gv husi v ninyia Uyu nyingring gola nyingpinw go tumla vvpvpv; sum Jius Doonualu lo limu madu kubvri?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Ninyigv mirwksinamv nyirunv vdwa hinying simudubv minto, nyi vdwv ninyigv lamrwpadubv mvnam rinam lokv himpu nyatoku.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yingmw lo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mt 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Jisu tvvkato, “Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv oguaingbv ridunv? Um ngo ogu-am lvkobv mintak nvdubv? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Hv svbv ridu. Nyi ako yingmw naala okv ninyigv rongolo paklwkdo. Agar hv garlinla okv singnv gubv ritoku, okv pvta vdwv ho aala bunugv asup a vkvgv hakbv vdwlo suplwk toku.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vpap lo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mt 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Jisu lvkodv minto, “Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga ngo ogu gonyi lvkobv mintak nvdubv? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Hv svbv ridu. Nyimv nvgonv vpap mego naala okv hum kainv pvchwng gulo vtwng nga mvyomvchila nyakma dvdvlobv vvpvnam aing bv rido.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Agi Gichingnv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mt 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Jisu banggu vdwlo okv nampum vdwlo vnggoto nyi vdwa japgo jila okv ninyigv lamtv nga Jerusalem takbv vngdula. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Nyi gonv ninyi tvkato, “Tamsarnv, nyi miang gonv mvngchik ringnam a paamwng redw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Jisu bunua mirwkto, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“No vdwgo rilapvdw agi takching kolo vngpit dvbv rilaka; ogulvgavbolo nyi mvnwngngv hoka vngpit rungdubv rikwre vbvritola rinyu mare. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Naam atu v gudung reku okv agi a koktum reku; vbvrikubolo vdwlo no agumlo daktola okv agi a takdin reku okv minre, ‘Ngonugv lvgabv agi a kokda jilabv, Ahtu!’ nw nonua mirwksire, ‘Nonu ogolokv aapvnv ngo chima!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Vbvrikunamv nonu mirwksire, ‘Ngonu nam lvkobv dvbamto okv tvngbumto; no ngonugv banggu lo tamsarto!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Miri 6:8</ref></char></note>Vbvritola nw lvkodv mindvre, ‘Ngo nonua chimakv nonu ogo lokv aapvnv. Ngoogv lokv vngroto, nonu alvmanv nyi vdwv!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mt 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note> Nonu Abraham, Isaak, okv Jakob okv nyijwk mvnwngnga Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo doodubv kaapa rikunyi, hoka nonua orlinla ora rikulo, nonu kapla, hijung nga kotwkkrwkla rire! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mt 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref></char></note>Nyi vdwv doonyi chaagu lokv okv aagia lokv, yordum okv yorko lokv aakumla Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo dootung tokula dvpam pamminre. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mt 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mk 10:31</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv yvv bunu vjak koching dunv vngcho reku okv vjak yvvbunudw vngcho dunv kochingreku.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv Jerusalem a Paknam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:37-39">Mt 27:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Ho gv dw akin hoka Parisis mego Jisu gvlo aato okv ninyia minto, “No sokv linro lakuka okv dooku kvvbiv gulo vngnyikuka, ogulvgavbolo Herod nam mvki nvpv mvngdu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Vngnyila haaringpaksar a minpa tvka: ‘Ngo uyuvram vdwa charkakdu okv silu okv aaru kaatamre mvpuripu nama, okv loum nvnvlo ngo ngoogv kudungkua nga rinya reku.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Ogubvrijeka ngo silu ngoogv lamtvlo vngrung rikunv, aarunyi, okv logo nvnga so si nyijwk ka kvvbi mookulo mvki dubv riku mare Jerusalem mvngchiklo.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“Jerusalem, Jerusalem! nonu nyijwk vdwa mvki do, nonu gvlo Pwnvyarnvgv gindungpingko vngmunama nonu vlwng kungpv! Vdwnvgo ngo noogv nyi vdwa laak kv lakyum nwngdu kubv, roknv gv ruu vdwa laap lokv lapyumnam aingbv, vbvritola nonu nga vbv rimuma! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Miri 118:26</ref></char></note> Okv vkvlvgabv nonugv Pwknvyarnvnaam arochoko reku. Ngo nonua jvjvbv milv jidunv nonu nga vdwloka kaapa mare vdwlo nonu ‘Pwknvyarnv aya laka yvvdw Ahtu gv amin lo aanv nga vla mindw v aama dvdvlo.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu lvvmanv nyi ako mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Doonu alu golo Jisu Parisis nyi rigvnvgv akogv naam lo achin dvbv aato; okv nyi vdwv Jisunyi orchok mvla kaayato. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Nyi ako lvpa laak bingla lvvma nvgo Jisu gvlo aato, <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Okv Jisu pvbv tamsarnv vdwa okv Parisis vdwa tvkato, “Ngonugv Pvbv lo doonu alu lo lvvma nvnga mvpu dubv minpvri?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Vbvritola bunu ogugoka mimato. Jisu nyi anga naatoku, ninyia mvpu toku, okv ninyia vngmu toku. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mt 12:11</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv Nw bunua mintoku, “Nonugv lokv akonv kuunyilo go dooto vmalo svvhvpu angv doonu alu lo ungrung golo holwk kubolo, hum no doonu alu lo dorlin maredw?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Vbvritola bunu so gv lvga nga ogugoka mirwk nyula mato.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyanyak okv Mvngdv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Jisu kaapato nyen goknam vdwv dooku alvyachoknv vdwa gakdubv, vkvlvgabv nw so minchisinam sum bunua minjito: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Nyit 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref></char></note>Vdwlo nonua nyi gonv nyida dvpam lo gokbolo, alvyachoknv dooku lo doomabvka, vbvrinam goka doore nam kaiyanv nyi goka gokpv kuso, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>okv nonyi gv atu, nonyia goknv, v aala kula minre, ‘Soogv dooku sam ninyia doomu tvka.’ Vbvrikunamv nonu hinying reku okv dooku alv makulo doodubv rireku. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Ho mabvdv, vdwlo nonua gokpv kudw, vnglaka okv koching yachok dooku lo doolaka, vkvlvgabv nonua goknv atu v nonu gvlo aala minre, ‘Ngoogv ajin a, dooku alvku so, chaatoka.’ Svbvrinam si nonua dvbvnyi goknam vdwgv kaagialo mvngdv modu. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Lk 18:14</ref></char></note> Yvv mvnwng v atu v kainvgobv mvngsu dvdw hum miang more okv yvv mvnwngngv atu v miang nvgobv mvngsu dvdw hum kai dubv mvre.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu ninyia goknv atua minto, “Vdwlo no alu dvnam vmalo arium dvnam go jirinyi, no noogv ajin a vmalo noogv abwngboru a vmalo noogv agungasa nga vmalo noogv namrwk doobam nyitvnv vdwa gokmabvka bunu nonua gokrwk sireku, okv vbvrila noogv ogu rinam dvdvgv rijo nga no paaro riku. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Vdwlo nonu dvpam go dvmu tvdudw, heemanv vdwa, pookungnv vdwa, lvpiknv vdwa, okv nyikchingnv vdwa goklaka; <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Okv no aya choknam gubv rire, ogulvgavbolo bunu nonua rirwk sinyu kumare. Pwknvyarnv nonua rirwk jireku vdwlo alvnv nyi vdwgv sinam lokv turkur rikunyi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dvpam kainvgo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mt 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Vdwlo tvbul doodungnv nyi akonv hum tvvpa tokudw nw Jisunyi minto, “Vdwgo mvngpu v yvvdw Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo dvpam lo doolwknv!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Ho hoka nyi ako dooto nw kainv dvpam go dvmu dubv nyi achialvbv gokto. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Vdwlo dvpam dw hv aato kudw, nw ninyigv pakbua kanamla vngmuto ninyigv nyen vdwa minpa modubv vla, ‘Ogu mvnwngngv mvpvripv pvku, aakum tokuka!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Vbvritola bunu mvnwngngv mvngnga labv vla minrap nyatoku. Atuk gv nyi angv pakbua minto, ‘Vjakpi rongo go rvvtobv okv um vngla kaadu bv ripv; ayala ngoogv minam sum tvji labv.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Nyi akonv minto, ‘Ngo hvpu dorring go rvvtobv okv ngo hum rikala lamtvlo lingv segorung; ayala ngoogv minam sum tvji rungla bv.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Nyi akonv minto, ‘Ngo vjakpi nyimv naada pvnv, ho lvga lo ngo aala nyuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Pakbu angv vngkur toku okv ogumvnwngnga ninyigv Atua minpa jitoku. Atu angv achialvbv hachiv kvchakbvriak toku okv ninyigv pakbu nga mintoku, ‘Baapu bv banggu arwnglo okv banggu gv chenyung lo vngnyika, okv heemanv vdwa, pookungnv vdwa, nyikchingnv vdwa, okv lvpiknv vdwa aakur gvteka. <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Pakbu angv baapubv minto, no gv gamki nama rito kubv, tamsarnv, vbvritola karchung ngv nyi megonvgv lvgabv doodvpv.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Vkvlvgabv Atu v pakbua minto, ‘mookugv lamtvbv vnglin nyika okv nyi vdwa arwng lo aadu bv mvtoka, vkvlvgabv ngoogv naam lo yarbing dukubv. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Ngo nonu mvnwngnga mindunv so nyi tamnam vdw sokv yvvka ngoogv arium dvnam a dvpa kumare!’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lvbwlaksubv rinam gv arv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mt 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Lvko nyipam kainvgo Jisunyi lvkobv vngming gvrilo, nw dakrwkla bunua minto, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mt 10:37</ref></char></note>Yvvdw ngoogvlo aadunv ngoogv lvbwlaksu gubv rinyumare vdwlo nw ninyigv Abu okv ninyigv anv, ninyigv nywng okv ninyigv kuu vdwa, ninyigv achiboru okv ninyigv anyibormv, okv nw atubongv alvrungbv paknama lvyabv nga pakma dvdvlo. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lk 9:23</ref></char></note> Yvvdw atu ninyigv daapo nga bakma dunv okv nga vngming gvma dunv hv ngoogv lvbwlaksu gubv rinyu mare. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Nonu gvlokv akonv naam aokolo nvgo mvdubv rungbolo, nw atukchobv doopv tvla okv vkamgu arv ngv ritv rinv bri nw um morko v um rinya nvnv go doodudw kaaka chori. <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Nw dooku mabolo, naam a mvrapro kochingbv nw vdwloka mvnya nyuku mare; okv ogugo ripvdw nyi kaanv mvnwngngv ninyia nyarji reku. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>Bunu minreku, ‘So nyi si naam a mvdubv mvrap toku vbvritola mvnya nyukuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Dvbv gonv hejar vring nyiga go vnglingvla dvbv hejar chamnyi doonvgo mvmi sidubv riku bolo, nw atokchobv doopv tvla japka riku dvbv nga mvmi sinyu redw ma mvmi sinyu maridw vla. <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Nw choopu kuma bolo, nw gindungpingko go vngmure dvbv anga kaarwk sidu kubv okv sarsopoyo lvgabv tvvka siya dukubv ninyigv adu lo vngdungla vngngo lvpa rikulo.” <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>“Ho apiabv,” Jisu minyabv minto, “Nonu lokv yvvka ngoogv lvbwlaksu gobv rinyu mare vdwlo nonuno nonugv ogumvnwngnga kayu maredw.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alu tiku manv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mt 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Alu v alv nvgo, vbvritola si tinam a ngemu kubolo, hum lvkodv tidukubv mvjiku lamtv kaakuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>So si kvdw gv lvgabv alv kuma vmalo eriung gvbvka alvkuma; hum adulo ora duku. Tvvtoka, vbvrikunamv, nonuno nyarung gvdubolo!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Svlar nyekunv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mt 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1,2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29">Lk 5:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:30">30</ref> </char>
    </note>Alu golo lampu naakumyanv okv toakunam vdwv achialvgo Jisu gvlo tvvdubv aatoku, <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Parisis vdwvla Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv minsiminpit rapto, “So nyi si toa kunam vdwa naarwk sidu okv bunua lvkobvka dvbam tvdu!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu bunua so minchisinam sum mintam toku:<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Vkv aingbv nonugv lokv akonv svlar ngv lwnggo doore okv bunugv lokv akonyi ngemure-nw ogu rireku? Nw chamkia gula kia nga nvmwnglo kayupila okv ngenv akin a kaapama dvdvlo makar reku. <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Vdwlo nw mapa rikudw nw achialvbv mvngpu laku hum ninyigv gorbwnglo vvpv toku. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Okv um naam lo bakkor lwktoku. Vbvrikunamv nw ninyigv ajin vdwa okv namrwk vdwa gokkum tokula bunua mintoku, ‘Ngo achialvbv mvngpu duku ngo ngoogv svlar ngenv anga paakunamv. Klvi ngonu naayap lakuju!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Ho apiabv, ngo nonua mindunv, nyidomooku tolo hum kaiyabv mvngpure rimurnv nyi go mvngdin kubolo chamkia gula kia yvv mvngdin kusegu kaakumanv mamsenga.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Morko lokdwng nyekunv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Vmalo nyimv nvgo ain lokdwng charring go doonv chargunyi ngemu toku—nw ogu ripvku? Nw mvdurrupum a baanu toku, ninyigv naam a pakak toku, okv kaapama dvdvlobv um alvyaungbv kaakar toku. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Vdwlo nw hum kaapa tokudw, nw ninyigv ajin vdwa okv namrwk ajin vdwa gokdum sitoku, okv bunua mintoku, ‘Ngo achialvbv mvngpu dukunv ngo ngoogv ngemu kunam lokdwng nga paapvku. Klvi ngonu naayap lakuju!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Ngo nonua mindu, ho apiabv rimurnv nyi gunv mvngdin kubolo vkvgv aolo Pwknvyarnv gv gindungpingko vdwv achialvbv mvngpu yadunv.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuunyilo nyekunv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Jisu mimbwngla minto, “Ho hoka nyi akonv nw kuunyilo anyigo dooto. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Boruya angv ninyia minto, ‘Abu, vjak yikungyira ngo gvnga ngam jilabv,’ Vkvlvgabv abu hv yikungyira vdwa kuunyilo anyi gv pingkolo orpin sitoku. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Lonyi loum kochinglo boruya angv ninyigv yikungyira vdwa pyoktoku okv morko nga gvtokula naam a vngyu toku. Nw adu koko mookulo vngtoku, hoka nw rikunamv ninyigv morko nga mvnam mvsubv mva toku. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Nw vdwgo gvku bvdw hum mvnwngnga mva toku. Vbvrikunamv dvmayarwng go ho mooku hoka vngtoku, okv nw hoka oguka kaaku mabv ramkar toku. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Vkvlvgabv nw ho mookugv nyi gonvgv lvgabv kudungkua riji dukubv vngtoku, hv ninyia ninyigv rongo adukolo lo vrik kaaria modubv vnglin motoku. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Nw ninyigv dvse a vrik gv dvnam dvku lokv dvsu tvnvpv mvngto, vbvritola yvvka ninyia dvnam jinv kaama toku. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Anyung anya nga ninyigv haapok lo mvngchin raptoku okv mintoku, ‘Ngo Abu gv nyi riria modubv goknam mvnwng hvka bunu dvnam a dvlv kumabv dvmin duku, okv ngo soka kano gvbv sakap tvya dukunv! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Ngo gudung reku okv Abu gvlo vngreku, okv minreku, Abu, ngo Pwknvyarnv nyila okv nam la rinyingla rimur tokubv. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Ngo noogv kuunyilo ngv vla mindubv riya kuma; no nga noogv riria nvbv goknam nyi ako bv mvngla kubvka,’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Vkvlvgabv nw gudung toku okv ninyigv Abu gvlo vla vngkur raptoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Nw vjakgobv naam vngchi sengv lamtv ngv adudvto hoka ninyigv Abu hv ninyia kaapa toku; nw haapok v hau toku, okv nw joktoku, okv ninyigv laak hv ninyigv kuunyilo nga jarbwng toku, okv ninyia moopupdvtak toku. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Kuunyilo ngv mintoku, ‘Abu, ngo Pwknvyarnv nyila nam la rinyingla rimur tokubv. Ngo noogv kuunyilo ngv vla mindubv riya kuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Vbvritola Abu hv ninyigv pakbu vdwa goktoku. ‘Baapubv!’ nw minto. ‘Jvtvlaklwk alvyachok nvnga bvnglwkto okv ninyia pilwkto. Ninyigv lakchinglo lakchup go pilwkto okv ninyigv lvpa lo lvsup goka. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Vbvrikunamv vngnyika okv svbv bakboknv akonyi paala hum mvki tvka, okv klvi ngonu naayapla dvpam go pamla kuju! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Ngoogv kuunyilo angv si sirokunv ngv, vbvritola vjak nw turpvku; nw ngooro kunvngv, vbvritola vjak ninyia paapv kunv.’ Okv vkvlvgabv dvpam ha pamrap toku.”<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Vbvrire hoka kuunyilo achi yangv agum rongolo rito. Ninyigv lamtvlo vngkur rikulo, vdwlo naam aachidvlv bv riri hoka, nw giomin okv soomin namgv sidu a tvvpa toku. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Vkvlvgabv nw pakbu ako goklwkla okv ninyia tvvkato, ‘Ogugo ridung dunvla?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>‘Noogv boruv naam aakur pvku,’ pakbuv mirwkto, ‘Okv noogv Abu svbv babok yachok nvgonyi paki pvkunv, ogulvgavbolo nw ninyia ayak alvdvkubv paakunam lvgabv.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Achi yangv achialvbv kvchakbriak laila nw naam arwnglo aamato; vkvlvgabv ninyigv Abu agumlo linto okv ninyia arwng aatokv vla kodwkkrwkla minto. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Vbvritola nw ninyigv Abunyi mirwksito, ‘Kaatoka, anying mvnwnglo ngo nyira jvbv noogv lvgabv kudungkua nga rijito, okv ngo noogv minam a vdwloka tvvmabv rinam kaama. No nga ogugo jipv? Ngoogv ajin vdwaka lvkobv dvpam dvgv laka vla yabin akoka ka jinam kaama! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Vbvritola noogv kuunyilo angv si noogv yikungyira mvnwngnga randi vdwlo mva nvmin kunvngv, okv vdwlo nw naam aakur kunamv no ninyigv lvgabv svbv bakbok nvgonyi paki jiminla!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Abu v mirwkto, ‘Ngoogv kuunyilo nga,’ ‘no ngam alu loki a lvkobv doobwng kunvngv, okv ngo ogugo doopv kudw mvnwngngv nokvku. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Vbvritola ngonuv naayap segorung okv mvngpu segorung, ogulvgavbolo no gv boruv siro kunvngv, vbvritola vjak nw turpvku; nw ngero toku, vbvritola vjak ninyia paapvku.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Runglak mabv Rungyapayanv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Ho hoka nyitvnv nyi ako dooto nw pakbu go dooto hv ninyigv yikungyira nga kaayataya nvgo. Nyitvnv nyi anga ninyigv ogu rungyanv angv ninyigv morko nga mva dukv vla mintamto, <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>vkvlvgabv nw rungya nvnga arwnglo goklwkto okv minto, ‘Ngo noogv lvkwng nga tvvdunv si ogu gokula? No ngoogv yikungyira nga kaayataya nama vdw godw ogumvnwngnga ngam kaatam lakubv, ogulvgavbolo no vdwloka ngoogv rungyapayanam gubv rinyu kumare.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Pakbu angv nw atu hv minsuto, ‘Ngoogv atu nga ngoogv nokori loka naalin tvduku. Ngo ogu rila kuse gubvri? Ngo dvnam lvgabv rongo ridubv gwlwk doyama, okv giago karse ngaaka yinying yapv. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Vjak ngo chinduku ngo ogugo risedw! Vbvrikunamv vdwlo ngo nokori lokv linre kudw, ngo ajin jinre bunu nga bunugv naam lo alvbv aamure.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Vkvlvgabv nw ninyigv atu gvlo dvdu doonv nyi vdwa goklwk toku. Nw atokchogv anga tvvkato, ‘No ngo atu gvlo vkamgu narpvnv?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Nw mirwkto, ‘Olib tvli vkv pumpa lvngo narto,’ ‘Siinv noogv jise ngv,’ rungyanv angv ninyia minto, ‘dootungto okv chamngu go lvkgapto.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Vbvrikunamv nw kvvbi akonyi tvkato, ‘Okv no—vdwgo narpvnv?’ Nw mirwkto, ‘Giu vkv tagiam munv hejar go,’ ‘siinv noogv jise ngv,’ rungyanv ninyia minto; ‘lwngpinv go lvkgapto.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Pakbu mvvlaknv gv Atu hv ninyia vbv rungkup runglik la ridanam lvgabv ninyia hartv toku; ogulvgavbolo nyiamooku so gv nyi vdwv achialvbv bunu rungkup runglik la lounglo rinv nyi vdwa kaiyabv ridu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Okv Jisu mimbwngla minto, “Okv vkvlvgabv ngo nonua mindunv: Nonuno atuv nyiamooku so gv yikungyira nga lvkobv ajin jinlaka, vkvlvgabv um vdwlo si topu rikudw, nonua simabv doobwng jiku naam lo alvbv aamu riku. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Yvvdw miangnv yikungyira nga alvbv mvnging dubv ridunv hv kainv yikungyira loka achialvbv kaiyabv mvnging dubv ridunv, okv yvvbunudw miangnv yikungyira lo jwkjwkvrwk bv mvngging dubv rima dunv v kainv yikungyira loka jwkjwkvrwkbv mvngging dubv rima dunv. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Hv bolo, vbvrikunamv, nonu nyiamooku so gv yikungyira nga alvbv mvnging dubv rinyu mabolo oguaingbv jvjvnv yikungyira nga mvnging dubv rinyure? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Nonu nyi kvvbi gvbvrinv yikungyira nga mvnging dubv riji mabolo, yvvla no gvbvrinv yikungyira nga nam jijinv?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mt 6:24</ref></char></note>Pakbuv yvvka atu anyi gv nyirabv rinyu mare; nw akonyi pakre okv akonyi kaanwng mare; nw akonvgv minam a tvvre okv akonvgv nga tvvmare. No Pwknvyarnv nyila morko nga lvkobv rijivngji nyulamare.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv minam megonv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mt 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mk 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Vdwlo Parisis vdwv so mvnwng sum tvvtokudw, bunu Jisunyi nyarjito, ogulvgavbolo bunu morko nga mvngbiuto. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Nonuno atubongv nyi vdwgv kaagialo jvjv nvgobv minsunv vbvritola Pwknvyarnv nonugv haapok ha chindu, yikungyira vdwv nyi gv lvgabv kainv arv doonv gubv rinv ngv, Pwknvyarnv gvlo ogu arv ka kaama.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mt 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref></char></note>Moses gv Pvbv okv nyijwk vdwgv lvknam vdwv Jon Baptist gv dw lobv ribwngto; okv ho koching nga Pwknvyarnv gv Karv gv lvkwng Alvnv Yunying nga mintam raptoku, nyi mvnwngngv ho Karv lo aadu bv gwnglilala nyadu. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mt 5:18</ref></char></note> Pvbv gv gaam achukguka minggap nama ria jemam svnga nyido gvla kvdw gv nyitv namv nyepu yare.”<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mt 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note>Yvv nyi akonv atugv nywng nga toa tokula ako kvvbi nyimvmvvga go nywng mvku bolo hv yoomurnv; okv toanam nyimvmvvga anga yvv nywng mvdunv hvvka yoomurnv.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyitvnv nyi gola okv Lajaras</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Ho hoka nyi nyitvnv ako dooto nw kainv arv doonv vjia kooto okv achialvbv lokia himpukain la svngminto. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Ho hoka heemanv nyi ako dooto aminv Lajaras, ungvtarv ngv rara nvgo, hum nyitv nyi gv naam agi lo vvpvkinamgo, <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>nyitv nyi gv dvkulo dvala hoolin nama dvpa yare vla mvngnv go. Iki vka aala ninyigv ungngv nga dvriak riakbwngto.”<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>“Heemanv nyi angv sitoku okv nyidogindung vdwv ninyia gvvtoku Abrahamnyi lvkobv nyidomooku gv dvpam lo doomuto. Nyitv nyi v sitoku okv nyibung riitoku, <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>okv Uyumooku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Uyumooku: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinv vdwgv mooku.</char></note> bolo nw achialvbv hirukaya toku, nw kaadung kunamv adukoyo lo Abraham okv ninyigv lvkobv Lajarasnyi doodubv kaapa toku. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Vkvlvgabv nw goklin toku, ‘Abu Abraham! nga aya labvka, okv Lajarasnyi ninyigv lakching nga isi lo chibok mogvrila achok godaka ngoogv riu sum chapke molabvka, ogulvgavbolo ngo si vmv arwng si achialvbv hirukaya dvkukv!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Vbvritola Abraham minto, ‘Mvngpa tokuka, ngoogv kuunyilo nga, noogv turla singrilo nam alvnv mvnwngnga jimiro, Lajaras hoka alvmanv mvnwngnga paariato. Vbvritola vjak nw soka atuv himpu pumin dukunv, no hoka hirukaya rikulo. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>So ogu mvnwng sum kayu tvla, no gvla ngoogv pingko si kairungnv kobung go doodunv, vkvlvgabv yvvdw sokv noogv hoka vngrap dubv ritv nvngv vbv rinyu madunv, vmajeka yvvka noogv hokvkongv ngonugv so linyu madunv.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Nyitvnv nyi angv minto, ‘Vbvrikunamv ngo nam kodwkkrwkla koola mindunv, Abu Abraham, Lajarasnyi ngoogv abu gv naam lo vngmu jilabv, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>v ngo boru angu go doopvnv. Ninyia vngmula okv bunua gamrw motoka, bunuka so hirukayaku so aama dubv.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Abraham minto, ‘Noogv boru vdwv Mosesnyi okv nyijwk vdwa doogv sudu bunua gamrw nvngv; noogv boru vdwv bunugv ogugo minam a tvvrung svngv.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Nyitvnv nyi hv mirwksito, ‘Hv pwngmare, Abu Abraham! Vbvritola siro kunv nyi gonv turkur laku okv bunua minbolo, vbvrikubolo bunu bunugv rimur lokv linreku.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Vbvritola Abraham minto, ‘Bunu Moses nyila Nyijwk vdwa tvvmabolo, bunua mintap nyulamare sikunv akonv turkur kujvka.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Rimur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mt 18:6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mk 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, nyi vdwa rimur mobv rinv ngv ho lokia doore! vbvritola yvvdw bunua rimu dunv hv mvngru gubv rire! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Ho nyi anga vlwng pwtv nvgo lvngpolo paklwk tvvla svlv lo orlwk namv nw gv lvgabv alvyare so gv vmi anga rimur modubv ritv svnga. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mt 18:15</ref></char></note>Vkvlvgabv hingto laka no ogugo ridudw!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Noogv achiboru vdwv rimur dubolo, ninyia yamtoka, okv nw mvngdin dukubolo, ninyia mvngnga jilaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Nw alua kanw go nam rinyingla rimur dubolo, okv riri gv dwkia no gvlo aala, ‘Ngo mvngdin dukunv vku bolo, no ninyia mvngnga jirung laka.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngjwng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Nyitampingko vdwv Jisunyi minto, “Ngonugv mvngjwng nga kai molabv.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Nonu gvlo mvngjwng ngv yingmw chargobv doodu bolo, nonu so malberi singnv sum minyure, ‘No atu hv kolv lokv puchok linsula okv svmasa lo atu hv lvvlwk suto vla minbolo hv noogv minam a tvjire.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pakbu gv rise ngv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Minchisinam go nonu gvlo akonv pakbu doodu hv rongo padungdo vmalo svlar vdwa kaaya riadungdo. Vdwlo nw rongo lokv aari kunyi, um no ninyia baapubv okv dvnam a dvto vla minridw? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Vbvrirung mare! vmabvya, no ninyia minre, ‘Ngoogv dvnya dvse nga mvpvto, vbvrikunamv no noogv vji a kotoka okv ngoogv dvrilo okv tvngrilo no doya tvka; ho kochingbv no noogv dvse a dvla duku.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Minam a tvvla pakbu angv umbonyikv go panyu mapvri, panyu pvri? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Vbvdvdvbv so si nonu gvloka doolwk laka; nonugv rise a vdwlo nonu ripv kudw, minlaka, ‘Ngonu pakbu bvtwkbv rimwngnv; ngonu ngonugv rise a rimwng pvnv.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyi vring go mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Jisunyi Jerusalem bv vngrilo nw Samaria gvla Galili gv doorwsi pingkolo vngpitla vngto. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Nw nampum arwnglo vngdungrilo ho arwnam apin yaritla lvvmanv nyi vring go paami suto, bunu adulo dakto <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>okv goktoku, “Jisu! Tamsarnv! ngonua aya mvngpa labv!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Leb 14:1-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisu bunua kaapa toku okv bunua minto, “Vngnyika okv nyibu vdwa nonua jwngkadaka kolaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Lamtvlo bunua darwk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Darwk dukubv mvtoku</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bars 5:12 a kaatoka.</char></note> dukubv mvtoku. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Vdwlo bunugv lokv akonv poyapvku vla himpa tokudw, nw vngkur toku, Pwknvyarnvnyi gamtv rungbv hartv toku. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Nw Jisu gv lvpa lvkwng gv kvdw lo atu v gipv toku okv ninyia umbonyi vtoku. Nyi angv Samaritan go. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Jisu minto, “Nyi mvpu namv nyidum vring gui laka; kvvbi kia gunv ogolo? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Ogubv so nyebunyi angv si Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyi vla mimbv aadunv?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Okv Jisu ninyia minto, “Gudungto okv vngnyika; noogv mvngjwng lokv nam alv mopvku.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Karv gv aaku svngv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mt 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Parisis mego Jisunyi tvkato Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv vdwlo aatv dunv. Ninyigv mirwksinamv, “Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv vbvrung vla kaadubv rimare. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Yvv akonvka minla mare, ‘kaato si kunv!’ vmalo, ‘v kunv!’; ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv no gvlo doodu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">No gvlo doodu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nonugv aralo doodu, okv nonugv aralo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dvminmabv aalwkre</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Dw gv aariku vdwlo nonu Nyia Kuunyilo gv alu logonyi kaanwngre, vbvritola um nonu kaapa kumare. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Ho hoka nyi vdwv nonua minre ‘tolobv kaatoka!’ vmalo ‘so soka kaatoka!’ vbvritola vnglinla um kaakar mabvka. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Dooriak gv nyidomooku lo riaklinla okv chegunv lokv chegunvbv loung monam aingbv rire nyia kuunyilo ninyigv alu hv. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Vbvritola atukchobv nw achialvbv hinching chingchore okv silugv nyi vdwgv toanam gubv rire. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Noah gv riri ho gv dw aingbv Nyia Kuunyilo gv dw hvka Vbvrire. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Nyi mvnwngngv dvbwngla okv tvngbwng nyala rinyato, nyimv okv nyiga vdwv nywng nyilubv rimi sinyato, Noah gv svpw arwnglo aalwk rikulo okv isi hv tvvlula bunu mvnwngnga tvvrumla tvki toku. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Atk 18:20—19:25</ref></char></note>Ho alu hv Lot gv ririlo gv alu aing bv rire. Nyi mvnwngngv dvbwngla okv tvngbwng nyato, korvpachu rvvmi sinyato okv pyokmi sinyato, singnv lvvdung nyato okv naam mvdung nyato. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Lot gv Sodom a vngyuri alu lo, vmv okv vmv gununvnv ngv nyidomooku tolo gvngv holula nyi mvnwngnga guki kingam toku. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Nyia Kuunyilo gv daklwk rikulo ho vkv aingbv rireku.”<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mt 24:17</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15">Mk 13:15</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:16">16</ref></char></note>Ho gv alu lo nyi gonv ninyigv namwng mwnglo lo rinv naam arwng aala ninyi gvbv rinam yikungyira mvnwngnga naadubv mvngrung mabvka; vkv aingbv nyi gonv yvv agum rongolo rinv naam aakur kuyoka. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Atk 19:26</ref></char></note>Lot gv nywng nga mvngpa toka! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note>Yvvdw nyi atugv singdung nga ringdubv mvngdunv ngoore; yvvdw ninyigv singdung nga ngoomu dunv v hum ringyare. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Ho gv ayulo, ngo nonua mindu, ho hoka nyi anyigo gadw lo lvkobv yupbam la doore; akonyi naare okv akonyi kayure. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Nyimv anyi gonv daa hwkbasire: akonyi naaro reku okv akonyi kayu reku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo bars 36 sum lwktam do</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nyi anyigo rongolo riba sire: akonyi naaro reku, okv akonyi kayu reku</char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mt. 24:40 a kaatoka)</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Nyi anyigo rongo mvba sila doore akonyi naaro reku okv akonyi kayu reku.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia tvvkato, “Ogulo, Ahtu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Jisu mirwkto, “Ogulo svmago doopvdw hoka Pvta nyidin dvnv dookumre.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Hvngmi gola kvba baarianv nyi golo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minchisinam go minla tamsarto bunua kumbwngla doomu dubv okv vdwloka miangbv mvngsu madubv. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>“Banggu guloka kvba japrianv nyi go dooto nw yvvnyika mvngdv manvgo okv Pwknvyarnv nyika busu manvgo. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Okv ho banggu akin hoka hvngmi goka dooto hv ninyi gvlo aaki nvgo okv ninyigv jvjv nga raabwngto vbv minto ‘nga nyiru nvnga ridarminsu dubv nga ridur labv!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Japria jinv angv megojego riji jimakv vla mingkwngto, vbvritola anyung jemanga nw atuv minsuto, ‘Ngo Pwknvyarnvnyi busu manv vmalo nyi ha mvngdv manv gubv rijvka, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>so hvngmi gv nga adwkaku jinam mvnwng gv lvgalo ngo ninyigv jvjv nga paadu kubv kaajire. Ngo vbv riji mabolo nw aabwngre okv ataranya lo ngaaka gvvkuji!’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Okv Ahtu minbwngto, “Japrianv nyi alvmanv gv minam a tvvtoka. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Vjak, Pwknvyarnv nw atugv nyi gv lvgabv japjiriji maredw yvvdw aluayu bv ridur lvgabv kapki nvnga? Nw ninyia ridur svnga tapv ridw? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Ngo nonua mindu, Nw bunu gvbv japjire okv hum baapubv rijire. Vbvritola nyia Kuunyilo ngv vdwlo nyiamooku so aarikunyi mvngjwng go paarikudw?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Parisi okv lampu naayanv gonyi minchisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Atua darwk nvgobv mvngsinv okv kvvbi nyi mvnwngnga miyakaayanv vdwa Jisu so minchisinam sum minjidato. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Alu golo nyi anyigo Pwknvyarnvnaam lo kumdubv vla chaato: akonv Parisi go kvvbi gonv lampu naaria nvgo. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Parisi angv atu hv akusubv dakrwsito okv kumto,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Atuv dakrw suto okv kumto</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dakdula okv atuv kumsito.</char></note> ‘Ngo Pwknvyarnv nam, umbonyikv mvngdunv, ogulvgavbolo ngo dvgum madunv, tvvma nvgobv rima, vmalo nyi mvnwng gv ribv, yoomur nvgobv rima. Ngo nam umbonyikv vdunv ogulvgavbolo ngo alo v doonv lampunayanv aingbv rima. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Ngo lokkanw lo loonyi go yikla doodunv, okv ngo paanam lo vring loka akonyi nam jibwng dunv.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Vbvritola Lampunayanv angv adulo dakto okv ninyigv nyukmu ngvka nyido aobv baayinmato, vbvritola ninyigv haakwnglo baapv gvrila okv minto, ‘Pwknvyarnv, ngo rimurnv nyi go, ngam aya labv!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lk 14:11</ref></char></note>Ngo nonua mindunv,” Jisu minto, “Pwknvyarnv gv kaagia lo, alvnvgobv rinv lampu naayanv angv, vdwlo nw naam bv vngtokudw, Parisis angvma. Ho lvga mvnwngngv yvvdw kainvgobv mvngsudunv um miang nvgobv mvre, okv yvvdw atu v miang nvgobv mvngsudunv hum kainvgobv mvre.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu vmi vdwa boktalwkji toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mt 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mk 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Nyi mego bunugv vmi vdwa Jisu gvlo aagvjito ninyigv laak v bunuam lakpo modubv vla. Lvbwlaksu vdwv bunua vbvrinv gubv vla yamdarpato, <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>vbvritola Jisu vmi vdwa nw gvlo goklwkto okv minto, “vmi vdwa ngoogvlo aamuto okv bunua mintor mabv, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv svkv nvgv gvngv. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Sum mvnggap laka! Yvvdw vmi aingbv rigv rila Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga naarwk madunv v hoka aanyu mare.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyitvnv nyi go</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mt 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Jius nyi rigvnv ako Jisunyi tvvkato, “Alvbv Tamsarnv, turbwng nama paanam lvgabv ngo ogugo risegubvri?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>“No nga ogubv alvnv vla mindunv?” Jisu ninyia tvvkato. “Yvvka alvnv kaama Pwknvyarnv akin mvngchik. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Mog 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Det 5:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Mog 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Det 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:15">Mog 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Det 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:16">Mog 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Det 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Mog 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Det 5:16</ref></char></note>No gamkinam gaam vdwa chindu: ‘Yoomur mabvka; gwngrw gwyoka; dvcho mabvka; mvvlarula yvvnyika mium mabvka; noogv anv okv abunyi mvngdv laka.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Nyi angv mirwkto, “So gv gamkinam gaam vdw sum, ngo vmi anga lokv, ribwngchala ripvkunv.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Vdwlo Jisu hum tvvtokudw, nw nyi anga minto, “No rise ngv akin go doopv. No ogugo doopvdw hum mvnwngnga pyoktola morko nga heemanv vdwa jito laka, okv no nyidomooku tolo nyitvyachok reku; vbvripikula aala nga vngming gvlakuka.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Vbvritola vdwlo nyi angv hum tvvtokudw, nw achialvbv mvngru toku, ogulvgavbolo nw achialvbv nyitvto.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Jisu ninyia mvngru dubv kaatoku okv minto, “Nyitvnv nyi hv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo aanam lvgabv achialvbv aanyu madunv! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Kemel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kemel: Svnwng lvngpo asunv chukrimooku lo rinv</char></note> gv pwsi ungrung lo vngpit tvvnam aingbv nyitvnv nyi v hum kaiyabv aanyu manam gubv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo aatv rinyi ridunv.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Nyi vdwv hum nw gvlo tvvpanv vdwv tvvkato, “Vbvrikubolo, yvv, ringnam a paala kujinv?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Nyi gv ogugo rinyu manamv Pwknvyarnv gv lvgabv rinyu dunv.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Vbvrikunamv Pitar minto, “Kaatoka! Ngonu nam vngming gvdubv ngonugv naam vdwa vngyu pvnv.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>“Am,” Jisu bunua minto, “Okv ngo nonua jvjvbv milv jidunv yvvdw naam vmalo nyimv vmalo achiboru vmalo anvabu vmalo kuu vdwa Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lvgabv vngyu dunv. <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>Vjakgv singgv dvnam sum achialvbv kaiyabv paare okv aainv singnam gunv tolo turbwng nama paare.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv sise lvkwng nga lvom nvbv mintoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mt 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Jisu lvbwlaksu vdwa vngyi gvtoku okv bunua minto, “Tvvtoka, ngonu Jerusalem bv vngdunv, hoka nyijwk vdwgv nyia Kuunyilo gv lvga nga lvknam vdwv jvjvbv rilin jiriku. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Ninyia kvvbi nyi vdwgvlo laklwk reku, bunu ninyia mvmin reku, nyarjikao reku, okv tachor chorke reku. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Bunu ninyia svnyak pareku, okv mvki reku, vbvritola alu loom kochinglo nw turrap reku.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Vbvritola lvbwlaksu vdwv minam vdwa akonyika chinku mato; ogu ha minpv nvdw hv bunugv lokv adu toku, okv Jisu ogu gonyi minpv nvdw um bunu chinku mato.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyi nyikching la giago karnv go mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mt 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Jisu Jeriko gv adarlo aadungto, hoka giagonv nyi ako lamtv hoka doopv tvvla giadungto. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Vdwlo nw nyipam vdwgv vngpit nama tvvpa tokudw, nw tvkato, “Si ogu v?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Bunu ninyia minpato, “Najaret lokv Jisu vngpit dvnvkv.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Nw kapla minto, “Jisu! Dabid gv kuunyilo! Nga aya mvngpa labvka!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Haabo lokv nyi vdwv ninyia yamto okv ninyia choibvkv vla minto. Vbvritola nw gamtvyayabv gokla minto, “Dabid gv kuunyilo! Nga aya mvngpa labvka!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu daktungto okv nyikchingnv nyi anga ninyigvlo aagv dubv minto. Vdwlo nyi angv nvchilo aato kudw, Jisu ninyia tvvkato, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“No nga noogv lvgabv ogugo rijilabv vla mvngdunv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Tamsarnv,” nw mirwksito, “Ngo lvkodv kaapa nwngduku.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Vbvrikunamv kaato kuka! Noogv mvngjwng ngv nam alv mopvku.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Vjakgobv nw kaapa toku, okv nw Pwknvyarnvnyi hartv yingla, Jisunyi vngming gvtoku. Vdwlo nyipam v um kaatokudw, bunu mvnwngngv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartv toku.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Jakias</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Jisu Jeriko nga vngpitla vngto. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Ho hoka lampu naayanv mvnwng lokv kaiyachok nvgo dooto vkvgv aminv Jakias, nw achialvbv nyitvto. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Nw Jisu yvvdw kaadubv vla rikwto, vbvritola nw adwngnv nyi gubv rito okv nyipam v twngtvnam lvkwnglo nw Jisunyi kaapa nyumato. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Vkvlvgabv nw nyipam a jokcho yala koksitkokrik singnv gulo gechato Jisu ho lamtv hoka vngpit rilo ninyia kaadubv vla. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Vdwlo Jisu ho hoka vngchi tokudw, nw kaadung toku, okv Jakiasnyi minto, “Baapubv itoku, Jakias, ogulvgavbolo ngo silu noogv naam lo doorung tvvdunv.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Jakias baapubv geludanv ngv achialvbv himpula ninyia alvbv aamu toku. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Nyi mvnwng hum kaanv vdwv arwnglo mimi sinyato, “So nyi angv si rimurnv nyi gv naam lo nyen bv aadunv!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Jakias dakrap dato okv Jisunyi minto, “Tamsarnv, tvvrialabv! Ngo ngoogv yikungyira nga tunggonyi heemanv vdwa jireku, okv ngo yvvnyi dvkup pvkudw, ngo ninyia api yagu jiya reku.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Silu so gv naam so ringnam v aapvku, ho lvga so nyi si Abraham gvka husi v. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:11">Mt 18:11</ref></char></note>Nyia Kuunyilo ngv nyekunv vdwa makarla ringdukubv aapvnv.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ain lokdwng lo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mt 25:14-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nyi vdwgv um tvria rilo, Jisu mimbwngla minchisinam go bunua mintamto. Nw vjak Jerusalem lo aachi dvlvbv ritoku, okv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv aadaribo vla bunu mvngnyato. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Vkvlvgabv nw minto “Hoka ho nyi ako kaibv mvngdvnam go dooto nw aduko mookulo vngtv nvgo Dvbv bv mvku dvbv vla, ho kochingbv nw naam aakur dubv vla rungto. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Nw gv vngrap maadvbv, nw ninyigv pakbu vring vdwa gokkumto okv bunua ain lokdwng vkv charchak go jigvrila minto, ‘Kaatoka ngoogv vngro rilo nonu so sam ogugo pwlwkpaalwk la pwtam paatam rila rinv.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Vjak, ninyigv mookugv nyi vdwv ninyia kaanwng mato, okv vkvlvgabv bunu gindungpingko vdwa mimu dubv vla ninyigv kochinglo vngmuto, ‘Ngonu so nyi sum ngonugv Dvbv bv vla mvngma dunv.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Nyi anga Dvbv bv mvtoku okv aakur toku. Nw pakbu vdwa ninyigv kaagialo lvkin gubv aadum dubv minto, bunu vdwgo pwkumpaakum pvdw um kaadubv vla. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Atokchogv angv aatoku okv minto, ‘Tamsarnv, ngo ain lokdwng charring go paakumpv noogv charkin go jiku lokv.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>‘Alvbv ripv,’ nw mintoku: ‘No alvnv pakbu go! no miangnv yikungyira lo jwkjwkvrwkbv rinv go, ngo nam pamtv vring nga rigvdubv jidunv.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Anyi nvnv pakbu angv aato okv minto, ‘Tamsarnv, ngo ain lokdwng charngu go paakumpv no gv charkin go jiku lokv.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>So anga nw minto, ‘No pamtv angu a rigvnvbv rire.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Pakbu gunv aato okv minto, ‘Tamsarnv, siinv noogv ain lokdwng ngv; ngo sam jeriap gulo vvsi pvnv. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Ngo nam busuto, ogulvgavbolo no nyi kingin nvgo. No nokv gvnga maka naadu okv noogv paklwk maanam humka nvvdu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Nw pakbu anga minto, ‘No alvmanv pakbu! ngo noogv mvnggwngbv alvmanv gaam um minnvla nam miakayare! No nga gwlwknv nyi go, ngo gvngv manv ngaaka naanv gubv okv ngoogv paklwk maanam humka nvvnv gubv chimpvi. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Alvdu, vbvrikunamv, no ogubv ngoogv morko nga Benk morko kuu bvngkulo lwkma pvnv? Vbvrikunamv ngo naakur rikunyi morko kuu a lvkobv naaku svnga.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Vbvrikunamv nw hoka daknv vdwa minto, ‘Nw gvlokv ain lokdwng nga naatokuka okv hum Pakbu ain lokdwng charring go doonv yanga jitoka.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Vbvritola bunu ninyia minto, ‘Tamsarnv, nw lokdwng charring go doogvla doopv!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>‘<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mt 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lk 8:18</ref></char></note>Ngo nonua mindunv,’ nw mirwkto, ‘Nyidum mvnwngnga yvvdw ogugo doodunv, hum jidv yayare; vbvritola yvvdw ogugoka kaama dunv, ninyigv achukgo doogv namaka um ninyigv lokv naaritre. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Vjak, ngoogv nyiru minsunv vdwa yvvbunudw nga bunugv Dvbv bv mvnwng madunv vdwa, bunua so naalwk tvka okv ngoogv dooku soka mvki tokuka!’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Jerusalem lo Dvbv bv aakunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mt 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Jisu hum mintoku okv vbvrikunamv bunua vngchoyala Jerusalem bv vngto. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Nw Betpej okv Betani gv adar Olib moodw lo aarilo, nw lvbwlaksu anyigo vngcho moto <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>svbv mingvrila: “Vngnyika nonugv vnglwkjiku nampum alo; nonugv vnglwk rilo, nonu siak ako riokwka manamgo takpvla vvpvnamgo kaapare. Um paksoklaila soka aagv tvika. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Nyi gonv nonua hum ogubv paksok dunv vla minbo loka, Ahtu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Atuv</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">so gv Atuv</char></note> sum dinchidukv vla ninyia minpa laka.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Bunu bunugv lamtvlo vngkunamv Jisu gv bunua minam jvbv ogumvnwng nga paatoku. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Bunugv siak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siak-yikungyira bagrianv svnwng, gora jvbvridunv</char></note> a paksok rilo, ho gv atu v bunua minto, “nonuno um ogubv paksok dunvla?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>“Ahtu sum dinchidu,” bunu mirwkto, <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>okv bunu siak a naalaila Jisu gvlo aagv jitoku. Vbvrikunamv bunu bunugv vji a siak aolo puchato okv Jisunyi siak aolo chadubv ridurto. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Ninyigv siak aolo vngrilo nyi vdwv lamtvlo bunugv vji vdwa pipv nyato.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Vdwlo Nw Jerusalem gv nvchilo aatokudw, Olib moodw bv lamtv ilwk jiku mooku hoka, ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv twngtv rungbv bunugv ninyigvlo kaanam mvnwngnga Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vla okv ninyia hartvla minrap nyatoku: <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Miri 118:26</ref></char></note>Pwknvyarnv ayalaka Dvbvnyi yvvdw Ahtu gv amin lokv aanvnga! Nyidomooku lo sarsopoyo reku okv Pwknvyarnv gvlo kairungbv!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Vbvrikunamv nyipam lokv Parisis megonv Jisunyi minto. “Tamsarnv,” bunu minto “Noogv lvbwlaksu vdwa choibvkv vla minto!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Ngo nonua mindunv bunu choi kubolo, vlwng vdwv bunu atuv gamtv rungbv rumrapre.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem gv lvkwngbv Jisu gv kapnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Nw pamtv lo aanwk lvlvto, okv vdwlo nw hum kaapa tokudw, nw ho gv lvgabv kapto, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>minto, “Nonu silu sarsopoyo gv lvgalo ogugo aadu nvdw um chinv guloka! Vbvritola nonu vjak um kaapa kumare! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Nonua nonugv nyimak vdwv aagvrila goyumgochila vnglin chaalin momabv tumla vvpv dw alu v aariku. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Bunu nonua achuk goka dooku madubv mvyak mvchakre okv nonugv vlwngsvlu arwnglo doonv nyi vdwaka; vlwng pwgoka dookulo doomu mare, ogulvgavbolo nonu Pwknvyarnv gv vdwlo nonua ringdubv vla aanama kaachin manam lvkwnglo!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo aatoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mt 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngtoku okv korvpachu pioknv vdwa charlin raptoku, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Aij 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note>bunua minto, “So si Darwknv Kitaplo lvkdu, ‘Ngoogv Naam a kumgingku naam bv vla mindunv.’ Vbvritola nonu hum chonvmvvnv tosiku bv mvpv!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 2:37">Lk 2:37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisu alu gv dwkia Pwknvyarnvnaam arwnglo tamsarto. Nyibu butvnv vdwv, Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv, okv nyi vdwa rigvnv vdwv Jisunyi mvki dubv mvngtoku, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>vbvritola bunu ninyia vbvridubv lamtv paanyu matoku, ogulvgavbolo nyi mvnwngngv ninyia tvvria bwngto, gamgoka nyemu nwngma vla mvngnyato.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv tujupkunam gv lvkwng nga tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mt 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Alu gulo Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo nyi vdwa tamsarla okv Gamlv nga japji rilo, nyibu butvnv vdwv okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv, nyiga vdwa lvkobv, aatoku <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>okv ninyia minto, “Ngonua mintamto, no ogubv svbv rimin dunv? Yvvla nam svbv rimin dubv jinv ngv?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Jisu bunua mirwksito, “Ngam nonua gaamgo tvu chomu labv. Ngam mintam labv, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Jon gv baptisma jinamv Pwknvyarnv gvlo kvre vmalo nyi gvlo kvre?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Bunu vdwv atu v larmi sirap nyato, “Ngonu ogu vla mindubv? Ngonu ‘Pwknvyarnv gvlokv’ vla minbolo, nw minrikuda, ‘V bolo nonu ogugbv Jonnyi mvngjwng mapvnv?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Vbvritola ngonu ‘Nyianyi gvlokv’ vla minbolo, so gv nyi nyipam vdwsi ngonua vlwng orgingre, ogulvgavbolo bunu Jonnyi nyijwk akobv pvbwng alvbv chinya dukunv.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu mirwkto, “Ngonu chima v ogulokv aapvnvdw.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Okv Jisu bunua mintoku, “Ngo ka nonua minjimare ogubv ngo so vdw sum ridu nvdw.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anggor rongo rwktin vdwa minchisinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mt 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Aij 5:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Vbvrikunamv Jisu so minchisinam sum bunua minjito: “Ho hoka nyi ako dooto hv anggor rongo mvto, um rijo naanv nyi vdwlo tinto, vbvrikunamv adubv relinnam lvgabv vnglintoku. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Vdwlo anggor naakumdwv aatokudw, nw nyira go rwktin vdwlo gvlo anggor ninyigv baak paase naarwk simu dubv vla vngmu toku. Vbvritola rwktin vdwv nyira anga dvngtola ogu goka jimabv vngkur motoku. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Vkvlvgabv nw nyira gunvnyi vngmuto; vbvritola rwktin vdwv ninyi nyika dvngdvto, hinyinghiru dubv mvto, okv ogugoka jimabv vngkur motoku. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Vbvrikunamv nw nyira aom nvnv nga vngmuto; rwktin vdwv ninyia ungnv gvdubv, mvdvto, okv ninyia agumlo dvato. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Vbrikunamv anggor rongo atuv mintoku, ‘Ngo ogugo riku nvpvdw? Ngo ngoogv paknam kuunyilo nga vngmu reku; bunu ninyia jvjvbv mvngdv jiriku!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Vbvritola vdwlo rwktin vdwv ninyia kaapa tokudw, bunugv aralo mimisinyato, ‘So si atu gv kuunyilo ngv. ‘Klai ninyia mvki laju, okv ninyigv yikungyira ngv ngonu gvbv rireku!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia anggor rongo agum dvlinto okv mvki toku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Vbvrikunamv, rongo atuv rwktin vdwa ogubv rireku?” Jisu tvkato. <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>“Nw aariku okv ho nyi vdwa mvki reku, okv anggor rongo nga kvvbi rwktin vdwlo laklwk reku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Vdwlo nyi vdwv sum tvvtokudw bunu minto, “Vbvrirung mare!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Miri 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jisu bunua kaagapto okv tvvkato, “Vbvrikunamv so darwknv kitap gv minam si ogu v?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Naam mvnv vdwgv toa kunam vlwng pwngv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">mvnwngnga dinchiyachok nvgobv rire.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Nyi mvnwngnga ho vlwng hoka hopv nvnga patungpayung mvre; okv ho vlwng angv nyi akonvgv aolo hoopv bolo, v ninyia amwkbv mvre.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lampu dorse lvkwng nga tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mt 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mk 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv okv nyibu butvnv vdwv, hoka Jisunyi naatung dubv rikwto, ogulvgavbolo ninyigv minchisinam minam angv bunua minyingdu vla bunu chintoku; vbvritola bunu nyi vdwa busu nyato. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu alvnv dw kaakarto. Bunu nyi mego arwnglo gwngla jisito bunua alvnv nyi go vla kaakudubvrinv nyi vkv, okv bunu ho vdwa Jisu gvlo vngmuto tvu gvrila naatung dubv vla vkvlvga bunu ninyi Roman nyigam lo laklwk ladukubv. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>So gv arwng gwngyanv vdwv Jisunyi minto, “Tamsarnv, ngonu chindu no ogugo mindudw okv tamsar dudw v jvjv ngv. Ngonu chindu no nyi gv mvngnam lokv kaamadu, vbvritola nyi gv lvgabv Pwknvyarnv gv mvngnam jvjv nga tamsaryado. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Ngonua mintam labv, Roman Dvbvyachoknyi ngonugv lampu jinam si ngonugv Pvbv nga rinying dunvri, vmalo rikin madunvri?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Vbvritola Jisu bunugv gwngnam a kaapa toku okv bunua minto, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Ngam lokdwng go kaatam labv. So si yvvgv nyukmu vla aminv doodunv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">“Dvbvyachok gv,” bunu mirwksito.<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu minto, “Alvdo, vbvrikunamv, Dvbvyachok gvnga Dvbvyachoknyi jitoka, okv Pwknvyarnv gvnga Pwknvyarnvnyi jilaka.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Vkvlvgabv nyi vdwgv kaagia hoka ogu goka bunu ninyia naatung nyula mato, vkvlvgabv bunu ninyigv mirwk nama lamrwpanya la choibv doonya toku.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sinam lokv turkurkunam lvkwng nga tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mt 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Nyim 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Vbvrikunamv Sadusis mego, yvvbunudw nyi vdwv sitokula turkur kumadunv vnv vdwv, Jisu gvlo aato okv minto, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Det 25:5</ref></char></note>Tamsarnv, Moses so Pvbv sum ngonugv lvgabv lvkpv jipvnv: ‘Nyi gonv nywng nga kuu dooma dwbv siyu bolo, ho siyu nvgv boruv hvngmi nga nywng mvrung tvka vkvlvgabv bunyiv kuu doogv rila sinv ho gv kuu bv mindu kubv.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Alu golo achiboru kanw go dooto; achi yachok v nyimv naatoku okv kuu dooma dwbv siyuto. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Vbvrikunamv boruya gonv nyimv nvnga nywngbv doogvto, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>okv boru aom nvnv ngvka. Vbvdvdvbv achiboru kanw mvnwnglo rito—bunu siyuto kuu dootv madvbv. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Mvnwng gv kochinglo, nyimv nvngv sitoku. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Vjak, sinv ngv turkurdw alulo, nyimv nvngv yvvgv nywngbv rirekudw? Mvnwng kanw v ninyia nywng mvpv.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Vjakgv nyiga mvvga ngv nywng nyilubv rimi sidu, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>vbvritola nyiga okv mvvga ngv yvvdw sinam lokv turkur kuji bongv okv singnam gunv tolo doojinv v nywng nyilubv rimi sikumare. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Bunu nyidogindung vdw jvbv rire okv sinyu kumare, bunu Pwknvyarnv gv kuu vdwvku, ogulvgavbolo bunu sito koola turrap kunvngv. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Mog 3:6</ref></char></note>Sinam lokv turkurkunama Moses ka chimbwk toku. Lvklin jinamlo yamdwng yamchumlo vmv gunam gv lvkwng nga nw Atu gvbv minto ‘Abraham gv Pwknvyarnv ngv, Isaak gv Pwknvyarnv ngv, okv Jakob gv Pwknvyarnv ngv.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Nw turnv vdwgv Pwknvyarnv ngv, sinv gvngvma, ninyigv lvgabv mvnwngngv turdunv.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Pvbv tamsarnv megonv goklinto, “Alvbv mirwknam go, Tamsarnv!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Bunu ninyia ho lvkwngbv tvu dukubv choopu kuma toku.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristo lvkwngbv tvunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mt 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Jisu bunua tvvkato, “Kristo Dabid gv husi v vla oguaingbv minpvnv? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42,43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Miri 110:1</ref> </char></note>Dabid nw atuv mirimimpak kitaplo minsuto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Ahtu ngoogv Ahtunyi minto:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Ngoogv lakbiklo dootungto<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>vdwlo ngo noogv nyimak vdwa lvpa lvging nvnv aingbv mvla noogv lvchulo vvpvma dvdvlobv.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Dabid ninyia ‘Ahtu’ vla minto; oguaingbv, vbvrikunamv, Kristo Dabid gv husi bv rila rinv?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pvbv tamsarnv vdwa gamrw toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mt 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Nyi vdwgv ninyia tvvla doorilo, Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Pvbv tamsarnv vdwa nonu himasuto laka, bunu bunugv jvtvlaklwk a kotola daakar svnga mvngbiu dunv okv pyokpamdorpam lo vngkar gvrila mvngdv kodubv mvngbiu dunv; bunu jius kumkunaam vdwlo dooku a okv dvpam dvkulo alvyachoknv dooku a gakcho dunv; <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Bunu hvngmi vdwlo riborilit mingla okv bunugv naam vdwa dvrit papi jila, okv kaakudubv vla asu dubv kumla! bunua achialvbv alvmanam gubv mvritre!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Hvngmi gv daan jinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mk 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Jisu kaitkarto okv nyitvnv nyi vdwv bunugv daan a Pwknvyarnvnaam gv morko vvgia nvnv arwnglo paalwk dubv kaapato. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Okv nw hvngmi go achialv heema nvgo aala ain lokdwng charnyi go lwkdubv kaapa dvto. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Nw minto, “Ngo nonua mindunv so gv heemanv hvngmi angv kvvbi mvnwngnga kaiyabv lwkgv nyibv. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Kvvbi vdwv bunugv nyitv laila lvvlin kunvnga amin bv lwkdunv; vbvritola nw, achialvbv heema dvlaka, dvtvsinv nvnvnga jitar pagvyibv.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnvnaam gv yakse nga Jisu mintoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Mt 24:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mk 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Lvbwlaksu megonv Pwknvyarnvnaam gv lvkwng nga minto, so gv alvnv vlwng v achialvbv kaapuv okv Pwknvyarnvnyi amin jinam vdwv. Jisu minto, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Nonugv kaanam mvnwng si—alu go looriku vdwlo vlwng pwgoka dookulo dooku mare; mvnwng a orlula ora reku.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adwkaku okv mvdwkmvku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mt 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Bunu tvvkato, “Tamsarnv,” “Vdwlo so vdw si ritv dunv? Okv so vdwgv ridw v aatv riku vla kaatam nvnvbv ogugo ritv rinvla?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Jisu minto, “Hima tvlaka; kupku yoka. Nyi achialvgo, ngo yamabv vla nga minre, v aare okv minre, ‘Ngo kunv nw!’ okv, ‘Dw v aaduku!’ Vbvritola bunua vngming gvyoka. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Vdwlo nonu nyimak okv mvyakminsu nama busu mabvka; vkv nvngv richola rirungjinv, vbvritola vkv nvngv rinya alu v nvchi duku vla minam kaama.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Nw minbwngto, “Mooku vdwv padar minsureku; Karv ngv Karv gonyi palwk reku. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Hoka achialvbv hilamanam moobi v hwkriku, dvmayarwng, okv yipvyvlam v mooku mvnwnglo rire; nyidomooku tolokv kaaka manam okv arwsinyi nvngv ire. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>So mvnwng gv rima dwbv, nonua naatung reku okv mvdwkmvku reku; nonua Jius vdwgv kumkunaamlo mvmin dubv laklwk reku, okv patwklo lwkreku; nonua ngoogv lvgabv Dvbv vdwgv rigvnv vdwgv kaagialo daklin moreku. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>So si alvnv dw v nonugv lvgabv Alvnv Yunying a mintam jidubv. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14,15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11">Lk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char></note>Nonugv mvngnamsaknam a mvngcho richo laka oguaingbv atu v mvnging sila minse rise vdw vla busukano madubv, <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>ogulvgavbolo ngo nonua vkvnv gaam okv mvnglak ha jire nonugv nyiru minsinam vdwv yvvka nonugv gaam minama tvvlakaala vmalo raarwksila maadubv. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Nonua laklwk jikunv nonugv Anvabu, nonugv abwngboru, nonugv amiasa, okv nonugv ajin vdwv; nonua megonyi mvkire. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Ngoogv lvgabv nonua nyi mvnwngngv kaanwng mare. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Vbvritola nonugv dwmw sogo nvka ngoomare. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Gwlwkbv dakto laka okv nonu atuv ringsu reku.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Jerusalem gv Daryak svnga mintoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mt 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mk 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Vdwlo nonu Jerusalem a sipai vdwv dakyum dubv kaaparidw, vbvrikunamv si baapu bv yakriku vla nonu chinre. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Vbvrikunamv yvvbunudw Judia lo doodunv moodw bv kicha rungre; yvvbunudw pamtv arwnglo doodunv vngro laka, okv yvvbunudw mooku agum lo doodunv v pamtv arwnglo aarung mabvka. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9:7</ref></char></note>Ho vdwv ‘Mvritririt alu hv,’ Darwknv Kitaplo minam mvnwngnga jvjv bv rilin modubv. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Vdwgo mvngdwknam gubv rire ho alu hoka yvv nyimv ngv leit lo kuu gvnv okv anv ngv anga ajingnv doogvnv! achialvbv alvmanv go so kvdw so rilwkre, okv Pwknvyarnv gv mvrit v so nyi vdwlo aare. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Megonyi riokse lokv pakire, okv kvvbi vdwa mooku mvnwnglo tumla vvpvre; okv nyi kvvbi Pwknvyarnvnyi chimanv vdwv nw bunugv dwhv vngma dvdvlo Jerusalem a chaatin la vvpvre.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyia Kuunyilo gv aakunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mt 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Aij 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eje 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Jol 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Nyikrw 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref></char></note>Nyidomooku doonyi tolo ogu kaakwmanam go rilinre, poolu loka, okv takar vdwloka. Sichingmooku mvnwnglo turdubv mvngmin kuma reku, Svmasa gv sudu a tvvla okv sekiok gv kioknam vdwa kaala busu nyareku. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Sichingmooku mvnwng so ogugo ritv tvdu nvbvre vla nyi vdwv mvngngak sangakla anyu kumabv doore, aotolo gv jwkrw ngvka ngooriku. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Nyikrw 1:7</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv Nyia Kuunyilo ngv, doomwk lo kaibv yunglit rungnam gubvrila aalwk reku. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Vdwlo so vdw si ridukubv vla rirap tvri kunyi, dakrap lakuka okv nonugv dumpo v baarap lakuka, ogulvgavbolo nonugv ringlinbaalin v nvchi duku.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koksitkokrik singnv lo kaachin sinam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mt 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu so minchisinam sum bunua minjito: “Koksitkokrik singnv hala okv kvvbi singnv mvnwng haka mvngkw toka. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Vdwlo bunugv anw hv harlin tvvnam a nonu kaapa rikunyi, dwrw hv nvchi duku vla nonu chindo. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Ho apiabv, vdwlo soogv vdw sum ridu kubv nonu kaapa kubolo, Pwknvyarnv gv Karv gv aadw hv nvchi duku vla nonu chinreku.”<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Mvnggap tvvlaka vjakgv rinv nyi mvnwng si sitv maadvbv so gv vdw si rilin reku. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Sichingmooku okv nyidomooku hv ngelare vbvritola ngoogv gamchar vdwv vdwloka ngela mare.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dooya dvbv rikunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Himasuto laka! dvpam okv dvnamtvngnam yayabv rila nonugv so singnam a atu v mvngdwk mvngkubv rimu mabvka, ho gv alu hv nonua lamdubv loopu jila <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>amin mvnam jvbv. Ho hv Sichingmooku mvnwng gv nyi mvnwng gv aolo aalwkre. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Chvrv nvgobv rito laka okv loki ha kumlaka so mvnwng gv riri kunyi nonua ogu riakuma dubv okv nyia kuunyilo gv kaagialo dakdu kubv.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19:47</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisu ho alu mvnwng a Pwknvyarnvnaam lo tamsarla dootoku, okv vdwlo ariumv aato kudw, nw Olib Moodw lo ayu a doolwk toku. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Arukamchi dwkibv nyi vdwv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo nw gvlo tvvria dubv vla vngnya toku.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Nyirunv vdwv Jisunyi rinying toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mt 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mk 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Mog 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vpap lwkmabv vtwng dvbamnam alu v nvchi toku, ho hum Vngbo dvmdvin vla minto. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Nyibu butvnv vdwv okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv nyi vdwa busu nyato, vkvlvgabv bunu Jisunyi tosila mvkidubv vla lamtv makar nyato.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Judas koa dukubv tolwk toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mt 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mk 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Vbvrikunamv lvbwlaksu nyidum vring gola anyi lokv Judas, Iskeriot vla minam gvlo Uyu ngv aatoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Vbvrikunamv Judas Nyibu butvnv vdwgv okv Pwknvyarnvnaam ha kaayanv vdwgv nyigam gv dookulo nw Jisunyi oguaingbv bunu gvlo kublwk nyuku sengvdw ho lvga nga mintebv vngtoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Bunu mvngpula ninyia morko jidukubv mintoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Judas hum tolwk toku okv nw Jisunyi nyi chimpa madubv bunu gvlo laklwk dukubv vla alvnv dw marap toku.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu vngbo dvmin dvdubv mvraprirap toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mt 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Hoka vpap lwkmabv vtwng nga dvdw okv svlarkuu a vngbodvmin gv lvgabv palwkdw pumja alu v loolwk toku. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Jisu Pitar okv Jonnyi svbv mingvrila vngmuto: “Vngnyika okv ngonugv lvgabv vngbo dvmin dvnam a dvdubv mvpvripv tvka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Bunu ninyia tvvkato, “No ngonua ogolo mvpvripv tvka vla mvngdunv?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Nw mirwkto, “Nonu gv pamtv vlo arwnglo aarilo, nyiga ako isi opum bvngnv go nonua vngrwksire. Ninyia vngming gvla ninyigv naam arwngbv aakulo aaming gvlaka, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>okv naam atua minlaka: ‘Tamsarnv nam mindu, ngo okv ngoogv lvbwlaksu vdwgv vngbo dvmin dvnam dvjiku karchung ngv ogolo?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Nw nonua aolo kaapu dubv mvnam karchung go kaatamre, hoka nonu ogumvnwng nga mvpvripv dukubv kaapare.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Bunu vngtoku okv Jisu gv bunua minam aingbv ogumvnwngnga kaapa toku, okv bunu vngbo dvmin dvnam a mvpvripv toku.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ahtu gv Dvtardvnya dvgvnam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mt 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mk 14:22-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Vdwlo dw v aato kudw, Jisu Apostol vdwa lvkobv dvkulo dootoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Nw bunua minto, “Ngoogv hinching chingma dwbv ngo nonua lvkobv so vngbo dvmin dvnam sum dvnwng dunv! <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Ho lvga ngo nonua mindunv, Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo so gv lvga nga alvbv rilin jima dvdvlo ngo vdwloka sum dvmare.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu koobu a naarapto, Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vla minto, okv minto, “Sum naato okv nonugv apumlo nonu atu v ormisito. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Ngo nonua mindunv vjak lokv rila vdwlo Pwknvyarnv gv Karv ngv aama dvdvlo ngo vdwloka sum tvngnam sum tvngmare.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Vbvrikunamv nw vtwng ariap ha naato, okv Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vla minto, hum pintungpiungto, okv hum bunua jitola, minto, “Si ngoogv ayak adwn v, sum nonugv lvgabv jipvnv. Ngam mvngpa gvnvbv sum rito laka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char></note>Ho apiabv, nw bunua dvnam dvro kochingbv koobu ha jitola, minto “So koobu si nonugv lvgabv ngoogv oyi sarlin kunamv si Pwknvyarnv gv anw bv milv jikunama mvu pvvku namv.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado Jisu gv gaamchar vdwv kochinglo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">si ngoogv ayakhv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bars 19, lo okv bars 20 gv mvnwnglo. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Miri 41:9</ref></char></note>Vbvritola, kaatoka! ngam koanv angv vjak ngoogv dookulo tvbul si lvkobv doodu! <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Nyia Kuunyilo ngv Pwknvyarnv gv minam aingbv sire, vbvritola vdwgo mvngdwk rekudw nga koanv angv!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Vbvrikunamv bunugv apum lo tvvka minsu toku bunugv lokv yvvdw vbv ritv tvdunv vla.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaiyachoknam gv lvgabv larmisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mt 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mk 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Lk 9:46</ref></char>
    </note>Lvbwlaksu vdwv bunugv arwnglo larmi sinyato bunugv lokv yvv yadw kaiyachok nvgobv riji kunv vla. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25,26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mt 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mk 10:42-44</ref></char></note>Jisu bunua minto, “Pwknvyarnvnyi chimanv vdwgv Dvbv ngv bunugv nyi vdwa kaiyadunv, okv dvbv vdwv ‘Nyi vdwgv ajin’ vla amina gakdu. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mt 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref></char></note>Vbvritola so gv rinam si nonu gvlo doomare; vmabvya, nonu gvlo kaiyachok jinv ngv mvnwngnga miangyachok nvgobv rire okv rigvnv gubv rijinv pakbu aingbv rirungre. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Jn 13:12-15</ref></char></note>Yvvla kainv, dvdubv vla dootungnv angv re vmalo ninyia jirianv angv re? Dootungnv angv, v rung. Vbvritola nonu gvlo ngo jirianv angv aingbv ridu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Ngo gv hirukaya kolo nonu nga lvkobv doomwng gvto; <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>okv ngoogv Abu nga rigv dubv jinam aingbv ngo nonua jidunv. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mt 19:28</ref></char></note>Nonu ngoogv Karv lo dvgianvnv lo doopv tvla dvriku okv tvngriku, okv Dvbv dogianvnv lo doopv tvla Israel gv nyi haalung vring gola anyia rigv reku.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pitar gv mvvse nga mincho jitoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mt 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>“Saimon, Saimon! Tvriato! Uyu hv nonu mvnwngnga rika dubv vla rinv nvnga naagv nyibv, alvmanv lokv alv nvnga naapin sidubv vla, rongo rinv nyi ako gv aam-tami a amsok-misok lokv naapin sunam aingbv. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Vbvritola ngo nonugv lvgabv kumpvnv, Saimon, no gv mvngjwng ngv ngooma dubv. Okv vdwlo no nga dakrwk rikudw no noogv boru vdwa abwk mola kuka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Pitar mirwksito, “Ahtu, ngo nam lvkobv patwk tumjeka sida jeka reming gvdubv mvngpvla doodunv!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>“Pitar nam ngo mindunv,” Jisu minto, “Siyunyi rokpu v kokma dwbv no ngam chimapvnv vla lvomgo minre.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Morko gvnvnv, Riokse, okv Kochak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9">Mt 10:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mk 6:8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Lk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref></char>
    </note>Vbvrikunamv Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa tvvkato, “Ngoogv nonua morko gvnvnv, gvgianvnv vmalo lvsup jimabv vnglin mori hoka ogu chiimanvgo doopire?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">“Oguka ma” bunu mirwkto.<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>“Vbvritola vjak,” Jisu minto, “Yvvdw morko gvnvnv vmalo gvgianvnv doodunv ung naarung toku laka; okv yvvdw riokse dooma dunv hv ninyigv vji laklwk a pioktola ako rvvla kuka. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Aij 53:12</ref></char></note>Ngo nonua mindunv Darwknv Kitaplo mindu, ‘Nw rimur nvgv gungnying nga gvvria jito,’ vnam ngoogv lvga ngv jvjvbv aarung reku, ogulvgavbolo ngoogv lvga nga lvknam v jvjv bv rilin reku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv minto, “Kaatoka! Ahtu, So si riokse sonyi go doopv!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">“Hv chipvku!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hv chipvku</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sogv chinamso</char></note> nw mirwk toku.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Olib Moodw gv aolo kumtoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mt 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Jisu pamtv nga vngyula vngtoku, ninyigv kvvlo gv vngchingbv, Olib Moodw lo; okv lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia lvkobv vngto. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Vdwlo nw dooku hoka vngchi tokudw, nw bunua minto, “No pokayarka kolo ngoolwk madubv kumto laka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Vbvrikunamv nw bunua mego adubv vngyu dvla vlwng ngv kongchi dubv rikulo vngla nw lvbwng v kumpvto okv kumtoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>“Abu” nw minto, “No mvngdu boloka, hinching gv koobu sam ngo gvlokv naapak jilabv. Ngoogv mvngnam bvma vbvritola noogv mvngnambv rilaka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Nyidomooku tolokv nyidogindung go ninyi gvlo aalwkto okv ninyia ridurto. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Achialvbv mvngdwk laila nw kadwk yayabv kumto; ninyigv haar hv oyi jvbv kvdw lo sarluto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo bases 43-44 sii omado</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Kumku lokv taprap lakula, nw lvbwlaksu vdwgv dookulo aakur toku okv bunua yupngakla doodubv kaapa toku, mvngdwk hv bunua dwkyup gvdubv. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Nw bunua minto, “Ogubv nonu yupmin dunv? Gudungla kumla dootoka nonu gwngka kolo ngoolwk madubv.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi naatung kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mt 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jn 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Jisu gv raadung rilo nyipam go aalwkto, Judas, lvbwlaksu vring gola anyi lokv akonv aagvto. Nw Jisu gvlo chaato okv ninyia moopupto. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Vbvritola Jisu minto, “Judas, moopup akolo no Nyia Kuunyilo nga koa duku nvri?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Vdwlo Jisunyi hoka lvkobv rinv vdwv ho gv ritv nama kaapa gvrila Jisunyi tvkato, “Ahtu ngonu ngonugv riokse lokv rirap svgo bri?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Okv bunugv lokv akonv nyibu Butvyachok nvgv nyira nga nyarung rungbik ha palu toku.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Vbvritola Jisu minto, “So gotoku!” Nw nyi angv gv nyarung nga mvsit to okv ninyia mvpu toku.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu nyibu butvnv vdwa okv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo dakria nvgv nyigam vdwa okv nyiga vdw yvv ninyia naabv aanv vdwa minto, “Nonuno ngam Pvbv agumlo rinv nyi aing gubv, riokse okv daadwng bvngla aapvi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> Ngo Pwknvyarnvnaam lo loki a nonua lvkobv rebwngto, okv nonuno nga naatung dubv rikw mato. Vbvritola kanv gv gwlwk v rigvdogvri so, si nonugv ridw vku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar Jisunyi chimakv vkunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mt 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mk 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jn 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Bunu Jisunyi naatung toku okv ninyia Nyibu Butvyachok nvgv naam lo vnggv toku; okv Pitar mego adubv vngming gvto. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Kvba baaku naam gv adar lo vmv nga parto, okv Pitar hum dooyumnv vdwa doomwng gvto. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Vdwlo paknv akonv ninyia vmvlo doodubv kaapa tokudw, nw kaagap lalato ninyia okv minto, “So nyi angv si ka Jisu gv rikulo reming gvnv!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Vbvritola Pitar hum miasuto, “Nyimv angv, ngo ninyia chimaka nvgo!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Achukgo ayungjvma nga nyi akonv Pitarnyi kaachinto okv minto, “No ka bunugv lokv akonv!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Vbvritola Pitar mirwkto, “Nyi angv, ngo ma!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Okv ayungjvma gv kochinglo nyi akonv ninyia minggap lala la minto, “Nw Jisunyi riming gvnv ngv vnam so mvngbwk masego kaama ogulvgavbolo nw ka Galili gv nyi go!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Vbvritola Pitar mirwkto, “Nyi angv, no ogu gonyi mindudw ngo chima!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Vjakgobv, ninyigv vbv mindung rilo, rokpu v koktoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Ahtu kaitkarto okv Pitarnyi kaagapto, okv Pitar mvngpa toku Ahtu gv ninyia minam a, “Siyu gv ayulo rokpu v kokma dwbv no nga chima vla lvom go minre.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Pitar agumbv vngtoku okv achialvbv mvngdwkla kaptoku.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi nyarjinam okv dvngkunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mt 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mk 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Jisunyi kaayanv nyi vdwv ninyia minjikminbikto okv ninyia dvngto. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Bunu ninyia nyik a putumto okv ninyi tvkato, “Yvvla nam dvngnv ngv? Mvngjwk kaato!” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Okv bunu ninyia nyarjikau gaam vkv awgo minto.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi kvba baakulo daklin monam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mt 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jn 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Vdwlo bunu aato kudw, nyiga vdwv, nyibu butvnv vdwv, okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv lvkobv kaarwksuto, okv Jisunyi kvba vdwgv kaagialo daklin motoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Bunu minto, “Ngonua mintamto, no Kristo rungre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Nw mirwkto, “Ngo nonua mintam jvka, nonu ngam mvngjwng mare; <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Okv ngo nonua tvu sego tvka jvka nonu mirwk simare. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Vbvritola vjak lokv Nyia Kuunyilo ngv kaiyachoknv Pwknvyarnv gv lakbiklo dooreku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Bunu mvnwngngv mintoku, “Vbvrikunamv, no Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngvre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Nw bunua mirwkto, “Nonu gv minam hv ngo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Okv bunu minto, “Ngonu kvvbi gungnying yago mvngkuma! Nw ogugo minpvdw ngonu tvvgap tokubv!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Pilot gvlo boolwk kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mt 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Nyi mvnwngngv gudungto okv Jisunyi Pilot gv dookulo aagv toku. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Hoka bunu ninyi gungnying lwkrapto “Ngo so nyi sum ngonugv nyi vdwa rimur gvdubv Dvbvyachoknyi lampu jima bvkv vla okv nw atu v Kristo, okv Dvbv gubv minsu dubv naatung pvnv.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilot ninyia tvkato, “No Jius vdwgv Dvbv ngvre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">“No mingvnyibv,” Jisu mirwkto.<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Vbvrikunamv Pilot Nyibu butv vdwa okv nyipam vdwa minto, “Ngo so nyi sum rimur rinam go mapama.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Vbvritola bunu tvvmabv abuyayabv minto, “Judia lo nw gv tamsar kolo nyi vdwa yalung durap moto. Nw Galili lo rirapto okv alo gvngv si rilwk dukunv.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Herod gvlo boolwk jitoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Vdwlo Pilot hum tvvpa tokudw, nw tvkato, “So nyi si Galili lokv nyi ngvre?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Vdwlo Pilot Jisu nyi Herod gv rigvnam mooku lokv vla chinto kudw nw Jisunyi Herod gvlo vngmuto, ho gv dw lo Herod Jerusalem lo dootato. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Vdwlo Herod Jisunyi kaato kudw nw achialvbv himputo, ogulvgavbolo nw Jisu gv lvga nga tvvpato okv kvvlo gv lokv ninyia achialvbv kaanwngla dooto. Nw Jisu nyi lamrwpadubv mvnam rinam go kaanvpv vla dvminla dooto. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Vkvlvgabv Herod Jisunyi achialvbv tvula tvkato, vbvritola Jisu mirwk sima toku. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Nyibu butvnv vdwv okv Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv aanwk yayala Jisunyi achialvbv gungnying lwkto. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Herod okv ninyigv sipai vdwv Jisunyi nyarjikaola mvritto; vbv mvgvrila bunu ninyi alvnv vji go pilwkto okv Pilot gvlo vngkur motoku. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>So gv alu lokv Herod la Pilot bunyi ajin minsu toku; kvvlo bunyi anyi hv nyiru minsito.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi simu dukubv minkunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mt 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilot Nyibu butvnv vdwa, nyiga vdw, okv nyi vdwa gokkumto, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>okv bunua minto, “Nonu so nyi sum ngoogvlo aagvpv, okv nw nyi vdwa rimur gvdu vla. Vjak, okv ngo nonugv kaaku so ninyia jwngkadaka toku, okv ngo ninyia nonugv minam gungnying akoka mapa yama. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Herod ka ninyia rimur go mapa mato vkvlvga nw ninyia ngonu gvlo jikur duku. Ninyi mvkidubv rimur ako ka mapama. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Vkvlvgabv ngo ninyi senyak pala mvrit mogvrila okv ninyi vngmu reku.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo bars 17 sum lvktamdu: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vngbodvnam Pumja ngv rirap dwkibv Pilot gvlo vkvnv ribwng namgo dooto patwklo tumnam nyi vdwlokv akonyi nyi vdwgv koonam anga anyubv limu dukubv</char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Kaatoka Mk 15.6) </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Vngbo dvmin pumja alu lori gv dwkia Pilot bunugv lvgabv patwklo tumla vnam nyi ako limu dukunv.<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Nyipam lokv nyi mvnwngngv achialvbv gokla minto, “Ninyia mvkito! ngonugv lvgabv Barabasnyi limu toku!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barabasnyi patwk tumla vvpvto Pamtv arwnglo yalung dula gwngrw gwkunam lvgabv.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilot Jisunyi limu dukubv mvngto, vkvlvgabv nw nyipam vdwa lvko alvbv mindvto. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Vbvritola bunu gokkorla minto, “Ninyia Daapolo takkito! Ninyia Daapolo takkito!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilot bunua lvom nvbv minto,, “Vbvritola nw ogu rimur go ripvla? Ngo ninyia mvki dubv ogu ka rimur go mapa yama! Ngo ninyia svnyak pala mvmu gvrila okv ninyia topu reku.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Vbvritola bunu Jisunyi Daapo lo takki rungto ka vla bunugv gaam v gamtvyayabv gokbwngto, okv goknyung nga bunu gokjik toku. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Vkvlvgabv Pilot bunugv mingkubv Jisunyi lvklin jitoku. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Nw bunugv koonam nyi yvvdw yalung dukulo gwngrw gwto la patwk tumnam angaka topu jitoku, okv nw Jisunyi bunu gvlo laklwk jitoku bunugv mvngwngbv rimu dukubv vla.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Daapo lo takki kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mt 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Sipai vdwv Jisunyi vnggv toku, okv bunugv vngdungrilo, bunu Sairene lokv nyi ako aminv Saimon vnamgo mooku lokv pamtv bv aatv nvgo vngrwk sito. Bunu ninyia naatungto, Daapo nga nw gvlo joopvto, okv nw bakla Jisu kochinglo vngming gvdubv mvtoku.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Okv nyi vdwv achialvbv twngtv bv ninyia vngming gvtoku; bunu lokv nyi kvgunv anvnyimv vdwv nw gv lvgabv kapnv okv dwknv vdwv. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Jisu bunua dakrwkto okv minto, “Jerusalem gv anvnyimv vdwa! Ngo gv lvgabv kapyo ka, vbvritola nonu atugv lvgabv okv nonugv kuu vdwgv lvga bvyaka. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Vkvnv alu v aariku vdwlo nyi vdwv minreku, ‘Vdwgo gamdak dukunv yvv anvnyimv vdwloka kuu dooka manv, yvvka anga bvngka manv, yvv bunua soocha manv!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Nyikrw 6:16</ref></char></note> V alu vna vdwlo nyi vdwv moodw ditv am minre, ‘Ngonua gijap labv!’ okv dichingnv vdwa, ‘Ngonua girum labv!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Vdwlo singnv ngv yajila leelak rilo vbv ritv kunv, vdwlo singku bolo ogubv rirekudw?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Rimurnv nyi anyi goka Jisu nyi lvkobv mvkidubv vla vnglin gvdvto. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Vdwlo bunu “Dumku” vnam mooku gulo aalwk tokudw hoka bunu Jisunyi Daapo lo takki toku, okv rimurnv anyi aka, akonyi ninyigv lakbik tangvlo okv akonyi ninyigv lakchi tangvlo. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Miri 22:18</ref></char></note> Jisu minto, “Abu! bunugv rimur a mvngnga laka, bunu chima bunu ogugo ridudw.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jisu minto, “Abu! bunugv rimur a mvngnga laka, bunu chima bunu ogugo ridudw.” vnam vdw si</char></note> Bunu ninyigv vji a amin chinkala baakminsuto <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Miri 22:7</ref></char></note>Nyi vdwv kaadung nyato vdwlo Jius nyi ringnv vdwgv ninyi nyarjikao mvri-hoka: “Nw kvvbi ha ringdu; nw atubongv ringsu momuto nw Pwknvyarnv gv gaknam Kristo ngvbolo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Miri 69:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Sipai vdwvka ninyi nyarjikao dvto: bunu nw gvlo chaato okv ninyi opo vkv jito, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>okv minto, “No Jius gv Dvbv ngvbolo no atuv ringsu laka!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Ninyigv aolo svbv lvkla vvpvto: “So si Jiu vdwgv Dvbv ngv.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Hoka daapolo takdala takpvnam nyi rimurnv akonv ninyia nyarjito: “No Kristo malare? No atuv ringsu tvka okv ngonua ka!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Kvvbi akonv ninyi yamla minto “No Pwknvyarnvnyi busu malare? Nw gv rinam apiabv no ka paadu. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Ngonugv si rijik kv ogu lvga vbolo ngonu ogugo ripvdw um ngonu paadu; vbvritola nw ogu rimur goka rima.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Okv nw Jisu nyi minto, “Ngam mvngpa labvka, Jisu, vdwlo no Dvbv gubvrila aari kunyi!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Jisu hum minto, “Ngoona milv jidunv selu gv lokv no nga lvkobv nyidomooku tolo doore.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv sikunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mt 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Doonyi chaato bv ritoku ho doonyi v nyiku mato okv mooku mvnwngngv gumta aom go kanvla dootoku; <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Mog 26:31-33</ref></char></note>okv Pwknvyarnv naam gv vji rvdala vvpv namv taknyi gubv takpin suto. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Miri 31:5</ref></char></note>Jisu gamtv rungbv gokla kapto, “Abu! Noogv laak lo ngoogv yalu a laklwk dukunv!” Nw vla minto okv sitoku.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Sipai nyigam angv ogugo ripvdw um kaatoku okv nw Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvla minto, “Jvjvbv nw alvnv nyi go!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Vdwlo nyi vdwv hoka dookumnv vdwv ogugo ripv kudw kaanam dvdv nga kaatokula, bunu mvnwngngv naam bv vngtoku, mvngdwk laila bunugv hakwng a kisu nyato. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Lk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char></note>Yvvbunudw Jisu nyi nyidum tungnyibv chinto kudw, anvnyimv Galili lokv ninyi vngming gvnv vdwv, adulo daktola kaaria nyatoku.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi nyibung riikunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51"/>Hoka Josep vnam nyi ako dooto nw Judia gv banggu, Arimatia lokv. Nw alvnv nyi go, mvngdwnam nyi go, nw Pwknvyarnv gv Karv gv aanama kaayala doonvgo. Nw kvba baanv gv nyi ako bv rijvka, nw bunugv minbwk nama okv rinam a tolwk mingv mato. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Nw Pilot gv dookulo aato okv Jisu gv svma nga kooto. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Vbvrikunamv nw svma nga naalu toku, hum alvrungnv vji jebor v kvlap toku, okv um vlwnglo runglwknam nyibung svma lwkkw manam guloka joolwkla vvpv toku. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Ho alu v Gumpualu alu bv ritoku, okv Jius doonualu hv loorap tvvtoku.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Galili lokv anvnyimv Jisu nyi vngming gvnv vdwv Josepnyi lvkobv vngtoku okv nyibung nga okv Jisugv svma ayak a oguaingbv hoka lwkpvdw hum kaatoku. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Mog 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Det 5:14</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv bunu naam bv vngkur toku okv nampunv vkv mvpvripv toku svma ayak gv lvgabv.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Pvbv gv minkubv, Jius doonu alu lo bunu doonu nyatoku.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Turkurkunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mt 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Vjwngalu gv arukamchi bv anvnyimv vdwv nyibung lo vngto, bunugv mvnam nampunv vkv bvngla ila. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Nyibung agv aaku vlwng nga ngora rodubv bunu kaapa toku, <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>vkvlvgabv bunu arwnglo aatoku vbvritola bunu Ahtu Jisu gv svma nga kaapa kumato. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Bunu hum abwk kumabv hoka daktoku, lamdubv nyi anyigo achialvbv ungnv vji gvnv vkv bunu gvlo daklwkto. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Anvnyimv vdwv, achialvbv busu laila bunu kwdilo guplwk toku, nyi anyiv anvnyimv vdwa svbv minto, “Turkunv nyi anga sinv vdwlo nonu ogubv kaakar dunv? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mt 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">20:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note> Nw si dooma; nw turrap roku. Galili lo nw gv riri hoka nonua ogugo nw minpvdw hum mvngpa toka: <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Nyia Kuunyilo nga rimurnv nyi vdwgv laak lo laklwk reku, hum daapo lo takki reku, okv alu loum kochingbv turkur reku.’”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Vbvrikunamv anvnyimv vdwv nw gv minam a mvngpa toku, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>nyibung lokv vngkur toku, okv ogumvnwngnga lvbwlaksu vring gola akin vdwa minpa toku okv kvvbi mvnwng haka. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Anvnyimv vdwv Meri Magdalene, Joana, okv Jems gv anv Meri; bunu okv bunua vngming gvnv kvvbi anvnyimv vdwvka ogu mvnwng sam apostol vdwa minpa toku. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Vbvritola apostol vdwv anvnyimv vdwgv minam si minamminsubv mindu nvgo vla mvngtoku, okv bunu anvnyimv vdwa mvngjwng mato. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Vbvritola Pitar dokrap toku okv nyibung bv joktoku; nw gublwk toku okv vji kvlap kvchap nvnv jebor a kaapa nyumtoku okv ogu ka kaama toku. Vbvrikunamv ogugo ripv kudw hum lamrw palaku nw naam bv vngkur toku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo bars 12 si doomado</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emmaus lo vngkar kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mk 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ho gv alu akin hoka Jisunyi riming gvnv anyigo nampum aminv Emmaus vnamlo vngdubv vla vngdungto, hv Jerusalem lokv adu v kilomitar vring gola akin gubv rito, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Okv bunu ogugo ripv kudw ho mvnwng gv lvga nga raamisito. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Vbv bunu raami sula okv mimi surilo Jisu nyi atu v bunugv nvchilo aanwkto okv bunua lvkobv vngming gvto; <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>bunu ninyia kaato, vbvritola ninyia kaabwk mato. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Ogugola, nonugv vngying dula raami svgv dvnammv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Bunu mvngdwk dula, dakbwngto. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Bunugv lokv akonvgv aminv Kleopas vnam hv ninyia tvvkato, “No Jerusalem so kaalwkbv aanv vmwngre sogv lonyi loum sokv ogu rinama chima dunv?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Nw tvvkato, “Ogu gula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Bunu mirwkto, “Najaret lokv Jisunyi rinam mamnv,” “So nyi angv si nyijwk go nw Pwknvyarnv nyila okv nyi mvnwngnga mvngpu dubv rila, ninyigv rinam minam mvnwngngv jwkrw doonv gubv okv kairungnv nyijwk gubvrila kaatam toku. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Ngonugv nyibu butvnv vdwv okv rigvdogvnv vdwv ninyia mvki tuku vla laklwk la lvklin jitoku, okv ninyi daapolo takki toku. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Okv ngonu ninyia Israel am ringlin laji kunv vla mvngtin nyato! hum mvnwng am mimabv, vbvrikunamv silu si alu loum dukunv. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Anvnyimv megonv ngonua lamrwpamupv; bunu doonyi nyika dubv nyibunglo vngto, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Vbvritola ninyigv svma nga kaapama. Bunu vngkorla mintoku bunu nyikrw bv nyidogingdung vdwa kaapvnv ho vdwv nw turkur pvkunv vla bunua mintam toku. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Ngonugv lokv megonv nyibunglo vngla kaanam v anvnyimv vdwgv minam rungbv kaapatoku, vbvritola bunu ninyia kaapa mato.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu bunua mintoku, “Vdwgo nonu pvcha dukunv, nyijwk vdwgv minam a nonu mvngjwng dubv tapv dunv! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Hv Kristo ninyigv yunglit lo aanam lvgabv hinching chingma svngvri?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Okv Jisu ninyigv lvgabv Darwknv Kitap mvnwnglo Moses gv kitap lokv minrapla nyijwk vdwgv lvknam lobv minpv nama bunua minbwk jitoku.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Bunugv nampum vnglwkjiku gv nvchilo bunu vngrilo Jisu vbv ritoku nw adubv vngtv dvnv aingbv; <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Vbvritola bunu ninyia mintung gvrila, minto, “Ngonua lvkobv doomwng gvlaka; alu v tungtv yanv vngro pvku okv si kanv putv duku.” Vkvlvgabv nw doomwng gvdubv vla bunua vngming gvtoku. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Nw bunua lvkobv dvmwng gvdubv vla dootung toku, vtwng nga naatoku, okv bokta doolwk dubv minto; vbvrikunamv nw vtwng nga pintung toku okv bunua jitoku. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Vbvrikunamv bunugv nyik v nyiktar toku okv bunu ninyia kaachin toku, vbvritola nw bunugv kaaku lokv nyetoku. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Bunu mimisuto, “Lamtvlo nw gv ngonua gaam raarilo okv Darwknv kitap a minbwk jirilo ngonua vmv gunam jvbv rimapvi?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Bunu vjakgobv gudungto okv Jerusalem lo vngkur toku, hoka bunu lvbwlaksu vring gola akin a paami sutoku kvvbi vdwa lvkobv doobam sidubv <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>okv minto, “Ahtu jvjv bv turrap rungpvku! Nw Saimon nyika kaarwk supv!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Nyi anyiv lamtvlo ogugo ripv kudw hum bunua minpa jitoku, okv Ahtu gv vtwng nga pintung rilo bunu oguaing bv kaachin pvkudw humka.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa kaarwk sitoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mt 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Nyim 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Vdwlo anyi gv sum mintam rilo, lamdubv Jisu atubongv bunugv dookulo daklwk toku okv bunua minto, “Nonu gvlo mvngpu v lvkobv doolaka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">okv bunua minto, “Nonu gvlo mvngpu v lvkobv doolaka</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Bunu achialvbv lamrwpatoku bunu vram go kaadunv vla mvngto. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Vbvritola nw bunua minto, “Nonu ogubv lamdunv? Ogubv so gv mvngjwng manamv nonugv haapoklo aapvnv? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Ngoogv lvpa okv ngoogv laak am kaatoka okv kaakato si ngo kuna. Ngam mvsit toka, okv nonu chinreku, nonugv ngam kaanam aingbv vram v adwnayak okv loobung gvma doonv.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Nw vbv mintam toku okv nw gv lvpa okv nwgv laak am bunua kaatam toku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:40: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado bars 40 ngv</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Bunu vjaklodvbv mvngjwng nyuma toku, bunu achialvbv mvngpubv okv lamrwpanam bv ritoku; vkvlvgabv nw bunua tvkato, “Nonu so dvse go dooma lare?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Bunu ninyia ngui nunv go jito, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>hum nw naagvrila okv bunugv kaakulo dvtoku.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Vbvrikunamv nw bunua mintoku, “So gv sum ngoogv nonua lvkobv riri hoka minam v: ngoogv lvga mvnwngnga Moses gv Pvbv lo lvkpv, nyijwk vdwgv lvknam loka okv mirimimpak minam loka v jvjvbv aarung jinv.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Vbvrikunamv nw bunugv haapok a Darwknv Kitap a chimu dukubv mvkok toku, <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>okv bunua minto, “So svbv lvkpvnv: Kristo hingching chirungre okv alu loum kochinglo sinam lokv turrap reku, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>okv ninyigv amin lokv mvngdin okv rimur a mvngnga kunamgv doin a Jerusalem lokv rirap laila, mooku mvnwnglo japgo reku. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Nonu kuna so vdw sum mingo yajikunv. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Nyim 1:4</ref></char></note>Okv ngo Atu v ngo Abu gv milv nama nonu gvlo jilu jire. Vbvritola nonu pamtv lo kaayala doorung laka aotolokv jwkrw v nonu gvlo aalwkma dvdvlobv.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Nyidomooku bv naacha kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mk 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Nyim 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Nyim 1:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vbvrikunamv nw bunua pamtv agum lo lingv toku Betani jebv adu lo, hoka nw ninyigv laak v idungto okv bunua boktalwkji toku. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Nw bunua aya jidung dvla, nw bunua vngyu toku okv nyidomooku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">okv nyidomooku bv naacha toku</char></note> bv naacha toku. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Bunu ninyia kumtoku okv Jerusalem bv vngkur toku, kairungbv mvngpu puingla, <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>okv bunugv rinam doonam mvnwngnga Pwknvyarnvnaam lo Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vla relwkdoolwk toku.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
